<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Macce</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mce</para>
  <para style="toc2">Macce</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Macce fiis</para>
  <para style="mt">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Macce fiis</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Macce ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. A namee teeku "Lewi". A nikee <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> wuu ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> wa Yeesu ɓeeɗuk ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:9-10">Macce 9:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:3">10:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:14-15">Maarko 2:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-29">Luk 5:27-29</ref></char></note> Fu jang teerndi ɗah, fu na hote ne a fiis wuu Yawuut ci. A kooɗiɗ woo laayiɗ ŋ Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Koc</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Macce, wi a na fiise teerndii, a camb na limiŋ tiik ciŋ caac ciŋ Yeesu. A naandsukka findi Yeesu rimohu na in ci a haɓiɗ ŋ kehƴi, na in ci a jangɗoh, na kakaan kiŋ ɗe na hultiŋ ɗe. Yeesu yegɗeen ɓooɓa woo kiŋ Kooh, a wirɗeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca, a aañeeɗa <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniica</char>, a tumeeɗa in feyohiɗ ca uupee haf caŋ ɓooɓa. Ini a fiis, wa mand na ini Maarko na Luk fiis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Macce fiis kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi Yeesu rimohu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1–2:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓeeɗkohiŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ɓoktukaŋ Yeesu na findi Seytaani jaɗɗohee ɗe fiir <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:12-4:11">3:12–4:11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nikaŋ Yeesu ŋ Galile na ɓak caŋ <char style="w" lemma="Tiir">Tiir na Sidoon</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12–18:35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pulaŋ Yeesu Galile ne a kaɗ Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1–20:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Aasaŋ Yeesu Yerusalem po kakaan kiŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1–27:66</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Hultiŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-15">28:1-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Dengkohiŋ Yeesu yakki <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">28:16-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Faseehiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Cii ceɗ tiik ciŋ caacuuciŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kiristaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: marka ini fiisu ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Mucɗohi Gapohse ŋ aaya 16.</char></note>, setiŋ Dawuuda, setiŋ Ibrahiima.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Ibrahiima a yi rim Isaahha,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:1-3">Camba 21:1-3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:2">Isaahha rimmba Yaŋhooɓa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:21-26">Camba 25:21-26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:2">Yaŋhooɓa rimmba Yudaa na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israayel ci raakeen cuuɓ ndaŋkiyaah na cuuɓ kanak (12). Yudaa, na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci, ɓeɗ caac ciŋ cuuɓ ceem.</char></note>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31-30:24">Camba 29:31–30:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:16-18">35:16-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yudaa rimmba Seerah na Peeres, a rim ɓa na Tamaar.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38">Camba 38</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:3">Peeres rimmba Hesroon,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Camba 46:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:3">Hesroon rimmba Raam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:19">Riit 4:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Raam rimmba Aminadaab,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:19">Riit 4:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadaab rimmba Nahson,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:7">Kind ci 1:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:4">Nahson rimmba Salmon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:20">Riit 4:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmon rimmba Boos, a rim ɗe na Rahab,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:21">Riit 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2">Yosuwe 2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:5">Boos rimmba Obed, a rim ɗe na Riit,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:13-17">Riit 4:13-17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:5">Obed rimmba Yesay.<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yesay rimmba Dawuuda buuri,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:22">Riit 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:11-13">1 Samuwel 16:11-13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6"/>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawuuda rimmba Suleymaan, a rim ɗe na ɓiti Uri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawuuda faankeen na ɓiti ƴaari na woyse Uri, ɓitɓeem taambohha nga ammba rook. Dawuuda appa ƴaar ce, a tokka ɗe ɓitiɓ. Wa nikee bakaaɗ yakiɗ. Wa kuɓka rimuk, Kooh tummba a pesɗi, waaye kuɓkiŋ ɓa kanakɗoh Kooh teyɗukiɗ ɗe, a yi tumsee buur wi baab ɓa Dawuuda kuruk nga. Kuɓkeem a yi Suleymaan (marka teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 11:2-12:24">2 Samuwel 11:2–12:24</ref></char>).</note>.<verse eid="MAT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Suleymaan rimmba Robowaam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiik ci amboh Suleymaan po ŋ Sorobabel, ini uup ŋ tiik ceem, ca ɗi ŋ teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 3:10-19">1 Nguur ci 3:10-19</ref></char>.</note>,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:7">Robowaam rimmba Abiya,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:7">Abiya rimmba Asaf.<verse eid="MAT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaf rimmba Yosafat,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:8">Yosafat rimmba Yoram,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:8">Yoram rimmba Osiyas<verse eid="MAT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Osiyas rimmba Yotam,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotam rimmba Ahas,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahas rimmba Esekiyaas<verse eid="MAT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Esekiyaas rimmba Manasse,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:10">Manasse rimmba Amon,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon rimmba Yosiyaas<verse eid="MAT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosiyaas rimmba Yekoñas na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ŋ jamanoona Israayel ci toorsee Babilon.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Ŋ finho tooruukaŋ ɓa Babilon, Yekoñas rimmba Salacel,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:12">Salacel rimmba Sorobabel<verse eid="MAT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Sorobabel rimmba Abiyud,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:13">Abiyud rimmba Eliyakim,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyakim rimmba Asoor<verse eid="MAT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Asoor rimmba Sadok,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadok rimmba Ahiim,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:14">Ahiim rimmba Eliyud<verse eid="MAT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliyud rimmba Eleyasaar,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleyasaar rimmba Mattaan,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:15">Mattaan rimmba Yakob,<verse eid="MAT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakob rimmba Suseef yi ƴaar Maryaama yi rim Yeesu, Yeesu yi na woyse <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mucɗohi Gapohse </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: "<char style="tl">Masiyah</char>" ŋ heber, weɗ toksu ndii "Mucɗohi Gapohse". Farañse toksoha "<char style="tl">Messie</char>", waar, "<char style="tl">Almasi bi</char>", weɗ ɓoyi kooɗu, ɓoyi yiifu diw ŋ hafiŋ ɗe ne a tufkiɗu findi buur wala <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> wuu Kooh wala woosuuɗ ŋ Israayel (marka teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 40:12-15">Pula 40:12-15</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1-13">1 Samuwel 16:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:16">1 Buur ci 19:16</ref></char>). Ɓi woosuuɗ, findi Esayi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Esayi 61:1</ref></char>) na Dañeel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 9:26">Dañeel 9:26</ref></char>), woyeen ne "ɓo' yiifuuɗ" - yii hay, a hey mucɗe ɓooɓiŋ Kooh, waaye ɓa woyeeɗi andi a na hee nike buur wala seeƴkiɗoh wala woosuuɗ wala in wiiriis. Ɓi uup ŋ Israayel ci kosee ne ɓoyeem na hee ɓa mucɗe ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char>, te ɓa nikee sekeeɗa ɗe keeh-keeh. Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char> teeɓoh ne e Yeesu Mucɗohi Gapohse, yi woosuuɗ ci woye, waaye muci a haytoh mandɗi na wa ɓooɓa liiɓe. Ŋ gerek, "ɓo' yiifuuɗ" na woyse "Kiristaa" te wa kaɗta po haa ne wa tiik nga ɗe. Kaɗta po wa nikka tiik ɗah, ɓoo na toksoheeɗi wa "Mucɗohi Gapohse", ɓoo na faɗe tiiki "Kiristaani" nga.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Fu marak ɗah, ca gomal ndaŋkiyaah na gomal nikiis (14) ŋ ini amboh ŋ Ibrahiima po ŋ Dawuuda. Ini nam kooɗoh ŋ Dawuuda po ŋ tooruukaŋ ɓooɓa ŋ Babilon ca gomal ndaŋkiyaah na gomal nikiis (14). Te ŋ tooruukaŋ ɓooɓa ŋ Babilon po ŋ Mucɗohi Gapohse ca gomal ndaŋkiyaah na gomal nikiis (14).<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, a raakohu an : Maryaama yi yaay ɓa, a Suseef nguɗee <char style="w">cakiim</char> nga ɗe ; waaye bala a tokan ɗe ɗah, wa nikka ne a rook ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ngaŋ heber na gerek, feruuɗ ci na hotkeeɗi, na puuɗsi, na liiɓ ɓo', ceɗ ɓaah tiik. Ŋ heber wa nikka "<char style="tl">ruwah</char>", ŋ gerek, wa nikka "<char style="tl">pnewma</char>". Kon, ɓa woo "<char style="tl">ruwahiŋ</char> Kooh wala <char style="tl">pnewmaaniŋ</char> Kooh ɗah, wa yooɓɗi tokis. A mand na liiɓi nik ŋ ɗooƴ Kooh, a mand na in ci na hotkeeɗi. Ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:2-4">Tum ci 2:2-4</ref></char> "<char style="tl">pnewmaaniŋ</char>" Kooh hayiɗ findi puuɗsi. A yi ɓoo teek "Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani" wala "Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh" ŋ saafi-saafi, waaye in ci kaahay ceem jen, ca ɗii ŋ ɗooƴi.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Suseef yi fiir ce nikee ɓo' yurhiɗ. Ŋ ineem a waaɗɗi ɗe wiñ, a tufukka ne a reehiɗ harmban ɓa, ɓa daka ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Wa a na liiɓsiɗohe ŋ ineem, malaaka Heɗ ɓoo teeɓukka ɗe ŋ heeƴ, woosa ɗe ne : « Suseef, setiŋ Dawuuda, kina neƴƴoh ɓay Maryaama ɓitiɓ, laam kuɓki nik ŋ rookiŋ ɗe a puloh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>A hey raake kuɓu ƴaar, teekaa ɗe Yeesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiikiŋ "Yeesu" tokis "Nikiɗi, a yi na mucɗohe".</char></note> laam a yi na hee mucɗe cuuɓiŋ ɗe ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. »<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Ineem raakohha ɗaa, ne woo kiŋ Heɗ ɓoo, wi a taambɗee ŋ nguɓ woosuuɗ, raak an :<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>« Cafƴi inahɗi ƴaar,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">hey ambe rook ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">a raak kuɓu ƴaar,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">yi teeksan Emanuwel »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Esayi 7:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">wi tokis : "Kooh yii na ɓoo".<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Wa Suseef yunuk, a haɓiɗta ini malaakaaniŋ Heɗ ɓoo nakee ɗe ; a ɓayya Maryaama ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Waaye a hunɗi na ɗe po findi yeem raakoh kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Yeesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓi heɗ haf hayiɗ ñaamke Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yeesu raakohu Betlehem ŋ kur kaŋ Yudee ŋ jamanoona Herod nikoh buur. Ɓi heɗ haf kurkohha pulohaaɗ-noh, ɓa hayya Yerusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Ɓa meeksoheeɗa an : « A nde kuɓki han raaku, yi nikan buuriŋ Yawuut ci ? Ɓoo hotiɗ horiŋ ɗe ŋ pulohaaɗ-noh. Te ɓoo hay ne ɓoo ñaamuk ɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Wa Herod buuri kerah ineem, a feyuusa lool, a yi na ɓi Yerusalem jen. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>A cohɗohha kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Musaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: woosuuɗi Musaa, a yi farañse na woye "<char style="tl">Moïse</char>". A raaku ŋ jamanoona Israayel ca tumohu <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ Misra weɗ "<char style="tl">Egypte</char>" woti-woti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:1-10">Pula 2:1-10</ref></char>). Musaa yeem, Kooh adgiɗee ɗe ne a pulɗoh Israayel ca ŋ kiñaamka ɓa nikohe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:10">Pula 3:10</ref></char>). Wi a puliɗ ɓa, Kooh eɗta ɗe ɓi nakoh laayiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ findi ɓa joy ɗe ñaamkoh na findi ɓa joy pesoh ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa. Musaa a yi fiis teereeci yatuus ci koc ŋ <char style="tl">Biibali</char> ci na woyse "<char style="tl">Tawreet</char>", wala "<char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char>".</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">waasiŋ Musaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: e teereeci yatuus ci koc ngaŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci ; ceem ceɗ na woyse <char style="tl">Tawreet</char>. Ca na woye findi Adina ferohu, hayiŋ bakaaɗ na kakaan, gaalaŋ Noohin na ambtiɗohi Kooh tufkiɗ na adinaani jen, ɓeeɗkiŋ Kooh na Ibrahiima, na ambtiɗohi a tufkiɗ na ɗe na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe, cambohaaniŋ cuuɓiŋ Israayel, na ambtiɗohi Kooh tufkiɗ na ɓa. Ŋ ɗooƴ ambtiɗoheem, Kooh gapeen ɓa ɓi in laayiɗ, te a nameen ɓa eɗ nakoh ciŋ ɗe.</char></note> na jangɗohoh caŋ wa jen, a meekissa ɓa ɗiski <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> joy rimohu. <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A joy raakohu Betlehem ŋ Yudee ŋ ini woosuuɗi fiis wii :<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“ Fu Betlehem ŋ kur kiŋ Yudee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">fu ɓaahɗi muk ŋ ci uup ƴissuut ŋ kur ciŋ Yudee</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">sagu pulohi kilifaani pulohan nga ɗa, kilifaani niiɗan cuuɓiŋ ngo Israayel. ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Miise 5:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Herod ɓeeɗukka heɗ haf ca, a ɗaayya na ɓa, ne ɓa teeɓ ɗe hooliɗ, jamanooni hora hotkoh. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>A tuuƴca ɓa Betlehem, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ɗu meeksoha kuɓki meeksoh hooliɗ, ɗu hot ɗe ɗah, ɗu woo so, ŋ nam ɗe kaɗ ñaamka. »<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Wa heɗ haf ca sikɗuk buura po ƴutta, ɓa kaɗta. Hora ɓa hotee ŋ pulohaaɗ-noh pulissa, wa nikka ŋ fikiiɓa, wa kaɗeeɗa po wa tiimmba ɗiska kuɓka nik, wa tufukka. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Hora ɓa hotee, ɓa sumeen nga keeh-keeh po ɓa minisɗi.<verse eid="MAT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Ɓa aassa ŋ kahna, ɓa hotta kuɓka na Maryaama yaay ɓa ; ɓa ƴekiɗta Yeesu, ɓa ñaamukka Yeesu. Ɓa puliɗta alala ɓa ɓayndohe, ɓa eɗta ɗe urus, cuuraay na <char style="tl">miir</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">miir</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa cuuraay, wa na fuuɗseeɗi. Wa na woyse "<char style="tl">myrrhe</char>" ŋ farañse.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Ƴutta Kooh teeɓpa ɓa ŋ heeƴ ne, ɓa haadee ɗah, ɓa kinaat taamb ŋ Herod. Ɓa kooɗta waas wiiriis, ɓa dokukka kur ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suseef na Maryaama saandohiɗ ŋ Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Wa heɗ haf ca coot, malaaka Heɗ ɓoo teeɓukka Suseef ŋ heeƴ, a woosa ɗe ne : « Suseef, Herod hey nakohe kuɓki waaku ne a ap ɗe, mbaa kurka fu ɓay kuɓki na yaay ɓa, fu saandoh <char style="w">Misra</char>, fu nik nga po mbaɗna ŋ woyan na ɗa. » <verse eid="MAT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Suseef kurukka, a ɓayya kuɓka na yaay ɓa ŋ ɗooƴ weka, a kaɗta na ɓa Misra. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Ɓa nikka nga po Herod kaannda. Ŋ ineem, ina Heɗ ɓoo woyee raakka, woo ki a taambɗee ŋ nguɓ woosuuɗ an : « Ŋ ɓeeɗkiɗ kuɓkiŋ ngo ne a pul Misra.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hose 11:1</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Wa Herod inah ne heɗ haf ca ñaañoh ɗe ñaañoh, a ayrukka lool. A tuuƴohha ŋ kur kaŋ Betlehem na ina wila ne komaakca ƴaar ca raak kiis kanak ruhussa jen, apsaat. A kindoha ŋ jamanoona heɗ haf ca woyee ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Wa nikohha ɗaa findi woosuuɗi Yeremi woyohee wa, an :<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>« Hooso kerhuuɗ ŋ kur ki na woyse Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ca fuɗ laayiɗ na rooy keeh-keeh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">A Rasel na fuɗe komaakciŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ɓa kaaniɗ, weɗ tah a waaɗɗi giifɗu. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Yeremi 31:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Ŋ finho kakaan kaŋ Herod, malaaka Heɗ ɓoo teeɓukka Suseef ŋ heeƴ ŋ Misra, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>a woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka, fu ɓay kuɓki na yaay ɓa, ɗu dokuk Israayel, ɓooɓa waaɗee ɓay kiñin kiŋ ɗe ɓa kaaniɗ. » <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Suseef kurukka, a ɓayya kuɓka na yaay ɓa, a haadda Israayel. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Waaye wa a kerah ne e Arkelawus namsiɗ baab ɓa Herod ŋ hafaŋ kur kaŋ Yudee, a neƴƴohha kaɗ nga. Heɗ ɓoo woytohha ɗe ŋ heeƴ, ŋ ineem, a kaɗta Galile, <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>a gennda nga, ŋ kur ka na woyse Nasareet. Ina woosuuɗ ci woyee raakka, ne Mucɗohi Gapohse ɓeeɗkohsan ƴaariŋ ɓi Nasareet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucɗohi Gapohse ɓeeɗkohsan ƴaariŋ ɓi Nasareet : Ŋ Fiis ci ɗeɓgaan, ɗiski woo ki puloh, wa inhuuɗi.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Woo kiŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Ŋ kiis caam, <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yahya Ɓoktohi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi Saaŋ <char style="tl">Batiis</char> ŋ farañse.</char></note> hotukka ŋ nduufaŋ Yudee, a yegɗoheeɗa woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>A woyeeɗa ne : « Ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ, Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki reɓiɗ. » <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Yahya Ɓoktohi a yi woosuuɗi Esayi woyee an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">« Hooso wa ɗaa leehuk ŋ nduufa an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“ Paɗaat waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">haɓɗiɗaat ɗe waas ci, ca yurah ! ” »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esayi 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Yahya meeɗ ɓekuk kulɓa haɓɗohuuɗ find ngeelemb, a toka ŋ kinoh kiŋ ɗe na und.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:23">Malasi 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Buur ci 1:8</ref></char></note> A pesohee paƴ na yeeleel kuum. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Ɓooɓa genee Yerusalem, na ɓaŋ Yudee, na ɓaŋ ɓakaŋ Yurdan jen, hayeeɗa nga ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Ɓa teyɗukeeɗa bakaaɗ caŋ ɓa, a ɓokteeɗa ɓa ŋ kalaŋ Yurdan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Wa a hot ne ɓo' laayiɗ ɓaah ŋ ɓooɓi na woyse <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Farisen</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca nikee Yawuut ca meeɗ taambiɗ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> findi wa fiisohu, na mbaah ci ɓa ɓaatee nga, po ɓooɓa jen ambeen ne ɓa kosiɗ Kooh lool.</char></note> na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ini uup ŋ <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci nikee kilifa ŋ Yawuut ci. Ɓa koseeɗi ne kaaniɗ ci hey hulte (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Macce 22:23</ref></char>). Ɓa nameeɗi kos malaakaaci na <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Tum ci 23:8</ref></char>). Laayiɗ nga ɓa nikee <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ŋ waasiŋ Musaa, te ɓa ambee ne teereeci yatuus ciŋ Musaa, weɗ ne <char style="tl">Tawreet</char>, uupɗee Fiis ci cinooci njiriñ (marka teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 22:32">Macce 22:32</ref></char>, ɗiski Yeesu kooɗoh teereeciŋ Musaa ne a lof ɓa).</char></note> nikee hayeeɗa nga ɗe ne ɓa ɓoktu, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ini ɗu añaand haa ne iiñ jen, ɗu liiɓiɗ ne ɗu miniɗ penduk ayrukiŋ Kooh wi na haye e ? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu baahaat, wa teeɓoh ne ɗu ɓoƴsohiɗ pesohaaɗ. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Te kinaat ɗaar rek ɗu woyee ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu ne : “ Ɓoo rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima. ” Ñam na woyee ɗu ne, atoh cii, Kooh miniɗ pulɗiɗ Ibrahiima kuɓu nga ca. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Kiw ki ƴutiɗ ne wa giing tas kidig, te waa nu raakɗi rim baahiɗ ɗah, wa hey ƴoɓse, wa njafu ŋ yongkaaha.<verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Mi na ɓoktee ɗu ŋ masuɓ ne ɗu ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ. Waaye raakiɗ ɓoyi na haye ŋ finhooso, a yi uup po fuuf, te woliɗ ɗe ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗe joombiɗ to. A yi, a ɓoktohan ɗu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na yongkaah. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>A amb saliŋ ɗe ŋ yaah, ne a nistoh pees na fuñind. A nangɗoh pees ciŋ ɗe ŋ ndap, a doh fuñndi ŋ yongkaahi heyɗi ƴime. »<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu teyɗukiɗ ɓokti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Ŋ neeh caam, Yeesu pulohha Galile, a kaɗta kalaŋ Yurdan ŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi ne yeem ɓokit ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Waaye Yahya teyɗukɗi, woosa ɗe ne : « Ñam etoh ɓoktuk nga ɗa, fu hayee nga so ! » <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɗiski wa nik, faɗa wa nikoh an. Wa in moɗiɗ ne ɓoo mitɗoh ini Kooh nakoh jen an ! » Ŋ ineem Yahya teyɗukka.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Wa Yeesu ɓoktu po a pulla masma, jaarra Eel ci rangsukka, a hotta Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh yipkeeɗa nga ɗe findi banuut. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Hooso kerhukka ŋ Eel ci an : « Yii, a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ngo</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: findi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyoha, ŋ camba, e Kooh dong nikee te Yeesu yi Woo kiŋ ɗe, nikee nga ɗe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1">Saaŋ 1</ref></char>). Yeesu, findi a hayoh Adina, wa ɗalohiɗ na findi ɓooɓi na hayohe nga ; a raakɗi baabu ŋ kehƴi. A Kooh tum po a rimukka ŋ ɓitiɓ inhaaɗi ƴaar te malaakaani gapoh raakuukiŋ ɗe woo ne a hey ɓeeɗkohse Kuɓkiŋ yi Ɗafkiɗi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Macce 1:18-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:26-56">Luk 1:26-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:1-20">2:1-20</ref></char>) kon ini a puloh ŋ Kooh weɗ tah a ɓeeɗkohsee Kuɓkiŋ Kooh. Kuɓkiŋ Kooh, wa tokisɗi ne Kooh ɓay faan a rimmba kuɓu na ɓitiɓ findi ɓo'.</char></note> ŋ waaɗ keeh-keeh, yi neɓ po ŋ keeñ. »<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Seytaani jaɗɗiɗ Yeesu fiir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Ŋ ineem, <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> ɓayya Yeesu ŋ nduufa, ne Seytaani jaɗiɗ ɗe fiir. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>A orra noh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) na wek ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) ; ŋ mirndaani a aɗukka. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Seytaani, yi na jaɗɗohe fiir, reɓpa woosa ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, woya atoh cii, ca ɓoƴsuk mbuuru. » <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">“ Ɓo' na pesohe mbuuru dong haa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">waaye na woo nu nik ne wa puloh ŋ nguɓiŋ Kooh ɗah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Rohƴiɗi 8:3</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Seytaani ɓayya ɗe Yerusalem, ŋ jol <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahnaŋ Kooh</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kahan Kooh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: farañse na woyee wa "<char style="tl">temple</char>". Kahan Kooh wa nikee inaa yakiɗ. Wa nikee tuuƴ angiɗ na ɗisik ca wilee wa. Tuuƴa raakee ɓak kanak, saɓsohuuɗ na rido (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:33">Pula 26:33</ref></char>). Ŋ ɗooƴa ɗooƴa, weɗ teeksee Ɗiska Hoolohngaana ; a <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗohi</char> yakki dong meeɗ aas nga te wa meeɗ nik waas yino ŋ kiis ki (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 6">Lewiici 6</ref></char>). Ɓaki tas teeksee Ɗiska Hooliɗa. A seeƴkiɗohi joy panguk mbehiŋ ɗe dong (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:8-9">Luk 1:8-9</ref></char>) na aase nga ne a suus cuuraay (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 30">Pula 30</ref></char>), a fuuɗ laampa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Pula 27:20-21</ref></char>), a deg mbuuruuci (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:30">Pula 25:30</ref></char>). Raakka ɗiska wila te seeƴkiɗoh ci dong na nike nga ; seeƴkohaana nikee nga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 40:6">Pula 40:6</ref></char>). Seeƴkohaaneem, weɗ dong ɓooɓa joye <char style="w">seeƴkoh</char>. Kahniŋ Kooh weem, wa wa koc haɓɗu, wa nikee <char style="w">ɗiip</char>. E <char style="w">Musaa</char> haɓɗee wa. A marak ŋ wa Kooh teeɓee ɗe ŋ ɗafuk tangoora (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:30">Pula 26:30</ref></char>) po wiŋ kehƴi nikka ñaamaariŋ wa keeh-keeha nik ŋ Eel ci (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 8:5">Heber ci 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Teeɓ ki 11:19</ref></char>). Wi Suleymaan hay, a taɓahhaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 5-6">1 Buur ci 5–6</ref></char>). Ɓi Babilon yahrohhaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 36:19">2 Nguur ci 36:19</ref></char>). Weɗi Israayel ci tufkiɗohisa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 1-6">Esdaras 1–6</ref></char>). <char style="w">Gerek</char> ci yahrohissaa. Buur, ŋ buur ci teeksee Herod, tufkiɗissaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:20">Saaŋ 2:20</ref></char>), weem, weɗ nikee Kahan Kooh ŋ jamanoonaŋ Yeesu. Ŋ jamanoonaam, ɗiska ƴaar ciŋ Israayel nike, weɗ wilee ɗiska seeƴkiɗoh ca nike. Aasohaanaŋ ɗiskeem weɗ ɗiska ɓitiɓ ca meeɗ nik. Ina wilee wa ɓak po ɓak weɗ nikee ɗiskaŋ ɓooɓa nikɗi Yawuut. Wa hannda wilɗu jameet na miir raakiɗ yahndeer ŋ ɓak ci nikiis ci jen.</char></note> ; <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>a woosa ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ɗah, faɗsuka ŋ kehƴi. Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">“ Kooh hey nake malaakaaciŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ca ɓay ɗa ŋ yaah ciŋ ca</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">po kot ciŋ ɗa laɓkanɗi ŋ atoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Sabuur 91:11-12</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fiis ci namiɗ woo ne : “ Fu joyɗi markisuk Heɗ ɓoo, Koohiŋ ɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Rohƴiɗi 6:16</ref></char></note> ” » <verse eid="MAT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Seytaani rapɗissa ɗe ŋ jol tango njooloh na njooloh. A teeɓpa ɗe nguur ciŋ adinaani jen na yaki ca yak. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>A woosa ɗe ne : « In cii jen, fu ƴekiɗ to ne fu ñaamuk ko ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa ca one. » <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Seytaani, us so ! Fiis ci woyiɗ ne : “ Ƴekɗa Kooh Heɗ fu, te fu ñaamuk a yi dong.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Rohƴiɗi 6:13</ref> </char></note> ” » <verse eid="MAT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Weɗ Seytaani faɗoh ɗe ndaam, jaarra malaakaaca hayya, taambkoheeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu cambiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe ŋ Galile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Ŋ jamanoonaam, <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> ambseen ŋ kasoona ; wa Yeesu keraha, a kaɗta Galile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>A kurkohha Nasareet a kaɗta gena ŋ Kapernawum ŋ sero cookma, ŋ kehƴaŋ cuuɓ ciŋ Sabuloon na Naftaali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Jaarra ini woosuuɗi Esayi woyee raakka, an :<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>« Kehƴiŋ Sabuloon na Naftaali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">wa nikka yaah-cookmi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">ŋ ɓakiŋ Yurdan winoori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">weɗ Galile, kur kiŋ ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut,<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>cuuɓi ɓoofee ŋ ñuusi hotiɗ siñaar yakak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">te ɓi ɓoofee ŋ kur ki kakaan ki ñuusiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">siñaar hayiɗ nga ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Esayi 8:23–9:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Ini amboh ndeem, Yeesu cammba woytoh ɓooɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waas Kooh an : « Ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ, Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki reɓiɗ. »<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓeeɗkiɗ ɓi seeɓoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu tiindeeɗa ŋ sereendaŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, a hotta seeɓoh kanak mbaaleeɗa cuurund ŋ cookma, ɓa nikee Simong yi na woyse Piyeer na taambɗoh ce Andare. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ñaakɗaat to, ŋ hey ɗu tume seeɓoh ɓo'. » <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Ɓa jaarra faɗ mbaal caŋ ɓa ndaam, ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>A kaɗissa ƴissuut, a hotissa taambɗoh kanak, Saak na Saaŋ, kuɓuuciŋ Sebede, a raak ɓa ŋ gaala na baab ɓa, ɓa haɓiɗtineeɗa mbaal caŋ ɓa. A ɓeeɗukka ɓa ne ɓa hun na ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Ɓa jaarra faɗ gaala na baab ɓa, ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ kosaayiɗ laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yeesu wileeɗa Galile jen a jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: taɓah ci Yawuut ci na cohohe ne ɓa ñaamuk Kooh nga te ɓa jangee waas Kooh nga. Ɓa namee ngel nga ne leeroh raakka nga ɓa ɗah.</char></note> ca, a woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yegɗohiŋ Muci </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ "<char style="tl">Lewañsili</char>" wala "<char style="tl">Injil</char>". Ɓoo toksoh woo keem ɗaa ŋ saafi-saafi.</char></note>, wi kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, a wirɗeeɗa kosaay ca na ɓeenduk ca jen, ca ambee ɓooɓa. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Laamtohiŋ tiikiŋ ɗe willa kur kaŋ Siri jen. A komuusa ɓooɓa raakee miskiɗ jen sagu kosaay ca ambee ɓa, kosaay nu wa min nik ɗah, ɓa <char style="w">jiini</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jiini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: findi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci jangɗohoha, feruuɗ ci minɗi hotu jen, ca nikee malaaka wa ca na ferse. Cum nga bakaaɗta, ca njafuusa ŋ kehƴi. Ceem, ceɗ ɓoo tokis "jiini". E Seytaani kilifaaniŋ ca. Marka teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:31">Camba 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:11-19">Esekiyeel 28:11-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maarko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:17-20">Luk 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:3-12">Teeɓ ki 12:3-12</ref></char>.</char></note> ambe, ɓa raakee kombeɗ-mbeɗ na ɓa lafñe, a wiriɗta ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Mboolo laayiɗ ñaakiɗta ɗe, ɓooɓeem pulohee Galile, Dekapool<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapool </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa nikee kur-taah ndaŋkiyaah nangɗukohiɗ. Ɓooɓi genee nga, ɓa nikee Yawuut haa, ɓa taambɗeeɗi <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char>.</char></note>, Yerusalem, Yudee, na ɓaka faahaŋ Yurdan.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓooɓi neɓɗiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Wa Yeesu hot mboolnda, a rappa ŋ tangoora, a ɓooffa nga. Taalubeeciŋ ɗe reɓpa nga ɗe, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>a jangɗeeɗa ɓa in cii an :<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>« Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi ruhsiɗ haf ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">ɓa inahha ne ɓa etohiɗ Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">laam Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki wa wuu ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi na fuɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">laam ɓa hey giifɗasse.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi soosiɗ ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">laam ɓeɗ eɗsan kehƴi.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi aɗuk, sifaɗukka kipes yurhiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">laam ɓa hey hiƴe, ɓa kap nding.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi na yirmohe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">laam Kooh hey ɓa yirme.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi raak keeñ hooliɗ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">laam ɓa hey hote Kooh.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi na waake jam ŋ harmban ɓooɓi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">laam ɓa hey ɓeeɗkohse kuɓu Kooh.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓooɓi na mbugalse sagu yurhi ɓa yurah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">laam Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki wa wuu ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>Ɗu neɓɗiɗ, ne ɓooɓi ɓasee ɗu, ɓa mbugalee ɗu, ɓa leyɗohee ɗu na woo moɗaaɗi'iɗ nu nik saguuso ɗah. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Sumaat keeh-keeh, laam aafi na sekee ɗu ŋ ɗafka yakiɗ, te ɗu inah ne ɓa mbugalohee woosuuɗ ci adug ɗu ɗaa.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Meɗaami na siñaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>E ɗu meɗaamiŋ Adina. Waaye meɗa kaɗ po wa jemisɗi ɗah, wa min jemɗohissu na ye ? Wa na raakisseeɗi etoh ɗal, wa mbetu, ɓooɓi dakee nga.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>E ɗu siñaariŋ adinaani, kur ki nik ŋ jol tango, wa minɗi ɗembɗu. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Te ali ɓo' na fuuɗeeɗi laampa ne a kuna na kanoh, a degana kay ŋ degohaaniŋ wa ne wa ñiiniɗ ɓi tuuƴi jen. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Siñaariŋ ɗu joy ñiinoh ɗaa ŋ fiki ɓooɓi, ne ɓa hot tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu baahiɗ ci, ɓa yakiɗ Kooh Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ Eel ci.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ waasiŋ Musaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>Kinaat liiɓ ne ŋ hay ne ŋ nihis <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> wala woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci, ŋ hayɗi ne ŋ nihis ca, waaye ŋ hay ne ŋ tum in ci ɓa woo po ca mit. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh. Feeh kehƴi na eel ci kurukɗi nga ɗah, ali in nihsukanɗi ŋ waasi po mbaɗna wa mitan. Wa fiisi uup ƴissuut nga haa, wa tap haa.<verse eid="MAT 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Weɗ tah po ɓo' nu taambiɗɗi wi uup ƴissuut ŋ nakoh ci te a woyee ɓooɓi ne ɓa joyɗaa taambiɗ ɗah, a hey nike yi uup ƴissuut ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki. Waaye ɓo' nu taambiɗ ca te a jangɗee ɓooɓi ne ɓa taambiɗ ca ɗah, a hey yake ngaŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ɗu uupɗi yurah jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ci ɗah, ɗu aasanɗi ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ ayrukoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>Ɗu kerhiɗ ne ɓooɓa ɗeɓgaan woysee ne : “ Kina ap ɓo'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Pula 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Rohƴiɗi 5:17</ref></char></note> ; ɓo' nu apoh ɗah, a hey atte'se. ” <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne, ɓo' nu ayruk ɓaah ce ɗah, a hey atte'se. Te ɓo' nu woo ɓaah ce ne : “ Hafiŋ ɗa riifɗi ” ɗah, a hey ɓayse ŋ atte'oh ciŋ waasi. Te ɓo' nu woo ɓaah ce ne : “ Fu dof ” ɗah, a hey ɓekse ŋ yongkaaha yakka.<verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Ŋ ineem, fu ɓayee ini fu eɗoh wuu Kooh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkohaana</char>, fu naandsuk ne ɓaah fu ambɗiɗ ɗa in ɗah, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>faɗaa ŋ fiki seeƴkohaana, fu kaɗ kerhiɗoha na ɗe po ƴut, fu hana hay dege.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>Ara kerhiɗoh na ɓoyi, ne a ɓayee ɗa waas ɗah. Fu tumɗaa ŋ waasi po ɗu ree ngelohaana ɗah, a hey ɗa ɓaye ŋ atte'ohi, yeem eɗ ɗa alkaateeni, fu ɗaaku ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Ñam na woyee ɗa wa te wa keeh, fu pulohanɗi ndaam feeh fu wirindɗi po ŋ darmi uup ƴissuut ɗah.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ njaaloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>Ɗu kerhiɗ ne wa woyuuɗ ne : “ Fu njaaloo'anɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Pula 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Rohƴiɗi 5:18</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne, ɓo' nu marak ɓitiɓ, a hemem ɗe ɗah, a njaaloo'iɗ na ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ ce po ƴutiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Hasiŋ ɗa ñaahmi waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, nihsaa fu mbeta ; cir yino nihsuk ŋ faaniŋ ɗa, weɗ ngisoh wa jen, wa mbetu ŋ yongkaaha yakka. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Yaahiŋ ɗa ñaahmi waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, nguɗaa jameet fu mbeta ; cir yino nihsuk ŋ faaniŋ ɗa, weɗ ngisoh wa jen, wa kaɗ ŋ yongkaaha.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ saɓsukoh na ɓitiɓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>Wa namiɗ woyuuɗ ne : “ Ɓo' nu faɗ ɓitiice ɗah, a eɗaat ɗe kayti teeɓoha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Rohƴiɗi 24:1</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Waaye e ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ƴaar nu saɓsukoh na ɓitiice te nikɗi ne yeem njaaloo njaaloo ɗah, a yi ɓek ɗe ŋ njaaloo. Te ɓo' nu ɓay ɓitiɓ faɗuuɗ ɗah, a njaaloo'iɗ.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ giñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>Ɗu namiɗ kerah ne ɓooɓa ɗeɓgaan woysee ne : “ Fu giñ in ɗah, kinaa nik tumaaɗi. In nu fu giñiɗ Heɗ ɓoo ɗah, tumaa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lewiici 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:3">Kind ci 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:22-24">Rohƴiɗi 23:22-24</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne, kinaat giñ delem. Kinaat giñ ŋ ɗafki, laam ɓoofohaaniŋ Kooh, yi buur waa nga. <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>Kinaat giñ ŋ kehƴi, wa degoha kot ciŋ ɗe. Kinaat giñ ŋ Yerusalem, wa kur kiŋ Kooh, yi Buuri yakki. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Te hafiŋ ɗa, kina giñ nga laam fu minɗi yaanwiɗ, fu minɗi suussiɗ find yino nga. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Ɗu woo "ee" ɗah, wa nikaat "ee" ; ɗu woo "a'aa" ɗah, wa nikaat "a'aa". In nu ɗu deg nga ɗah, wa puloh Seytaani.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini kaɗ ŋ wirndiɗkoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>Ɗu kerhiɗ ne wa woyuuɗ ne : “ Has, e has na wirndee wa ; sis, e sis na wirndee wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Pula 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lewiici 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Rohƴiɗi 19:21</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne, kinaat wirndiɗkoh na ɓoyi na tumee ɗu in miskiɗ. Ɓo' laɓ ɗa paɗ ŋ kaɓaaɓ ñaahum ɗah, eɗaa ɗe wi tas. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Te ɓo' waaɗ ɗa ɓay waas ne a naaf kulɓaakiŋ ɗa ƴini ɗah, nama ɗe eɗ paltooniŋ ɗa. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Ɓo' tiindɗukoh ɗa ŋ doole <char style="tl">kilomeet</char> yino ɗah, tiinda na ɗe kanak. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Ɓo' kiim ɗa ɗah, onaa ɗe te kina sang ɓand ɓoyi na ɓandukee ɗa.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waaɗ ɓi sang ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>Ɗu kerhiɗ ne wa woyuuɗ ne : “ Waaɗa morom fu,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref></char></note> fu sang ɓoyi sang ɗa. ” <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne, waaɗaat ɓooɓi sang ɗu, ɗu kiimɗee ɓooɓi na torhiɗee ɗu in baahiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Ŋ ndeem, ɗu hey teeɓohe ne ɗu kuɓuuciŋ Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ Eel ci, laam a na pulɗe puliɗ nohiŋ ɗe ŋ añaandiɗ ci na baahiɗ ci, a na toɓɗe toɓiɗ yurhiɗ ci na yurhaaɗiici.<verse eid="MAT 5:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Moo, ɗu waaɗ ɓooɓi waaɗ ɗu dong ɗah, ɗu car ye aafaah ŋ ineem ? Juuti'oh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">juuti'oh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoona ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> degoh kur laayiɗ yaah, ɓa tufkiɗeen juuti'oh ŋ kur laayiɗ ne ɓa meeksohiɗ buuriŋ Rom juuti. Ineem weɗ tah, ɓo' laayiɗ sangee sang juuti'oh ceem.</char></note> ci sah na tumohe ɗaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Te ɗu kañɗee ɓaah ciŋ ɗu dong ɗah, ɗu haɓiɗ ye ini haɓɗohuuɗi ? Ɓooɓi kosɗi Kooh sah na tumohee ɗaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Kon kinaat raak sikka findi Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ ɗafki raakohɗi sikka.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓo' joy onohoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>Wortukaat, kinaat teeɓoh kiyurhiŋ ɗu ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ne ɓa hot ɗu, ɗu tuma ɗah, ɗu rahsanɗi aafiŋ Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ Eel ci.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>Te fu onee ñakiɗ ci ɗah, kina tip haan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">"tip haan" </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ndii, ini fiisu ŋ gerek, wa "kuluɓ".</char></note> ne ɓooɓi hot ɗa ; findi naafeehaaci na tumohee wa ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci na ɗisik ci mbeeddaaci coh ne ɓa waak tiik. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓa rahsiɗ aafiŋ ɓa po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="MAT 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Waaye fu sarhohee ɗah, yaahiŋ ɗa singi kinaat inah ini yaahiŋ ɗa ñaahmi na haɓɗe, <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>ne sarhiŋ ɗa nik ini ɗemb, te Baab ɗu, yi na hote ŋ ini ɗemb, hey ɗa aafe.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓo' joy kiimoh Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>Ɗu kiimee Kooh ɗah, kinaat mand na naafeehaaci, ɓi inah ne ɓa kiimee Kooh ɗah, ɓa na waaɗe tufuk ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="tl">sinaagog</char> ci na ɗisik ci mbeeddaaci coh, ne ɓa teeɓ ɓooɓi jen ne ɓii kiim Kooh. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓa rahsiɗ aafiŋ ɓa po ƴutiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Waaye fu, fu kiimee Kooh ɗah, aasa ŋ ɗooƴ tuuƴ fu, fu rang yahndeeri, fu kiim Baab ɗu, yi nik ŋ ɗiski ɗemb, yi na hote ŋ ɗiski ɗemb, a hey ɗa aafe.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>Te ɗu kiimee Kooh ɗah, kinaat amb ŋ woo yino, ɗu woyee wa, ɗu woyissee wa findi ɓooɓi inahɗi Kooh ; ɓa liiɓ ne e woo kiŋ ɓa laayɗi weɗ na hee ɓa tahe teyɗukɗu. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Kinaat mand na ɓa, laam Baabiŋ ɗu inhiɗ ini ɗu etoh bala ɗu kiiman ɗe ɗah. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Weɗ tah kiimohaat Kooh an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Baabiŋ ɓoo yi ŋ Eel ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">tiikiŋ ɗa teyɗuksaat ne wa tiik hooliɗ.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Nguuriŋ ɗa hayaat.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Ini fu waaɗ raakaat ŋ kehƴi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">findi wa raakoh ŋ Eel ci.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Ona ɓoo kañam ki ɓoo etoh woti.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Ɗaasa ɓoo ɗal ci ɓoo na ɗalee ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">findi ɓoo na ɗaasohe ɓi na ɗale ɓoo.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Te kina tum po ɓoo jaɗɗu fiir.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Waaye mucɗa ɓoo ŋ yi baahaaɗi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ya fu Heɗ Nguur, na hatil na kiyak po faw, Amiin.]<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>Inhaat ne ɗu ɗaas ɓooɓi na tumee ɗu in moɗaaɗi ɗah, Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ ɗafki hey ɗu namee ɗaas tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu moɗaaɗiici ; <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>waaye ɗu ɗaasɗi ɓooɓi ɗah, a heyɗi ɗu namee ɗaas.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓo' joy oroh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>Ɗu oree ɗah, kinaat teeɓ ɓooɓi ne ɗu na haɓɗe in miskiɗ, findi naafeehaaci na tumohee wa. Ɓa oreesa ɗah, ɓa ñuusiɗ fikiiciŋ ɓa ne ɓa teeɓ ɓooɓi jen ne ɓa oriɗ. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓa rahsiɗ aafiŋ ɓa po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="MAT 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Waaye fu, fu oree ɗah, muktuka, fu laackoloñuk, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>ne fu teeɓuu ɓooɓi ne fu na ore, waaye Baab ɗu yi nik ŋ ɗiski ɗemb, yi na hote ŋ ɗiski ɗemb, a hey ɗa aafe.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini joy waaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>Kinaat nangɗoh raak-raak ŋ Adina, ɗiski inah ne ñuhuk miniɗa yahroh wala wa hoy, wala rokoh ci ngul, ɓa aas, ɓa roka. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Waaye nangɗohaat raak-raak ŋ Eel ci, ɗiska fu inah ne ñuhuk minɗaa yahroh, wa hoyanɗi te rokoh minɗi ngul, a aas ne a roka. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Inhaat ne ɗiski raak-raakiŋ ɗa nik, keeñiŋ ɗa na name nik nga.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>Has weɗ laampaaniŋ faan. Hasiŋ ɗa wir ɗah, faaniŋ ɗa jen nikan ŋ siñaar. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Waaye hasiŋ ɗa wirɗi ɗah, faaniŋ ɗa jen nikan ŋ ñuus. Te ñiini nik nga ɗa jen nik ñuus ɗah, ñuuseem nikan taruus !<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>Ɓo' yino minɗi raak heɗ kanak, mbaa a hey waaɗe yino a sang yi tas, wala a ŋoɗ ŋ yii, a heef yi tas ; kon ɗu minɗi ñaamuk Kooh, ɗu ñaamkee raak-raak.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>Weɗ tah mi na woyee ɗu ne : Kinaat jaahiɗ ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗu, ŋ ini ɗu ñaman [na ini ɗu anan]. Kinaat jaahiɗ ŋ faan ciŋ ɗu, ŋ ini ɗu ɓekkan. Kipes uupiɗɗi kañam njiriñ e ? Te faan namɗi uupiɗ ɓekkaah njiriñ e ? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Markaat sel ci, ca na sokeeɗi, ca na nguɗeeɗi ; te ca raakɗi ndap ɗaakkoha, waaye Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ Eel ci yii ñamiɗ ca. Ɗu uupiɗɗi ca njiriñ e ?<verse eid="MAT 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Ya ɓa min jaahiɗ nga ɗu, po a ɓaat wahtu yino ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe ? <verse eid="MAT 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>Wa ye tah ɗu jaahɗe book ŋ ini ɗu ɓekkan ? Markaat paangfiŋ yohon ci na pos ciŋ ca findi ca na kifsohe. Wa na pangkeeɗi, wa na teɗeeɗi. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Moona mi na woyee ɗu ne Suleymaan, na raak-raakaŋ ɗe jen, a moosɗi ɓekkoh mand na yino nga ca.<verse eid="MAT 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Kooh ɓekɗe paangfiŋ yohon ci ɓekuk hend an moɗ woti te kim waa kee ɓeksa ŋ yongkaah ɗah ; kon wa leeriɗ ne Kooh hey ɗu name ɓekiɗ. Kosi ɗu kos ƴissuutiɗ !<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>Mbaa kinaat jaahiɗ ɗu woyee ne : “ Ɓoo na hee ye ñame ? Ɓoo anan ye ? Ɓoo ɓekkan ye ? ” <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>In ceem jen, e ɓooɓi inahɗi Kooh ɓeɗ na gene ŋ waakiŋ ca, waaye Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ ɗafki inhiɗ ne ɗu etohiɗ ca.<verse eid="MAT 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Waakaat ini na kaɗɗe fiki Nguuriŋ ɗe na kiyurhiŋ ɗe paaɗ, a hey ɗu ca one, a ɓaatiɗ ɗu cinooci jen nga. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Kinaat jaahiɗ ŋ ini raakan kim, kim na kimaŋ wa, mbeh nu nik ɗah miskiɗ ci nik nga doyiɗa.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kina atte morom fu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>Kinaat markoh ɓo' in, mbaa ɗu heyɗi markohse in. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Laam findi ɗu na atte'ohe, Kooh atte'ohan ɗu ɗaa te ɓeesohaani ɗu na ɓeesɗohohe, weɗ ɗu ɓeesɗohsan. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Wa ye tah fu markee ɓoli ŋ hasiŋ morom fu, te wa ndooɗ yakak nik ŋ hasiŋ ɗa ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Wala fu min na woyoh morom fu ne : “ Faɗa ŋ nihsiɗ ɗa ɓoli ŋ hasiŋ ɗa ”, te ndooɗi yakki weɗɗi ŋ hasiŋ ɗa ? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Naafeehaani, koca nihis ndooɗi yakki nik ŋ hasiŋ ɗa. Fu min hot baahiɗ ne fu nihsiɗ morom fu ɓoli nik ŋ hasiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>Kinaat eɗ ɓuu ci in ci hoolɗu wuu Kooh bala ca wiirkan nga ɗu, ca faarsoh ɗu, te kinaat njaf per ciŋ ɗu ŋ kot ciŋ mbaam-huk ci bala ca daksohan ca.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiimaat, waakaat, laɓɗaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>Kiimaat, ɗu hey onse ; waakaat, ɗu hey hote ; laɓɗaat, ɗu hey rangsiɗasse. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Laam ɓo' nu kiim ɗah, a hey onse, ɓo' nu waak ɗah, a hey hote, te ɓo' nu laɓiɗ ɗah, a hey rangsiɗasse. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Ya ɓa nga ɗu a yi kuɓkiŋ ɗe kiiman ɗe mbuuru, a on ɗe atoh ? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Wala a kiim ɗe cuurund, a on ɗe iiñ ? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Nik ne ɗu ɓi baahaaɗiici, e ɗu min on kuɓuuciŋ ɗu in baahiɗ ɗah, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa Baabiŋ ɗu yi ŋ Eel ci, a onanɗi in baahiɗ ɓi na kiimee ɗe wa e ?<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>Kon, in ci ɗu waaɗ ne ɓooɓi haɓɗiɗ ɗu ca jen, tumɗaat ɓa ca. Ineem weɗ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakoh na woosuuɗ ci.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahndeer ci kanak ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>Aasohaat yahndeeri ɓengiɗi laam yahndeeri angiɗi na ɓayohe ŋ boom te waasiŋ wa yooɓpa ; laayiɗ na aasohe nga. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Waaye yahndeeri na ɓayohe ŋ kipes ki, wa ɓengiɗ, waasiŋ wa sewwa te ɓi hota laayɗi.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi na kulɓa'kohe woosuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>Wortukaat ɓooɓi na tume haf ɓa woosuuɗ, ŋ ɗooƴiŋ ɓa, ɓa ɓaakoɓ saahiɗ. Waaye ɓa haye nga ɗu ɗah, ɓa na haye soosiɗ findi mbaal. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Ɗu na hee ɓa inhisohe in ci pesohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa na rime. Reseñ miniɗ ɓeenohu ŋ ñaaɓaaɓ e ? Wala ndun miniɗ ɓeenohu ŋ ñalkook ? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Kidig nu baah ɗah, wa na raake rim baahiɗ. Waaye kidig nu baahɗi ɗah, na raake rim baahaaɗi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Kidig baahiɗ minɗi raak rim baahaaɗi te kidig baahaaɗi minɗi raak rim baahiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Kidig nu raakɗi rim baahiɗ ɗah, wa na ƴoɓse ƴoɓu, wa njafu ŋ yongkaah. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Mbaa ɗu na hee ɓa inhisohe in ci pesohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa na rime.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo na tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>E ɓooɓi na ɓeeɗkohee so : “ Heɗ ɓoo, Heɗ ɓoo ” jen ɓeɗ na hee aase ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki haa, waaye a ɓi na haɓɗe waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Baabiŋ ngo yi nik ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ hey yo woye mbaɗi ne : “ Heɗ ɓoo Heɗ ɓoo, ɓoo meeɗ yegɗoh woo kiŋ Kooh ŋ tiikiŋ ɗa haa e ? Ɓoo aañiɗ <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> ŋ tiikiŋ ɗa te ɓoo haɓɗiɗ keemaan laayiɗ ŋ tiikiŋ ɗa. ” <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Ŋ ineem, ŋ hey ɓa woye ne : “ Ŋ moosɗi ɗu inhoh, usaat to ɗu ɓi na haɓɗe ini lahɗi waas. ”<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kahan ci kanak ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>Weɗ tah ɓoyi na sikɗuke woo kiŋ ngo wii, a pesohee wa, a mandan na ƴaar ñaañiɗ yi taɓah kahan ce ŋ ɗafuk atoh ; <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>toɓi keennda, huluɓ ci nupɗeeɗa, puuɗsi puuɗseeɗa, ca tapukka kahneem, waaye wa keenɗi sagu ini wa taɓahu ŋ ɗafuk atoh. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Waaye ɓoyi na sikɗuke woo kiŋ ngo te a pesohuu wa, a mandan na ƴaar naandiɗ yi taɓah kahan ce ŋ ɗafuk beeñ ; <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>toɓi keennda, huluɓ ci nupɗeeɗa, puuɗsi puuɗseeɗa, ca tapukka kahneem, wa keennda, wa yahrukohha jameet. »<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo woo ceem, mboolnda jen feyuusa ŋ jangɗohiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Jangɗohaaɗaŋ ɗe ɗaloheen na findi jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na tumohe, laam a woyee keeh-keeh findi kilifa.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu hoolɗiɗ ɓo' kosaayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Wa Yeesu ruhsee tangoora, mboolo laayiɗ ñaakiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Wa raakeen ƴaar, a kosaayee kosaay ki na oɓse faan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kosaay ki na oɓse faan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ Yawuut ca, ɓo' nu raakeen kosaay kii ɗah, a meeɗ ambohu ɓo' hoolaaɗi. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 13-14">Lewiici 13–14</ref></char>) Weɗ tah po a meeɗɗi reɓ ɓooɓa, a meeɗɗi reɓ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>.</char></note>, a hayya ŋ Yeesu, a ƴekka ŋ fikiice, a kiimmba ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu waaɗa ɗah, fu miniɗ to saɓsoh na kosaay kii po ŋ nik ɓo' hooliɗ. » <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yeesu raɗissa yaah, laalla ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ waaɗiɗa, nika ɓo' hooliɗ. » Jaarra kosaay ka hoolla nga ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Ƴutta Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Wortukaa wa woo ali ɓo' waaye kaɗa fu teeɓa haf fu <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char>, fu haɓiɗ seeƴki <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakoh<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lewiici 14:1-32</ref> </char></note> ; wa teeɓoh ne fu wiriɗ. »<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ surgaanaŋ ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yeesu a yi kaɗoh po a aassa kur kaŋ Kapernawum, weɗi ƴaar ɓaah ŋ ɓa adgohee soldaar caŋ <char style="w">Rom</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rom </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ kur ki degee yaah Israayel na ɓak laayiɗ ŋ Adina. Waaye ŋ Israayel raakeen ɓi buur ɓi meeɗ ɓeeɗku Herod ; buur ceem gaƴkee ŋ buura yakkaŋ Rom.</char></note> reɓoh nga ɗe, kiimmba ɗe keeh-keeh <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>an : « Kilifaani, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamaŋ</char> ngo yaa faanukka ŋ kahna, cir ciŋ faaniŋ ɗe ceɗ lafañ a yaa sayeeɗa say. » <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hey ɗe hee wirɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca loffa ne : « Kilifaani, ŋ yeyyooɗi fu aas ŋ kahan ndo ; woya woo rek ñaamaŋ ngo hey wire ! <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Laam mi ŋ haf fo, raakiɗ ɓooɓi adgoh ho te ŋ namiɗ raak soldaar ci ŋ adgoh ; yaa nu ŋ woo ne : “ Kaɗa ” ɗah, a kaɗ, yaa nu ŋ woo ne : “ Haya ” ɗah, a hay. Te in nu ŋ woo ñaamiŋ ngo ne a haɓɗaata ɗah, a haɓiɗa. »<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Wa Yeesu kerah woo keem, a feyuusa, a woosa ɓa ñaakɗee ɗe ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh : Ŋ hotɗi ali ɓo' kosiɗ kosii ngaŋ Israayel jen ! <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ɓo' laayiɗ hey pulohe ŋ ɓak ci jen, ɓa ɓoof na Ibrahiima, Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa, ɓa ñamee kañam ka yakka ŋ Nguuraŋ ɗafka. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Waaye ɓi joyee aas ŋ Nguuri, hey njafse ŋ ñuusaŋ hara, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raak. »<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Ƴutta Yeesu woosa ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca ne : « Kaɗa, wa raakohaat ɗaa findi fu kosoha. » Te ŋ jamanoonaam jok, surgaanaŋ ɗe wirra.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɓo' laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a kaɗta kahan ɓi Piyeer, wa a ree, a tel yaayiŋ ɓiti Piyeer jiriɗ po faankiɗ, a faaniŋ ɗe weɗ dohe. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Yeesu laalla yaahiŋ ɗe, dohɗaŋ faana saɓsukohha na ɗe ; jaarra a kurukka a taambkoheeɗa Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Wa niina ree, a komuusa ɓo' laayiɗ ɓa <char style="w">jiini</char> ambe. A aannja jiiniica na woo kiŋ ɗe, a wiriɗta kosaayiɗ ca ɓinooɓa jen. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Ina woosuuɗi Esayi woyee wii raakka :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">« A kooɗiɗ in ci ɓoo miskasse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">a degukka kosaay ciŋ ɓoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Esayi 53:4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na ƴaaɓa waaɗee ɗe ñaakiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Wa Yeesu hot mboolnda ndeeree ɗe, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa kaɗ ɓaka faahaŋ cookma. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Weɗi ƴaar ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa hayoh nga ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɗisik nu fu kaɗ ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa ñaakɗe. » <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓaakoɓ ci raakiɗ nung, sel ci raakiɗ taar, waaye <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa tiiki Yeesu ferɗee haf ce. Tiikeem uup reɓ ini fiisu ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-14">Dañeel 7:9-14</ref></char>. Wa fiisu nga ne, wa in hayɗohee woosuuɗi Dañeel findi heeƴ, an a hot "kuɓu ɓo' " hayeeɗa ŋ eel ciŋ Asamaan, a hayya po ɓoofohaaniŋ Kooh, yi buur. Yeesu ŋ haf ce woyiɗ ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-14">Dañeel 7:9-14</ref></char> wa a woyee woo-woosuuɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in ci na haye ŋ fikiiri ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Macce 24:30</ref></char> na teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 13:24">Maarko 13:24</ref></char>. A namiɗ woo nga wa a tufuk ŋ fiki atte'oh ca ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:64">Macce 26:64</ref></char> na teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 14:62">Maarko 14:62</ref></char>.</char></note> raakɗi sah ɗiski a na hee iɗsiɗkohe. » <verse eid="MAT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Ƴaar wiiriis ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, on ndo paaɗ, ŋ taambkoh yaɓkooriŋ ngo po a kaan, ŋ uumb ɗe. » <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ñaakiɗ to te fu faɗ kaaniɗ ci ɓa uumb kaaniɗ ciŋ ɓa. »<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu yeeɓkiɗiɗ puuɗsa na cookma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo na ɓa, a aassa ŋ gaal, taalubeeciŋ ɗe ñaakiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Ŋ cookma, ɗekka po puuɗis yakak raakka ɓa nga po ginaah ca riifɗeeɗa gaala, wa raak Yeesu neeheeɗa. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Taalubeeci reɓpa nga ɗe, ɓa yunnda ɗe na leehuk an : « Kilifaani, mucɗa ɓoo, ɓoo ɓii kaan ! » <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Kosi ɗu kos ƴissuutiɗ, wa ye tah ɗu neek ? » Weɗ a kurkoh, a ngassa puuɗsa na cookma, ɗiska eennda teɗ. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Ɓa feyuusa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ƴaarii, a ɓo' ye po puuɗsi na cookmi sah kerhiɗee ɗe ? »<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaaɓa jiiniica ambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ree ɓaka faahaŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, ŋ kur caŋ Gadareen ca, ƴaar kanak ɓa fu inah ne ca jiini ambee ɓa, ɓa pulohha ɗiska ɓa nikee ŋ ruy-ruy ca, ɓa kaɗta coha na ɗe. Ɓa nikee añaandoh na añaandoh, ali ɓo' meeɗɗi kaañ taamb ndeem. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Ɓa leehkeeɗa an : « Fu waaɗ ɓoo ye tum <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ? Fu hay ne fu torhiɗ ɓoo bala jamanooniŋ wa reyan e ? »<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Raak gat mbaam-huk yakak ñameeɗa ŋ ndaam, wa usoheen na ɓa ƴissuut. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Jiiniica kiimmba Yeesu keeh-keeh an : « Ɓoo inhiɗ ne fu hey ɓoo aañe, ona ɓoo, ɓoo aas ŋ gataŋ mbaam-huk ceen. » <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>A woosa ca ne : « Kaɗaat ! » Weɗ ca puloh ŋ ƴaaɓa, ca aassa ŋ mbaam ca. Gata jen giirukka, hunnda na mbartala, faɗsukka ŋ cookma, mbaam ca kaannda ŋ masma.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Ɓooɓa niiɗee ca nuppa, kaɗta woya ini raak jen ŋ kur-taaha, na ini rahas ƴaaɓa jiiniica ambe. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Ɓooɓaŋ kur-taaha jen pulla, hayya ŋ Yeesu ; wa ɓa hot ɗe, ɓa kiimmba ɗe keeh-keeh ne a pulaat kur caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ lafañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a aassa gaal a huussa cookma, a kaɗta Kapernawum, kur ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Ŋ ndaam, a komuusa ƴaar lafñiɗ faanuuɗ ŋ faankoha. Yeesu hotta findi ɓooɓa kosoh, a woosa lafñiɗa ne : « Ndengɗuka ƴaariŋ ngo ! Fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Ŋ woo keem, ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ƴaarii na ɗale Kooh ! » <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yeesu inheen liiɓ ciŋ ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu raakka liiɓohaaɗ ci moɗaaɗiiceem ? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Ŋ woo ɗe ne “ Fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa ”, wala “ Kurka fu tiind. ” A winde uup yooɓ ? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Ɗu hey inhe woti ne <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> raakiɗ min-min ɗaasoha bakaaɗ ŋ kehƴi. » Weɗ a woyoh ƴaara kosaayɗa ne : « Kurka, ɓaya faankohaaniŋ ɗa, fu haad. » <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Ƴaara kurukka, haadda kahan ce. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Wa mboolnda hot ineem, ɓa feyuusa, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh yi on ɓo' ci min-mineem.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓeeɗkiɗ Macce ne yeem ñaakiɗ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yeesu kurkohha ndaam, wa a kaɗe, a hotta ƴaar teeku Macce ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɗiska a na juuti'ohe. A woosa ɗe ne : « Ñaakiɗ to. » Macce kurukka, ñaakiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Ŋ finho ineem, Yeesu ñameeɗa ŋ kahan Macce, <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> laayiɗ na ɓi bakaaɗoh laayiɗ hayya ne ɓa ñam na ɗe, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Wa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca hot ineem, ɓa woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah jangɗohohiŋ ɗu ñamee na juuti'oh ci na bakaaɗoh ci ɓinooɓi ? » <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yeesu kerahha ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi kosaayɗi etohɗi paƴoh, e kosaayiɗ ci etoh paƴoh. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Jangaat ini Fiis ci woo wii : “ Ŋ waaɗ ne ɗu teeɓoh baah kiŋ ɗu ŋ ɓinooɓi, weɗ ngisoh ɗu <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkee</char> wuu so.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hose 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 21:3">Gonaah ci 21:3</ref> </char></note> ” Laam ŋ hayɗi ne ŋ ɓeeɗuk yurhiɗ ci waaye ŋ hay ne ŋ ɓeeɗuk bakaaɗoh ci. »<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ or</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Ŋ ineem taalubeeciŋ <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> hayya ŋ Yeesu, meekissa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah taalubeeciŋ ɗa na oreeɗi te ɓoo na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ɓoo na ore or ? » <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Hanheeci hay ŋ kilook miniɗ nik ŋ neɓaaɗi te heɗ kilooki yii na ɓa e ? Waaye wa hey raake jamano, heɗ kilooki kooɗohu nga ɓa ; ŋ ndeem, ɓa hey ore.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>Ali ɓo' na daafeeɗi kulɓa maañiɗ na seeket as, mbaa seeketi hey nookɗohe kulɓaaki, kulɓaaki uup nga faaruk. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Ali ɓo' na nameeɗi tum biiñi asi na soñe ŋ mbohos und maañiɗ ; mbaa mbohosi hey pooke, biiñi aamuk, mbohosi yahrukoh. Biiñ as kay na tumse ŋ mbohos as, jaar ca kanak, ca min maañ. »<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɓitiɓ, a hultiɗta komaaki cafaƴ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Wa Yeesu woyee na ɓa ndeem, raakka kilifaani hay, ƴekka ŋ fikiice woosa ɗe ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ngo cafƴi kaaniɗ señci, waaye haya fu deg ɗe yaah, a hey pesisse. » <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yeesu kurukka, ñaakeeɗa nga ɗe, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20-21"/>Wa raakeen ɓitɓa fu inah ne ñif miŋ ɗe meeɗ meeɗ aamuk, a tumiɗ na kosaay keem kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak (12) ; a woyee ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Ŋ laal kulɓaakiŋ ɗe dong ɗah, ŋ hey wire ! » A lahha Yeesu finho, a laalla lecmiŋ kulɓaakiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 9:20-21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yeesu heelukka hotta ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Ndengɗukka ɓitɓi ! Kosi fu kos wirɗiɗ ɗa. » Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska ɓitɓa wirra.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Wa Yeesu ree kahan kilifaana, a hotta ɓooɓa mbiiɓee, na mboolnda findi wa ɗuuɗohe, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>a woosa ɓa ne : « Kurkaat ndii, cafƴi kaanɗi, a na neehe. » Waaye ɓa njembteeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Wa mboolnda cootɗu, Yeesu aassa, ammba kuɓka cafƴa ŋ yaah, njaanja kurukka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Jaarra ɓooɓa laamtoheeɗaa ŋ kur kaam jen.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ fuuliɗ kanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, kaɗeeɗa, fuuliɗ kanak ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe, leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka an : « Setiŋ Dawuuda, ɓoo miskaat ɗa ! » <verse eid="MAT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yeesu reesa kahna, fuuliɗ ca reɓpa nga ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kosiɗ ne ŋ miniɗ haɓiɗ ineem e ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ee kilifaani. » <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>A laalla has ciŋ ɓa, a woosa ne : « Wa raakohaat ɗaa nga ɗu findi ɗu kosoha ! » <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Ŋ ineem has ciŋ ɓa marakka. A woosa ɓa ndengiɗ ne : « Wortukaat, ali ɓo' kinaata yeg ! » <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Waaye wa ɓa pul, ɓa laamtoheeɗaa ŋ kur kaam jen.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ muum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Ɓa cootee coot rek, Yeesu komissuusa ƴaar, a <char style="w">jiini</char> ambee ɗe, muumiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Yeesu aannja jiinnda, muum ma cammba jomb. Mboolnda feyuusa woyeeɗa ne : « In mand an moosɗi hotohu ŋ Israayel. » <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Waaye <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca woyee ne : « A kilifaaniŋ jiiniici na onee ɗe hatili a na aañohee ca. »<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tuuƴiɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yeesu wileeɗa kur ca yakak ca na ca ƴin ca jen, a jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ca, a woyeeɗa ɓooɓa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wi kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, a wirɗeeɗa kosaay ca na ɓeenduk ca jen. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>A hotta ɓooɓaŋ mboolnda, ɓa misikka ɗe lool ; ɓa nikee goyiɗ, yaaɓoh na yaaɓoh findi mbaal raakaaɗi niiɗoh. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Ŋ ineem, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Yohni laaɓiɗ waaye nguɗoh ci laayɗi. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Kon kiimaat Heɗ yohni a woosoh ɓi pangkoh, ɓa nguɗ yohni. »<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Ƴutta, a ɓeeɗukka taalubeeciŋ ɗe ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), a onnda ɓa hatil ne ɓa wirɗee kosaay ci na ɓeenduk ci jen, a nammba ɓa on hatil ne ɓa aañee <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> na hoolaaɗiiki ca hoolaaɗi.<verse eid="MAT 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Cii ceɗ tiik ciŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">apootar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓeɗ taalubeeci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ci Yeesu kooɗee ne ɓa hunee na ɗe, te ŋ mirndaani, ɓeɗ a woos ŋ adinaani jen ne ɓa paysoh <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. "<char style="tl">Apootar</char>" tokis ɓoyi woosu. Te, ŋ Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char> raakiɗ ɓi ɓo' wiiriis, ɓi ɓeeɗkohsee tiikeem.</char></note> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) : Kockoh ŋ Simong yi teeku Piyeer, na Andare taambɗoh ce ; Saak na Saaŋ, kuɓuuciŋ Sebede ; <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filip na Bartalemi ; Tomaa na Macce <char style="w" lemma="juuti'oh">juuti'ohi</char> ; Saak kuɓkiŋ Alfe, na Tade ; <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simong yi nikee <char style="tl">Selot</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Selot</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ɓoyi waaɗ kur ce po a ƴutiɗ ne a hiñohiɗa.</char></note> na Yudaa Iskaryot yi wor ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Ɓeem ɓeɗ nikee ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) Yeesu tuuƴe, a eɗta ɓa dengkoh cii an : « Kinaat kaɗ ŋ kur ciŋ ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut te kinaat aas ŋ kur ciŋ Samari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓi Samari na Yawuut ca kerhiɗoheeɗi ; ɓa heeftiɗohee heeftiɗoh, ɓa sangtiɗohha.</char></note> ; <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>waaye kaɗaat ŋ mbaal ci muuƴiɗ ci ɓaah ŋ cuuɓiŋ Israayel. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Ɗisik nu ɗu taamb ŋ waasi ɗah, woyaat ɓooɓi ne Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki reɓiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Wirɗaat kosaayiɗ ci, hultiɗaat kaaniɗ ci, aañaat jiiniici, ɗu wiriɗ ɓooɓi kosaay <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> po ɓa nik ɓo' hooliɗ. Ɗu rahsiɗ te ɗu wirindɗi, kon eɗohaat te kinaat wirndiɗuk.<verse eid="MAT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Kinaat ɓayndoh ali kopor, wa urus haa, wa haalis haa, wa hanjar loƴaah haa, <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>kinaat ɓayndoh saak ɓaaɓoha, kinaat ɓayndoh kulɓa kanak wala ñafaɗ wala ndooɗ, laam ɓoyi na pangke joyiɗ rahas kañam kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>Kur nu ɗu aasoh ɗah, meeksohaat po ɗu inah ɓoyi teyɗuk ɗu daliɗ, ɗu nik ŋ kahan ce po mbaɗna ɗu cootan. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Ɗu aasee kahna ɗah, kañɗohaat ; <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>nik ne kahna yeyyoo'iɗ ɗu daliɗ ɗah, jamiŋ ɗu nikaat nga, waaye wa yeyyooɗi ɗu ɗah, kaɗaat na jamiŋ ɗu.<verse eid="MAT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Ɗu dalɗuuɗi, ɗu sikɗukuuɗi ɗah, pulaat kahneem wala kur keem, ɗu faris merhey miŋ kot ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, e ɓi kur keem uupan miskiɗ ɓi Sodom na Gomor.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:16-19:29">Camba 18:16–19:29</ref> </char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miskiɗ ci na hee rahse taalubeeci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>Mi yii tuuƴ ɗu findi mbaal ŋ ɗooƴ gat ɓaakoɓ ; yunkaat findi iiñ, ɗu soos findi banuut. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Wortukaat ɓooɓi, ɓa hey ɗu ambe, ɓa ɓay ɗu ŋ ngelohaaci te ɓa hey ɗu laɓɗuke leraw ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ciŋ ɓa ; <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>ɗu hey ɓayse ŋ fiki ɓi goornoor na ɓi buur saguuso. Ineem hey tahe po ɗu min ndo seede ŋ fikiiɓa na fiki ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Waaye ɓa ɓayee ɗu ɗah, kinaat jaahiɗ ŋ findi ɗu woyohan na ini ɗu woyan, ɗu hey eɗse ŋ saasi saasi ini ɗu woyan. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Laam, e ɗu woyan haa, a <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Baabiŋ ɗu</char>, a yi woyan taamboh nga ɗu.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>Ɓo' hey ambɗuke taambɗoh ce ne a apu, baabu hey ambɗuke kuɓkiŋ ɗe ne a apu, ɓi komaaki hey nike sangiɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi rim ɓa, ɓa apɗuk ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Ɓooɓi jen hey ɗu sange saguuso ; waaye ɓoyi na hee ndengɗuke muñ po ŋ reehɗohaana hey mucɗasse. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Ɗu tumsee miskiɗ ŋ kur kii ɗah, saandohaat ŋ kur wiiriis. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗu reehɗanɗi kur ci nik ŋ Israayel te <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayɗi.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>Taalubeeni uupɗi yak ɓoyi na jangɗee ɗe te <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char> uupɗi yak heɗ ce. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Taalube mand na ɓoyi na jangɗee ɗe ɗah, wa doyiɗ ɗe. Ñaam na heɗ ce nam mand ɗaa. Nik ne ɓa teekiɗ heɗ kahni Belsebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belsebul </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa ɓaah ŋ tiik ciŋ Seytaani.</char></note> ɗah, moo ɓooɓiŋ kahni teeksan na ?<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>Mbaa kinaat ɓa neek. Laam in nu ɗembɗu ɗah, wa hey teeɓohse te in nu ɗemb ɗah, wa hey inhasse. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>In nu ŋ woo na ɗu na wek ɗah, woyaata noh cong te in nu ɗu moondɗu ŋ nof ɗah, leehkaata ŋ ɗafuk taɓah ci.<verse eid="MAT 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Kinaat nup ɓi na ape faan te ɓa minɗi ap ruuh. Nupaat Yi min ambsoh faan na ruuh jen a sooƴiɗ ca ŋ yongkaaha yakka. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Sel ƴin kanak na toonohseeɗi daram yino dong e ? Moona deey, yino na keeneeɗi nga ca te Baabiŋ ɗu yegɗaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Te ini kaɗ nga ɗu, a inhiɗ sah findi find ciŋ haf ciŋ ɗu hend. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Kon kanaat neƴƴoh ! E ɗu uupiɗ juuk sel njiriñ.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>Ɓo' nu woo ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ne a ɓaah nga so ɗah, ŋ hey name woo ŋ fiki Baabiŋ ngo yi nik ŋ Eel ci ne ɓoyeem ɓaah nga so. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Waaye ɓo' nu taasuk ko ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ɗah, ŋ hey ɗe name taasuk ŋ fiki Baabiŋ ngo yi nik ŋ Eel ci.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>Kinaat liiɓ ne ŋ hay ne ŋ ɓay jam ŋ Adina ; ŋ ɓayɗi jam, ŋ ɓay hiñoh. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Laam, findi Fiis ci woyoha, hayiŋ ngo hey tahe po</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 10:35">“ ɓo' sang baab ce,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 10:35">komaaki ɓitiɓ sang yaay ce,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 10:35">kilook sang payum ce ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="MAT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Sangiɗ ciŋ ɓoyi nikan ɓi kahan ɓa. ” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Miise 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗ baab ɓa mbaa yaay ɓa waaɗi uup wi a waaɗ to ɗah, a yeyyooɗi so te ɓo' nu waaɗ kuɓkiŋ ɗe ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ waaɗi uup wi a waaɗ to ɗah, a yeyyooɗi so. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Ɓo' nu ɓayɗi kurwaani a joy daaƴohu, a ñaakee nga so ɗah, a yeyyooɗi so. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗ kipes kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a hey wa ñake, te ɓo' nu ñak kipes kiŋ ɗe saguuso ɗah, a hey raake kipes ki.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>Ɓo' nu teyɗuk ɗu ŋ kahan ce ɗah, a teyɗuk ko, te ɓo' nu teyɗuk ko ɗah, a teyɗuk Yi woos so. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Ɓo' nu teyɗuk woosuuɗ ŋ kahan ce sagu ini a nik woosuuɗ ɗah, a rahsan aaf woosuuɗ, te ɓo' nu teyɗuk ɓo' yurhiɗ sagu ini ɓoyeem nik ɓo' yurhiɗ ɗah, a rahsan aaf ɓo' yurhiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Te yaa nu eɗ ɓo' yino ŋ ɓooɓi ƴissuutɗuuɗ ci, ali nik ne wa pot masuɓ soosiɗ ne a an, sagu ini a nik taalube ɗah, ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓoyeem ñakanɗi aafu nga. »<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yahya woosiɗ ɓi ɓo' ŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut eɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗe ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) dengkoh ciŋ ɗe, a kurkohha ndaam, a kaɗta kur caŋ ɓak caam ne a jangɗoha nga, a woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> nga.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Wa raak <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> taƴuuɗ ŋ kasoona, a kerahha in ci <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> haɓɗe. A woossa ɓi ɓo' ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>ne ɓa meekis ɗe andi a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse joy hay wala ɓa joy sek ɓo' wiiriis.<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Wa ɓa ree ŋ Yeesu, a loffa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat, ɗu woya Yahya ini ɗu hot te ɗu kerahhaa : <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Fuuliɗ ci ɓii hot, lafañ ci ɓii tiind moɗoɗ, ɓi raak <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> ɓii wir, ɗikiɗ ci ɓii kerah, kaaniɗ ci ɓii hulit te ñakiɗ ci ɓii woyu Yegɗohiŋ Muci. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>A sumaat, ɓoyi moosanɗi kurkoh ŋ kosi a kos sagu tumohaaɗ ciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ Yahya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Wa taalubeeca woossee coote, Yeesu woyeeɗa na mboolnda ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yahya. A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kee ye marka ŋ nduufa, caaɓsi yino-kongi puuɗsi na giyaange e ? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Ŋ liiɓɗaa ! Kon, ɗu kee ɓa marka, ɓo' ɓekkiɗ kulɓa moɗiɗ e ? Ŋ hot ɓooɓi na ɓekke kulɓa moɗiɗ na nike ŋ kahan ciŋ buur ci. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Moo, ɗu kee ɓa marka ? Woosuuɗ e ? Ee, ñam na woyee ɗu wa, a yi uup sah woosuuɗ, <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>laam a yi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyee an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">“ Ŋ hey woose ɓo' a adug ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">ne a haɓɗiɗ ɗa waasi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malasi 3:1</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ŋ ɓooɓi rimuk jen ali ɓo' uupɗi Yahya Ɓoktohi nga. Waaye ɓoyi uup ƴissuut ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki a yi uup ɗe yak. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Ina amboh ŋ jamanoonaŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi poyi, Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki wii hay na hatil te ɓi na aasohee wa hatil ɓeɗ raaka. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Laam, woosuuɗ ci na <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nikee woyeeɗa woo-woosuuɗ po findi Yahya hayoh ; <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>te ɗu waaɗa teyɗuk ɗah, a yi <char style="w">Ilyas</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ilyas : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ilyas nikee woosuuɗ yakak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17-21">1 Buur ci 17–21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 1-2">2 Buur ci 1–2</ref></char>). Wa kipes kiŋ ɗe ŋ adinaani reeh, a kaanɗi, waaye a ɓayu ŋ Eel ci (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 2:18">2 Buur ci 2:18</ref></char>). Wa kaɗta ɓi kiis teemet teemet, woosuuɗi Malasi woosa ne Ilyas heen hayisse bala mbehi yakkiŋ Kooh hayan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:23">Malasi 3:23</ref></char>).</char></note> yi joyee hay.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:23-24">Malasi 3:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Ɓo' nu raak nof ɗah, a kerhaat !<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>Moo, ŋ min mandtiɗkoh ɓooɓi woti na ye ? Ɓa mand na komaakci ɓoof ŋ ɗiski na toonohse ŋ kur ki, ɓum woyee ɓinooɓi <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">“ Ɓoo tipɗiɗ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Ɓoo tipɗiɗ ɗu" : ndii, ini fiisu ŋ gerek, wa "Ɓoo mbiiɓɗiɗ ɗu".</char></note> ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">ɗu mbecɗi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">Ɓoo ƴeekɗiɗ ɗu ƴeek ruy,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">ɗu fuɗɗi. ”<verse eid="MAT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Laam Yahya hiiɗ, a nikeeɗi ñamoh, a nikeeɗi anoh ; ɓa na woye ne a raak <char style="w">jiini</char> ! <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/><char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayya, a ñameeɗa, a aneeɗa, ɓa na woye ne : “ A ñamoh, a anoh biiñ, te a nawle <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> ci na bakaaɗoh ci ! ” Waaye liiɓohaaɗi moɗiɗi puloh ŋ Kooh na teeɓohe yurhiŋ wa, ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ wa. »<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kur ci sang kos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Ŋ ineem, Yeesu cammba ngas ɓi kur ci a uupee tumoh keemaan, laam ɓa ɓoƴsoheeɗi pesohaaɗ, a woosa ne : <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>« Mas, ɗu ɓi gen Korasin na Betsayda ! Keemaan ci tumu ŋ kur ciŋ ɗu, ca tumseen ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Tiir">Tiir na Sidoon</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23">Esayi 23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26-28">Esekiyeel 26–28</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 4:4">Yowel 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amos 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Sakriya 9:2-4</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tiir na Sidoon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaŋ Yeesu, ca nikee kur-taah ci fu inah ne, ɓooɓa genee nga, ɓa nikee Yawuut haa. Kur ceem, ca lahee Israayel yaah-sing ne fu yurhiɗkoh na pulohaaɗ-noh ɗah. Woosuuɗ ca ɗeɓgaan ambeen ɓa findi ɓo' yurhaaɗi sagu tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa.</char></note> ɗah, ɓa heen ɓoƴsohe tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa maañ, ɓa ɓekuk daah ɓa ɓoof ŋ wet ne ɓa teeɓoha ! <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Weɗ tah ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, e mbugali ɗu rahsan uupan misik wiŋ ɓi Tiir na ɓi Sidoon. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Te ɗu ɓi gen Kapernawum, ɗu liiɓiɗ ne Kooh hey ɗu rapɗe po ŋ Eel ci e ? Muk ! A hey ɗu ruhsiɗe po ŋ kaaniɗ ca ; laam keemaan ci tumu ŋ kur kiŋ ɗu, ca tumseen ŋ Sodom<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:16-19:29">Camba 18:16–19:29</ref></char></note> ɗah, wa heen rise poyi. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Weɗ tah ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ŋ mbehaŋ atteena e mbugali ɗu rahsan uupan misik wiŋ ɓi Sodom. »<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">E Yeesu na inhiɗohe Baabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Ŋ jamanoocaam, Yeesu woosa ne : « Mi yii corkiɗ ɗa Baab, fu yi Heɗ Eel ci na kehƴi, ŋ ini fu ɗasɗoh heɗ haf ci na ñaañiɗ ci in cii, fu teeɓpa ca komaakci. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ee Baab, mi yii corkiɗ ɗa. A fu waaɗoha ɗaa ŋ baah kiŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>Yeesu woosa ɓooɓa ne : « Baabiŋ ngo degiɗ in ci jen ŋ yaah ho te ali ɓo' inahɗi <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> ɗal Baabi, te ɓo' inahɗi Baabi, ɗal Kuɓki, na ɓooɓi a waaɗ ɓa ɗe teeɓ.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>Hayaat nga so, ɗu ɓi yaaɓiɗ ci jen na raankiɗ ci, ŋ hey ɗu one, ɗu iɗsiɗuk. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Teyɗukaat ini ŋ degan ɗu, jangaat nga so, ŋ ɓo' soosiɗ, ŋ ɓo' eɗfiɗ te ɗu hey iɗsiɗe keeñ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Ini ŋ degan ɗu yooɓiɗ ɓayu, te ini mi na raanohe eɗfiɗ. »<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi a yi Heɗ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Ŋ jamanoocaam, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗeeɗa, ɓa taammba yohon caŋ beleeca, wa nikee ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: findi waasiŋ Musaa nakohee wa, Yawuut ci joyeen iɗsiɗuk ngaŋ mbehi yasna-kanakɗoh, weɗ Saafi na woyee gaaw wala samdi.</char></note>. Wa raak taalubeeci aɗkiɗ, ɓa piikeeɗa nga ca, ɓa ñameeɗa. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Wa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca hot ɓa, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Waasiŋ ɓoo sangohiɗ nguɗ ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. Waaye marka ! Taalubeeciŋ ɗa tumiɗa ! »<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Mand haa ne ɗu moosɗi jangoh ina Dawuuda haɓɗee wa a aɗuk, a yi na ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>A aas ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a ɓayya mbuuruuca degsee ŋ taaɓla wuu Kooh, ɓa ñammba ca te raak e <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ci dong teyɗohsee wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:2-7">1 Samuwel 21:2-7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Pula 25:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Lewiici 24:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Te ŋ namee liiɓ ne ɗu jangiɗ ŋ Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> ne seeƴkiɗoh ci na pangke ŋ Kahan Kooh na iɗsiɗkeeɗi ŋ mbeheem. Kon ɓa na taambɗeeɗi nakoheem, waaye ɓa na ambseeɗi findi ɓoyi tooñ.<verse eid="MAT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, raakiɗ ɓoyi uup Kahan Kooh ŋ ndii. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Fiis ci namiɗ woo ne : “ Ŋ waaɗ ne ɗu teeɓoh baah kiŋ ɗu ŋ ɓinooɓi, weɗ ngisoh ɗu <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkee</char> wuu so.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hose 6:6</ref></char></note> ” Ɗu inheen ini woo keem tokis ɗah, ɗu heeɗi yambe tooñaaɗiicii. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Laam <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> a yi Heɗ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. »<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ heɗ yaah ɓeendkiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a kaɗta <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>A raakka nga ƴaar, yaahiŋ ɗe ɓeendkee ɓeenduk. Ɓa meekissa Yeesu ne : « Andi wiriɗ ɓo' ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse teyɗohuuɗ ? » Raak ɓa waakee ini ɓa yamban ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « E ya ɓa nga ɗu a yi raakan mbaal yino dong, a keen ŋ nung ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, a faɗ ɗe nga, a pulɗuu ɗe ? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Te ŋ hot a ɓo' uup mbaal fuuf ! Kon tum in baahiɗ teyɗohuuɗ ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. »<verse eid="MAT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>A woosa ƴaara na yaaha ne : « Raɗsa yaahiŋ ɗa. » A raɗissaa, wa dokukka moɗoɗ findi winoora.<verse eid="MAT 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>
    <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca pulla, ɓa markeeɗa findi ɓa na hee apohe Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Waaye a inahhaa, a kurkohha ndaam, a cooteeɗa. Mboolo laayiɗ ñaakiɗta ɗe, a wiriɗta kosaayiɗ ca nga jen. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>A woytohha ɓa ndengiɗ ne ɓa kinaat ɗe laamtoh. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Jaarra ini Kooh woyee taamboh ŋ woosuuɗi Esayi raakka, an :<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>« Surgaaniŋ ngo yeɗɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">yi ŋ tan, ŋ waaɗta ɗe keeh-keeh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">ŋ neɓuusa nga ɗe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ŋ hey tume <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ ngo</char> nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">a hey yegɗohe kiyurah ŋ cuuɓ ci jen.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>A heyɗi lahtohe na ɓo',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">a leehkanɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">te ali ɓo' kerhanɗi hoosooriŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">ŋ harmban kahan ci.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>A ɗiindohanɗi mbaang <char style="w">hapeel</char> weeriɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">a ƴimanɗi laampaani na ɗuuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">A tumohan ɗaa po</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">kiyurah raak ndam.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Kur ci jen hey dege yaakaar ciŋ ɓa ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Esayi 42:1-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ fuuliɗ muumiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Weɗ ɓa ɓayoh ŋ Yeesu ƴaari fu inah ne a <char style="w">jiini</char> fuulɗee ɗe, muumiɗta ɗe. Yeesu wiriɗta ɗe po a jombeeɗa, a hoteeɗa. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Mboolnda jen feyuusa woyeeɗa ne : « Wa miniɗ nik ne a setiŋ Dawuuda de' ! » <verse eid="MAT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Wa <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca keraha, ɓa woosa ne : « Uh, a na aañohe jiiniici hatiliŋ Belsebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belsebul </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa ɓaah ŋ tiik ciŋ Seytaani.</char></note>, kilifaaniŋ ca. »<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yeesu inahha liiɓ ciŋ ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi ɓaah nguur hiñohee ŋ harmban ɓa ɗah, nguureem hey keene, te ɓooɓi ɓaah kur wala kahan hiñohee ŋ harmban ɓa ɗah, kur keem wala kahneem minanɗi tufuk.<verse eid="MAT 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Kon wa nik ne Seytaani na aañe Seytaani ɗah, a yi hiñoh na haf ce. Kon nguuriŋ ɗe tufkohan na ? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Nik ne mi na aañohe jiiniici hatiliŋ Belsebul ɗah, moo ɓooɓiŋ ɗu na namee ca aañ, ɓa na aañohee ca winde hatil ? Ineem weɗ tah ɓeɗ atte'an ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Waaye nik ne mi na aañohe jiiniici Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh ɗah, kon Nguuriŋ-Kooh reyiɗ nga ɗu. »<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Ɓo' min na aasoh kahan ɓo' raakiɗ hatil, a ɓay in ciŋ ɗe te a tokɗi ɗe po a ndeng ? Waaye a tok ɗe ɗah, a hey ɓaye in ciŋ kahan ce jen. <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Ɓo' nu langɗi na so ɗah, a sangiɗ to te ɓo' nu nangɗohohɗi so ɗah, a na pasarohe.<verse eid="MAT 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bakaaɗi ɗaasohsanɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Weɗ tah ñam na woyee ɗu wa : Ɓooɓi ɗaasnuk ɗah, ɓa hey ɗaasse bakaaɗ nu bakaaɗ na ɗal nu ɓa ɗal Kooh ɗah, waaye, ɓo' nu ɗal <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, a ɗaassanɗi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Ɓo' nu woo in moɗaaɗi ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ɗah, a ɗaasnuk ɗah, a hey ɗaasse, waaye ɓo' nu woo in moɗaaɗi ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ɗah, a ɗaassanɗi wa ŋ adinaanii na wi na haye.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>Fu woo ne kidgi baahiɗ ɗah, waa ne rim ciŋ wa baahiɗ. Fu woo ne kidgi baahɗi ɗah, waa ne rim ciŋ wa baahɗi. Laam kidig na inhisohse rimiŋ wa. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Ɗu hiriñ rek, ɗu min na woyoh in baahiɗ, na baahaaɗiiki ɗu baahaaɗi ? Nguɓ na woye ini keeñ riif naa. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Ɓo' baahiɗ na pulɗe in baahiɗ raakee weɗ nik ŋ ɗaakkiŋ ɗe. Ɓo' baahaaɗi na pulɗe in baahaaɗi raakee weɗ nik ŋ ɗaakkiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa : Ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, ɓooɓi hey teeɓohe ini tah woo ciŋ ɓa mbalay ci. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Laam ɓo' nu nga, e woo ciŋ ɗe hoolɗan ɗe wala ceɗ amban ɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu lofiɗ ɓi meeksee ɗe firnde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Weɗ ɓi jangɗohoh ɓaah ŋ ɓiŋ waasi, na ɓi <char style="tl">Farisen</char> woyoh ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo waaɗ ne fu teeɓ ɓoo firnde puloh ŋ Eel ci. » <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi woti ɓeɗ baahaaɗi, ɓa topɗi ŋ Kooh po haa njaalo'oh, an ɓa na meeksohe firnde ; ɓa eɗsanɗi ali firnde ɗal wiŋ woosuuɗi Yunus. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Findi Yunus tumohee noh kaahay na wek kaahay ŋ rookaŋ cuurnda yakka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 2">Yunus 2</ref></char></note> Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey name nik noh kaahay na wek kaahay ŋ ɗooƴ kehƴi.<verse eid="MAT 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, ɓi Niniw hey kurke, ɓa teeɓ ɓooɓi woti ne ɓa raakɗi keeh, laam wa ɓi Niniw kerah woo kaŋ Yunus, ɓa ɓoƴsoheen pesohaaɗ keeh-keeh<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3">Yunus 3</ref></char></note> ; te moona ini nik ndii, weɗ uup Yunus.<verse eid="MAT 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Buura ɓitɓaŋ Saba pulohee kur usiɗ ne a sikɗuk liiɓohaaɗa moɗɗaŋ Suleymaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Buur ci 10:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Nguur ci 9:1-12</ref></char></note> Te moona raakiɗ ini uup Suleymaan ŋ ndii, weɗ tah mbehi Kooh na hee atte'ohe ɓooɓi, buuri ɓitɓeem hey kurke, a teeɓ ɓooɓi woti ne ɓa raakɗi keeh.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Findi jiini na wiirkohe ŋ ɓo'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>Jiini, na hoolaaɗiiki a hoolaaɗi, faɗta ɓo' ɗah, a na kaɗe ŋ ɓi ɗisik suyiɗ a waakee ɗiski a iɗsiɗkohan waaye a na raakeeɗi. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Ŋ ineem, a woo ŋ haf ce ne : “ Mi na hee dokke kahnaŋ ngo ŋ puloh. ” A wiiruk ɗah, a raak kahna ɓarang, paɗuuɗ, haɓɗuuɗ moɗoɗ. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Jaar a kaɗ waaka jiini yasna-kanak ci uup ɗe añaand ; ca kaɗ kahna, ca gen. Ŋ ineem, mirndohaaɗiŋ ɓoyeem weɗ na uupe misik fuuf findi a kocee mand. In mand ɗaa weɗ rahsan ɓooɓi woti, ɓa baahɗi. »<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi kahan Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Wa Yeesu nik ndaam, a woyeeɗa na mboolnda, yaay ɓa na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci hayya, ɓa tufukka ŋ hara ɓa waaɗta woo na ɗe. [<verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Raakka ɓoyi woo ɗe ne : « Yaay ɗu na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa ɓa ɗaa tufukka ŋ hara, ɓa waaɗ woo na ɗa. »]<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɗu amb ne a ɓa yaay ɓoo, e ɓinde taambɗoh ciŋ ngo ? » <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Jaarra a yurhiɗta yaah ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe a woosa ne : « Ɓooɓii, ɓeɗ yaay ɓoo, ɓeɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Ɓo' nu na haɓɗe ini Baabiŋ ngo yi nik ŋ Eel ci waaɗ ɗah, ɓoyeem a taambɗoh ho ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ wala yaay ɓoo. »<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ sokohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Mbaɗi, Yeesu pulohha kahna, a kaɗta, a ɓooffa ŋ sereendaŋ cookma ne a jangɗoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Mboolo yakiɗ hayya ndeerra ɗe, po a mirndohha rap ŋ gaal, a ɓooffa nga. Mboolnda jen tufukka ŋ sereendaŋ masma. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>A woosa na ɓa, ŋ andiin, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in laayiɗ ; a woo ɓa ne :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">« A nikee guuroh, a kaɗta soka. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Wi a soke, a saaweeɗa tisohi, in nga hennda ŋ waasi ŋ ɗooƴ yohni, sel ci hayya ñammba ca.<verse eid="MAT 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Raakka ci keen ŋ ɗisik laayaaɗi merhey, raakiɗ atoh, tahha po ca arra paar, <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>waaye wi nohi dam, in ca paaree leeɓpa po ca onnja sagu ini ca raakeeɗi niir nooɗiɗ.<verse eid="MAT 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>In ŋ tisohi nammba keen ŋ ɗisik raakiɗ ñaaɓaaɓ ; ca paarandoosa na ñaaɓaaɓ ca, ceem ndooƴca ca.<verse eid="MAT 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Waaye raakka ca keen ŋ keheƴ baahiɗ, ca rimmba cum kuɓu teemet (100), cum ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60), cum ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30). »<verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu raak nof ɗah, a kerhaat ! »<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Taalubeeca reɓpa nga ɗe, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah fu woyee na ɓa ŋ andiin ? » <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu onuuɗ ne ɗu inah in ci ɗasɗukiɗ ciŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki waaye ɓeɗ, ɓa rahasɗi ca. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Ɓoyi raak hey ɓaatse po a laayiɗ lool, waaye ɓoyi raakɗi, ini ƴissuuti a amb sah hey naafse nga ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Ineem weɗ tah po ŋ woyee na ɓa ŋ andiin. Laam ɓa ɗii marak te ɓa hotɗi ; ɓa ɗii sikɗuk, waaye ɓa kerahɗi, ɓa inahɗi. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Ini ɓa tum, weɗ ini Kooh woyee taamboh ŋ woosuuɗi Esayi an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">“ Ɗu hey sikɗuke baahiɗ waaye ɗu inhanɗi muk ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">ɗu hey marke baahiɗ, waaye ɗu hotanɗi muk.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Keeñ ciŋ ɓooɓii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">raakisɗi yeg yeg ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ɓa rangiɗ nof ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ɓa ɗuungiɗ has ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ne ɓa hotuu na has ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ɓa kerhuu na nof ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">te ɓa inhuu ngaŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">te ŋ ineem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ɓa minuu wiiruk nga so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ne ŋ wiriɗ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esayi 6:9-10</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>Yeesu woyissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Waaye ɗu, ɗu neɓɗiɗ, has ciŋ ɗu ca ɗii hot te nof ciŋ ɗu ca ɗii kerah. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, woosuuɗ laayiɗ na ɓo' yurhiɗ laayiɗ maɗeen hot ini ɗu na hote te ɓa hotɗaa, ɓa maɗeen kerah ini ɗu na kerhe te ɓa kerahɗaa.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>Mbaa sikɗukaat ini andiiniŋ sokohi tokis. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Ɓooɓi kerah woo ki kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, te ɓa inahɗi ini wa tokis, Seytaani na haye nga ɓa, a kooɗ ini soku ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa. Ɓeem, ɓeɗ ini saawu ŋ sereendaŋ waasa.<verse eid="MAT 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Ɓinooɓi ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ kehƴi raak atoh ci ; ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa jaara teyɗuk na keeñ soosiɗ, <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>waaye ɓa na raakeeɗi niir ŋ haf ɓa, ɓa na maañeeɗi nga. Ɓa raak miskiɗ wala ɓa tolfiɗassee sagu Woo ki ɗah, ɓa ar faɗ.<verse eid="MAT 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Ɓinooɓi ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ ñaaɓaaɓ ci ; ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa teyɗuka, waaye liiɓsiɗoh ciŋ Adina na raak-raak ci na njuyohe, amb ɓa po Woo ki minuu rim ali in.<verse eid="MAT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Ɓinooɓi ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ kehƴi baahiɗi ; ɓeɗ ɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa inah ini wa tokis ; ɓa raak rim, ɓum teemet (100), ɓum ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60) ɓinooɓi ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30). »<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ gaacooh fi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yeesu naandsukissa mboolnda andiin wiiriis, a woo ɓa ne : « Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, wa mand na inii : A nikee ɓo', a sokka tisoh baahiɗ ŋ yohon ce, <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>waaye wa weka ree, ɓooɓa neeheeɗa, sangiɗaŋ ɗe ɓayya gaacooh, a sokka ca ŋ ɗooƴ tohooca, a cootta. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Tohra paarra, gaacooh fa paarra naa.<verse eid="MAT 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Ŋ ineem <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ heɗ yohni hayya nga ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : “ Kilifaani, fu sokee tisoh baahiɗ ŋ yohon fu haa e ? Moo gaacooh fa puloh nde ? ” <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>A loffa ɓa ne : “ A ɓoyi sang ngo tum ineem. ” Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : “ Kon ɓoo kaɗa ɗofa e ? ”<verse eid="MAT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>A loffa ɓa ne : “ A'aa ! Ŋ sang ne ɗu ɗofee wa ɗah, ɗu ɗofndoh tohri, <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>faɗaat, ca hun ca yak po ŋ nguɗa. Nguɗa ree ɗah, ŋ hey woye nguɗoh ci ne : ‘Kocaat weɗ nihis, ɗu toka ɗuf ɗuf, ɗu doh ca ; waaye ɗu ɓek tohri ŋ ndapiŋ ngo.’ ” »<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ tisohiŋ mutardaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yeesu naandsukissa ɓa andiin wiiriis, a woo ɓa ne : « Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, wa mand na inii : A nikee ɓo', a ɓayya kuɓu mutarda, a sokkaa ŋ yohon ce. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Kuɓu mutarda weɗ uup ƴissuut ŋ tisoh ciŋ kidig ci ƴin ci na sokse ŋ nguuk jen. Waaye wa paarra ɗah, wa yak po wa uup ca, wa nik kidig po sel ci taar ŋ naak ciŋ wa. »<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ lawiiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>A naandsukissa ɓa andiin wiiriis an : « Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, wa mand na findi ɓitiɓ na ɓayohee lawiir a siiɓa na kanoh mun kaahay ; ƴut ɗah, ini siiɓuuɗi jen guuf. »<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Toksiŋ andiiniŋ gaacooh fi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>In ceem jen Yeesu woyee mboolnda ca ŋ andiin, te a woyeeɗi na ɓa ŋ ini nikɗi andiin. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>A woyohee ɗaa ne ini woosuuɗa woyee raak, a woyee ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">« Ŋ hey woye ŋ andiin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">ŋ woo in ci ɗembiɗ ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">ina amboh ŋ feraŋ Adina poyi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Sabuur 78:2</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Weɗi Yeesu faɗoh mboolnda, a aassa ŋ kahna. Taalubeeciŋ ɗe hayya nga ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne a toksiɗaat ɓa andiiniŋ gaacooh fi paar ŋ yohni. <verse eid="MAT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> a yi ɓoyi sok tisohi baahiɗi, <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>yohni weɗ adinaani, tisohi baahiɗi weɗ ɓooɓi ɓaah ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, gaacooh fi weɗ ɓooɓi ɓaah ŋ Seytaani. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Sangiɗi sok gaacooh fi a yi Seytaani, nguɗi weɗ reehiŋ Adina, nguɗoh ci ɓeɗ malaakaaci.<verse eid="MAT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Findi gaacooh fi nihsohu, wa ɓekuusa ŋ yongkaah, wa kaɗohan ɗaa ne Adina reeh ɗah. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey tuuƴe malaakaaciŋ ɗe, ca ɗof ɓi ɓaahɗi ŋ Nguuriŋ ɗe, ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na bakaaɗɗukohe jen na ɓi na tume ini nikɗi waas, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>ca njaf ɓa ŋ yongkaaha yakka, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raak.<verse eid="MAT 13:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Weem weɗ ɓooɓi yurhiɗ ci siñaarɗohan findi nohi ŋ ɗooƴ Nguuriŋ Baabiŋ ɓa. Ɓo' nu raak nof ɗah, a kerhaat. »<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Raak-raaki ɗembɗu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mand na inii : Wa nikee raak-raak, wa ɗembɗuusa ŋ ɗooƴ yohon, ƴaar hottaa, a ɗembɗissaa. Weɗi a kaɗoh sumoh na sumoh, a toonnda in ca a raakee jen, a rommba yohna. »<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>A woyissa ɓa ne : « Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mand na inii : A nikee toontukoh. A waakeeɗa per moɗiɗ, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>wi a waak po a hotta yino moɗoh na moɗoh, a kaɗta, a toonnda in ca a raakee jen, a rommbaa. »<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>A woyissa ɓa ne : « Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mand na inii : Ɓa nikee seeɓoh, ɓa njaffa mbaal ŋ ɗooƴ cookmi, wa ammba cuurund nu cuurund <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>po wa riiffa, ɓa ɓayyaa ŋ sereendaŋ cookma, ɓa ɓooffa. Ɓa nihissa baahiɗ ca, ɓa ɓekka ca ŋ pañe, ɓa mbetta ca raakaaɗi etoh ca. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Wa mandan ɗaa ne Adina reehee ɗah ; malaakaaci hey haye ne ca saɓsoh ɓooɓi yurhiɗ ci na ɓi yurhaaɗiici. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Ca njaf yurhaaɗiici ŋ yongkaaha yakka, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raak. »<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo ineem, a meekissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Andi ɗu inhiɗ in ceem jen ini ca tokis ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ee ! » <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi, kaɗ po a nik taalube Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki ɗah, a na mande na heɗ kahni na uuske as na kiisiɗ ŋ ɗaakkiŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Nasareet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo andiin ceem, a kurkohha ndaam, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>a kaɗta kur ka a yakoh, a jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagogaŋ</char></char> ɓa, ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ɗiska feyuusa, woyeeɗa ne : « Ki'inhi na ɗe wii, a ɓayoha nde, na keemaan ci a na haɓɗe ? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>A kuɓkiŋ miniseeni haa e ? A Maryaama yaay ɓa haa e ? Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci, e Saak, Suseef, Simong na Yuud, haa e ? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Te taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ ci ɓa ɗii na ɓoo ndii jen haa e ? Kon in cii jen a puloh na ca nde ? » <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Ineem weɗ tahee po ɓa minɗi ɗe teyɗuk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Waaye a woosa ɓa ne : « Woosuuɗ na kerhiɗasse ŋ ɗisik ci jen po tas ŋ harmban ɓaah ciŋ ɗe na kur ka a genoh. » <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Ɓa koseeɗi ɗe, tahha po a tumɗi keemaan laayiɗ nga.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Findi Yahya kaanoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Ŋ jamanoonaam, Herod ya adgohee Galile, kerahha ɓooɓa laamtoheeɗa Yeesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>a woosa dag caŋ ɗe ne : « Ƴaareem, e <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> ; a hultiɗu hultiɗu, weɗ tah a raakka hatil haɓɗoha in feyohiɗ ! »<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Herod yeem a yi taƴɗukee Yahya sagu Herojaad ɓiti Filip ; Filip nikee taambɗoh Herod. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Waam, raak Yahya meeɗ woo Herod ne : « Waasiŋ Kooh teyɗohɗi ne fu ɓay ɓiti taambɗoh fu, fu tum ɗe ɓitiɓ. » <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Ŋ ineem, Herod waaɗta ɗe apɗuk waaye a neƴƴoheen ɓooɓa laam ɓa teyɗukeen Yahya findi woosuuɗ.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Waaye wa raakka mbeh Herod yakɗeeɗa mbehi a raakohu, kuɓkiŋ Herojaad ɓitɓi mbeceeɗa ŋ fiki hanheeca, Herod neɓuusa nga ɗe <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>po a gappa ɗe na giñ ne a hey ɗe eɗe in nu a meekis ɗe ɗah. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Herojaad, yaay ɓi kuɓka, ɓekka kuɓka po a woosa ne : « Ŋ waaɗ eɗu palaat ndii, na hafiŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi. »<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Ŋ ineem Herod soossa waaye giña a giñee ŋ fiki hanheeca tahha po, a nakohha ne a eɗsaata, <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>a tuuƴohha ne hafiŋ Yahya kaɗ nguɗsa ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Hafiŋ Yahya nguɗuusa, ɓayuusa ŋ palaat, kuɓka cafƴa eɗuusaa, a ɓayyaa yaay ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗta ɓaya fiɗaafaŋ ɗe, ɓa accaa. Ɓa kaɗta, ɓa woosa Yeesu wa.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laayɗa Yeesu laayɗee mbuuruuca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Wa Yeesu kerah ne Yahya Ɓoktohi apuuɗ, a kurkohha ndaam, a aassa ŋ gaal ne a kaɗ ɗaaya ŋ nduufa ; waaye ɓooɓa yeggaa, ɓa pulla kur ca, ɓa taambiɗta ɗe na kot. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Wi a ree po a ruhussa ŋ gaala, a hotta mboolnda findi wa yakoh, ɓa misikka ɗe lool ; a wiriɗta kosaayiɗ ca nikee nga.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Wa niina ree, taalubeeci reɓpa nga ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Ndii bilaf te Kooh yii hooɓeeɗa ; woya mboolndi ɓa kaɗ ŋ kur ci ne ɓa rom ini ɓa joy ñam. » <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Wa etohɗi ɓa kaɗe ; ɗu ɓii, eɗaat ɓa ɓa ñam. » <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo raak mbuuru yatuus na cuurund kanak dong ndii. » <verse eid="MAT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Komaat to ca. »<verse eid="MAT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>A woosa mboolnda ne ɓa ɓoofaat ŋ kehƴi, ŋ ɗafuk paangfa, a ɓayya mbuuruuca yatuus ca na cuurund ca kanak ca, a taaknukka ŋ Eel ci, a corkiɗta Kooh. Ƴutta, a nguɗsohha ca, a eɗta taalubeeci ca, ɓeem paysohha mboolnda ca. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Ɓooɓa jen ñammba po kappa, ɓa ɓayndohha tasiɗ ca, ca nikee pañe ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12).<verse eid="MAT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Ƴaar ca ñamee nga nikeen ŋ ɓak junni-yatuus (5000), ɓaatta nga ɓitiɓ ca na komaakca.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tiindiɗ ŋ ɗafuk masma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Wa mboolnda ñam po ƴutta, Yeesu jaarra tufuk taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa adug ɗe, ɓa aas ŋ gaala, ɓa kaɗ ɓaka winooraŋ cookma, a yi ŋ haf ce, a woo na mboolnda ne ɓa haadaat. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Wa a cootiɗ mboolnda po ƴutta, a rappa ŋ tango a ɗaayya nga ne a kiim Kooh. Wa weka ree raak ɗe nga, kiik ce. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Waam raak gaala ŋ ɗooƴ cookma, puuɗsi yurhiɗkohha naa, ginaah ci laɓkeeɗa nga.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Ŋ wiisaaɗiina, Yeesu tiindeeɗa ŋ ɗafuk masma, a hayeeɗa ŋ taalubeeci. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Wa ɓa hot ɗe tiindeeɗa ŋ ɗafuk cookma, ɓa feyuusa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « A husiɗ ! » Ɓa tiitta, ɓa leehkeeɗa. <verse eid="MAT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Yeesu arra ɓa woo ne : « Tokaat fit ciŋ ɗu, a ñam ; kinaat neƴƴoh ! »<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, nik ne a fu ɗah, woo so ŋ tiind ŋ ɗafuk masmi, ŋ hay nga ɗa ! » <verse eid="MAT 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Haya ! » Piyeer ruhussa ŋ gaala, cammba tiind ŋ ɗafuk masma ne a kaɗ ŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Waaye a hotta findi puuɗsa raakoh hatil, a neƴƴohha, a cammba diig ŋ masma, a leehukka an : « Kilifaani, naaf fo deey ! »<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Yeesu arra raɗis yaah, ammba ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Ƴaari yaf kosaaɗi, wa ye tah fu taastiɗohee ŋ haf fu ? » <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Ƴutta ɓa rappa ŋ gaala, puuɗsa seemmba. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Taalubeeca nikee ŋ gaala ƴekka ŋ fiki Yeesu, ɓa woosa ne : « Wa keeh ne fu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ! »<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ kosaayiɗ laayiɗ ŋ Senesaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Wa ɓa reehiɗ ƴakaanduk cookma, ɓa teerra ŋ kur kaŋ Senesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ɗiska inhissa Yeesu, ɓa woosaa ŋ kur caŋ ɓak caam jen, a komuusa kosaayiɗ ca jen. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Ɓa kiimeeɗa ɗe ne ɓa laal lecmiŋ kulɓaakiŋ ɗe dong, te ɓooɓa laalee wa jen wireen jameet koreet.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na mbaahaŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Wa raakka mbeh, ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca na ɓi jangɗohoh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> pulohha Yerusalem hayya ɗiskiŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>« Wa ye tah taalubeeciŋ ɗa na taambɗeeɗi mbaahiŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo ? Marka rek ! Ɓa hee ñame ɗah, ɓa na ɓohñukeeɗi findi mbaahi nakoha. »<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Moo ɗu, wa ye tah ɗu taambiɗɗi nakohiŋ Kooh, ɗu tumohee findi mbaahiŋ ɗu woyoh ? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Ŋ hot Kooh woyiɗ ne : “ Eɗa yaay ɗu na baab ɗu cir.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Pula 20:12</ref></char></note> ” A woyissiɗ ne : “ Ɓo' nu kiimiɗ yaay ɓa wala baab ɓa moɗaaɗi ɗah, a apaah apu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Pula 21:17</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Waaye ɗu, ɗu na jangɗohe ne ɓo' miniɗ woo baab ɓa wala yaay ɓa ne : “ Ini ŋ joyee ɗa eɗ, ŋ eɗohiɗa wuu Kooh. ” <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Jaar ɗu hondoh ɗe taambkoh yaay ɓa na baab ɓa, a eɗuu ɓa cir. Ɗu na heefohe woo kiŋ Kooh ɗaa, sagu taambiɗ mbaahiŋ ɗu.<verse eid="MAT 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Naafeehaaci ! Woo kiŋ Kooh wi woosuuɗi Esayi woyee nga ɗu wii, wa keeh an :<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>“ Cuuɓii, eɗiŋ ɓa na so cir top ŋ nguɓ ciŋ ɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">keeñ ciŋ ɓa usiɗ to lool.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Ɓa na ñaamkee so ŋ ɓarang ɓarang ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">ɓa na jangɗohe nakoh ciŋ ɓo' ci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">po mand haa ne mi yi Kooh ñam nakoh ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esayi 29:13</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut ɓa lof, a ɓeeɗukka mboolnda, a woosa ɓa ne : « Sikɗukaat te ɗu inah inii : <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Ini na aase ŋ nguɓiŋ ɓoyi, weɗ na ɓekee ɗe hoolaaɗi haa, waaye a wi na pulohe nga weɗ na ɓekee ɗe hoolaaɗi. »<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Weɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗe reɓoh nga ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Andi fu inhiɗ ne woo keem, mand na ɓaseeh ŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ? » <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Kidig nu Baabiŋ ngo yi nik ŋ Eel ci yipɗi ɗah, wa hey ɗofse. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Faɗaat ɓa, ɓa fuuliɗ, te ɓa na nooke fuuliɗ ; te fuuliɗ nookee fuuliɗ morom ce ɗah, ɓa kanak jen, ɓa hey keene ŋ nung. »<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Teeɓa ɓoo ini woo ki señci tokis. » <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɗu sah, ɗu raakɗi liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ poyi e ? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Ɗu inahɗi ne in nu aas ŋ nguɓ ɗah, wa na kaɗe ŋ rook, ƴut ɗah wa bilafsuku e ?<verse eid="MAT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Waaye ini puloh ŋ nguɓi, wa kurkoh ŋ keeñi te ineem weɗ na ɓeke ɓo' hoolaaɗi. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Laam in cii na pulohe ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ : Liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi, ap ɓo', njaaloo, faankoh sangohuuɗ, rok, leyɗoh ɓo', na ɗooɓoh. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>E in ceem ceɗ na ɓeke ɓo' hoolaaɗi ; waaye ñam te fu ɓohñukɗi, wa na hoolaaɗi'ɗeeɗi ɓo'. »<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kosaŋ ɓitɓa nikeeɗi Yawuut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yeesu pulohha ndaam, a kaɗta ɓak caŋ <char style="w" lemma="Tiir">Tiir na Sidoon</char>. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Wa raakeen ɓitiɓ nga, a ɓaahee ŋ Kanaan ci, a pulohee kur ceem, a hayya, a leehkeeɗa an : « Ŋ miskaat ɗa Kilifaani, setiŋ Dawuuda ! Kuɓkiŋ ngo cafƴi, a <char style="w">jiini</char> amb ɗe, a yaaɓɗiɗ ɗe lool ! »<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Waaye Yeesu lofɗi ali in ; taalubeeci reɓpa ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Woyaa ɗe a coot book, a yii taambiɗ ɓoo na leehkiŋ ɗe rek. » <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Kooh woos so ŋ mbaal ciŋ ɗe muuƴiɗ ci dong, Israayel ci. »<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Waaye ɓitɓa hayya ƴekka ŋ kot ciŋ ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓaatɗoh ho rek Kilifaani ! » <verse eid="MAT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Wa waas haa ɓuu ci na koɗse teengu kañam kiŋ komaakci. »<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Ɓitɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu woo keeh waaye, ɓuu ci na koɗse na name ñam ŋ ñamohiiciŋ heɗ ca, ci na keene ŋ kehƴi. » <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓitɓi, kosi fu kos yakiɗ ! Wa raakohaat ɗaa findi fu waaɗoh. » Ŋ wahtuunaam, kuɓkaŋ ɗe wirra.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɓo' laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Wa Yeesu kurkoh ndaam, a kaɗta ɓakaŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, a rappa ŋ ɗafuk tango, a ɓooffa. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Weɗ mboolo yakak hayoh nga ɗe, ɓayya ɓi lafañ, na ɓi fuuliɗ, ɓi ɓeendkiɗ, ɓi muum, na kosaayiɗ laayiɗ wiiriis, ɓa ɓayya ɓa ŋ fiki Yeesu, a wiriɗta ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Mboolnda feyuusa ŋ ina ɓa hot muum ca jombeeɗa, ɓeendkiɗ ca wirra, lafañ ca tiindeeɗa, fuuliɗ ca hoteeɗa ; ŋ ineem, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Koohiŋ Israayel.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laayɗaŋ mbuuruuca, wi kanakɗoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Ɓa nikka ndeem po Yeesu ɓeeɗukka taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓii miskiɗ to, neeh kaahay ceɗi cii ɓii na so, ɓa raakisɗi ali ñamaah te ŋ waaɗɗi ɓa cootiɗ rook ɓarang bala ɓa keenan ŋ waasi ɗah. »<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Moo mboolo hend an, ɓoo ɓayohan mbuuruuci min ɓa kap nde ŋ bilaf fii ? » <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yeesu meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu raak mbuuru hend na ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Mbuuru yasna-kanak na ɓi cuurund ƴin ƴin, waaye ca laayɗi. »<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>A woosa mboolnda ne ɓa ɓoofaat ŋ kehƴa, <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>a ɓayya mbuuruuca yasna-kanak ca na cuurund ca, a corkiɗta Kooh po ƴutta, a nguɗsoheeɗa ca, a eɗeeɗa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ca, ɓa eɗeeɗa mboolnda.<verse eid="MAT 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Ɓooɓa jen ñammba po kappa, tasiɗ ca nangɗohuusa, ca nikee dammba riifiɗ yasna-kanak. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Ɓooɓa ñamee nikee ƴaar junni-nikiis (4000) ɓaatta nga ɓitiɓ ca na komaakca.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Wa ɓa ƴut ñam, a woosa mboolnda ne ɓa haadaat, a aassa ŋ gaal, a kaɗta ɓakaŋ Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Inhisoha jamano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Ɓi <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char> reɓpa, woyeeɗa na Yeesu. Ɓa markiskeeɗa ɗe, ɓa meekseeɗa ɗe ne a teeɓ ɓa firnde puloh ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « [Noh muyee te eel ci ruumndiɗee ɗah, ɗu na woye ne : “ Eel ci ruumndiɗ coy, wa hey neɓe ! ” <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Wa nik na ɓaaɓ ɗah, ɗu woo ne : “ Wa ngaaɓiɗ, wa neɓanɗi. ” Ɗu minnda inhisoh findi eel ci na mande te ɗu minɗi inhisoh firndeeciŋ jamanooni !] <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Ɓooɓi woti ɓeɗ baahaaɗi, ɓa topɗi ŋ Kooh po haa njaalo'oh, an ɓa na meeksohe firnde ! Ɓa eɗsanɗi ali firnde ɗal wiŋ Yunus.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1-4">Yunus 1–4</ref></char></note> » Ƴutta a faɗta ɓa ndaam, a cootta.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lawiiriŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci na <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Wa taalubeeci kaɗee ŋ ɓaka winooraŋ cookma, ɓa alkoheen ɓayndoh mbuuru. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Wortukaat lawiiriŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci na <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci ! » <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « A ini ɓoo ɓayɗi mbuuru weɗ tah. » <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Waaye Yeesu inahhaa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Cey, e ɗu kosaaɗi, wa ye tah ɗu woyee ŋ harmban ɗu an : “ A ini ɓoo raakɗi mbuuru ? ” <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Ɗu inahɗi poyi e ? Ɗu alkoh alkoh mbuuruuca yatuus ca paysohsee ɓooɓa junni-yatuus (5000) ca e, tasɗohiica ɗu ɓayndohee, ca nikee pañe hend na ? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Na mbuuruuca yasna-kanak ca paysohsee ɓooɓa junni-nikiis (4000) ca, tasɗohiica ɗu ɓayndohee, ca nikee dammba hend na ? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Tumoh na po ɗu minɗi inah ne mi na woye mbuuru haa ? Wortukaat lawiiriŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci na <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci ! » <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa inahha ne a woyee ɓa ne ɓa wortuk lawiiriŋ mbuuruuci haa, waaye ne ɓa wortuk jangɗohiŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci na <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer woyiɗ ne a Yeesu Mucɗohi Gapohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yeesu kaɗta ɓak Seesare-Filip, wa a ree, a meekissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɓooɓi na woye ne <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> a yi ɓa ? » <verse eid="MAT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Raakiɗ ɓi na woye ne a fu <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char>, ɓum na woye ne a fu <char style="w">Ilyas</char>, ɓinooɓi woyee ne a fu Yeremi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35-36">2 Nguur ci 35–36</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1-2">Yeremi 1–2</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1-5">Miskiɗuk ci 1–5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">Dañeel 9:2</ref></char></note> wala woosuuɗ wiiriis ŋ ɓa ɗeɓgaan. »<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yeesu meeksissa ɓa ne : « Moo nga ɗu nak, a mi ɓa ? » <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simong Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « A fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ Koohi</char> na pese<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: findi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyoha, ŋ camba, e Kooh dong nikee te Yeesu yi Woo kiŋ ɗe, nikee nga ɗe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1">Saaŋ 1</ref></char>). Yeesu, findi a hayoh Adina, wa ɗalohiɗ na findi ɓooɓi na hayohe nga ; a raakɗi baabu ŋ kehƴi. A Kooh tum po a rimukka ŋ ɓitiɓ inhaaɗi ƴaar te malaakaani gapoh raakuukiŋ ɗe woo ne a hey ɓeeɗkohse Kuɓkiŋ yi Ɗafkiɗi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Macce 1:18-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:26-56">Luk 1:26-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:1-20">2:1-20</ref></char>) kon ini a puloh ŋ Kooh weɗ tah a ɓeeɗkohsee Kuɓkiŋ Kooh. Kuɓkiŋ Kooh, wa tokisɗi ne Kooh ɓay faan a rimmba kuɓu na ɓitiɓ findi ɓo'.</char></note>. » <verse eid="MAT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu neɓɗiɗ Simong kuɓkiŋ Yoona, a ɓo' moondiɗ ɗa ini fu lof haa, waaye a Baabiŋ ngo yi ŋ Eel ci !<verse eid="MAT 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Mi, ŋ woo ne a fu Piyeer, weɗ atoh ; ŋ hey yipe ɓi Janguuniŋ ngo findi taɓah ŋ atoh feem te doolndiŋ kakaan ki sah minɗanɗi wa ali in. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Ŋ hey ɗa eɗe caaɓeeciŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki ; in nu fu sangoh ŋ kehƴi ɗah, wa hey nike ini Kooh sangoh ŋ Eel ci, te in nu fu teyɗuk ŋ kehƴi ɗah, wa hey nike ini Kooh teyɗuk ŋ Eel ci. » <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Yeesu nakka taalubeeci ne ɓa kinaat woo ali ɓo' ne a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe na hultiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Ini kooɗoh ndeem, Yeesu cammba woo woo jahran na taalubeeciŋ ɗe an : « Ŋ joyiɗ kaɗ Yerusalem, ŋ yaaɓ keeh-keeh ŋ yaah ciŋ yakak ci na kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh ciŋ wa, ŋ apu te ŋ hultiɗu ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh. »<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Piyeer gukka ɗe, ngaseeɗa ɗe an : « Kilifaani, Kooh mucɗaat ɗa nga ! Ineem rahsanɗi ɗa muk ! » <verse eid="MAT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Waaye Yeesu heelukka, woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka ndii, kaɗa ŋ finhooso, seytaaniini ! Fu na jaɗɗee so fiir. Liiɓohaaɗiŋ ɗa hunɗi na wiŋ Kooh, fu na liiɓe findi ɓo'. »<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɓo' nu waaɗ hun na so ɗah, a joyɗi liiɓ haf ce, a degkaat kurwaani aa hee daaƴohse, a ñaakiɗ to. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Laam, ɓo' nu waaɗ muciɗ kiñin kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a heya ñake. Waaye ɓo' nu ñak kiñin kiŋ ɗe saguuso ɗah, a heya rahsisse. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Ɓo' raak adinaani jen na in ci nik nga te a ñak kipes kiŋ ɗe, ineem raakiɗ ɗe winde njiriñ ? Ɓo' min romkoh kipes kiŋ ɗe na ye ?<verse eid="MAT 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Ee, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey hayisse na malaakaaciŋ ɗe, na yaki Baab ɓa yak, a hey atte'e yaa nu nga ngaŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓi ɓo' ɓii ŋ ndii ɓa kaananɗi muk te ɓa hotɗi Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hayee findi buur. »<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Siñaarɗiŋ yaki Yeesu yak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Wa degga neeh yasna-yino, Yeesu ɓayya Piyeer na Saak na Saaŋ taambɗoh Saak, a kaɗta ɗaaya na ɓa ŋ ɗafuk tango njooliɗ ; <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>ndaam a ɓoƴsukka ŋ fikiiɓa, fikiiriŋ ɗe melciɗeeɗa findi nohi, kulɓaaciŋ ɗe nikka yaanow tar haa siñaar. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Ɗekka po woosuuɗ kanak teeɓukka ɓa, ɓa nikee <char style="w">Musaa</char> na <char style="w">Ilyas</char>, ɓa woyeeɗa na ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Ŋ ineem, Piyeer woosa Yeesu ne : « Kilifaani, wa baahiɗ ne ɓoo nik ndii, fu waaɗa ɗah ŋ hey haɓɗe ndii ɗiip kaahay, winoori nik wiŋ ɗa, winni nik wiŋ Musaa, wi tas nik wiŋ Ilyas. »<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Wa a na woye ineem, eel hayya nga ɓa, wa siñaarɗeeɗa siñaariɗ, wa ulla ɓa. Hooso kerhukka ŋ ɗooƴ eela an : « Yii a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ</char> ngo ŋ waaɗ keeh-keeh, yi neɓ po ŋ keeñ. Sikɗukaat ɗe ! » <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Wa taalubeeci nikee nga kerah woo keem, ɓa tiitta keeh-keeh, ɓa keennda, ɓa ruɗta fikiiciŋ ɓa ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yeesu reɓpa laalla ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kurkaat, kinaat tiit ! » <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Weɗ ɓa markoh, ɓa hotɗi ali ɓo' ɗal Yeesu kiik ce njong.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Wa ɓa ruhsee tangoora, Yeesu dennga ɓa ne : « Ini ɗu hot wii kinaata woo ali ɓo' po <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hultiɗu. » <verse eid="MAT 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah jangɗohoh ciŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> woyee ne Ilyas joyiɗ hayis paaɗ<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:23">Malasi 3:23</ref></char></note> ? » <verse eid="MAT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ee ! Ilyas joyiɗ hay ne a doknoh in ci jen po ca yurah. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne Ilyas hayiɗ, ɓooɓi inhisɗi ɗe, ɓa tummba ɗe ini neɓ ɓa, ɓa na hee name torhiɗoh Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ɗaa. » <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Ŋ ndeem, ɓa inahha ne a na woyee ɓa <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char>.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ njaanja raakee kombeɗ-mbeɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa reɓgoheeɗa mboolnda, raakka ƴaari hay, ƴekka ŋ fiki Yeesu, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, kuɓkiŋ ngo ƴaari miskaat ɗa, a raak kombeɗ-mbeɗ, wa yaaɓɗiɗ ɗe lool, a na gene keen ŋ yongkaah wala masuɓ. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Ŋ ɓayiɗ ɗe ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗa, waaye ɓa minɗi ɗe wiriɗ. »<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Ɗu ɓi ɓooɓi woti-woti e ɗu kosaaɗi, ɗu yahukka, ŋ nikan nik na ɗu, ŋ muñɗee ɗu po kiɗa ? Komaat to ɗe ndii. » <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yeesu ngassa <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiinnda</char> ambee njaanja, jiinnda pulla, njaanja wirra ŋ ɗiska ɗiska.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Wa taalubeeci ɗaay na Yeesu, ɓa reɓpa nga ɗe, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah po ɓoo minɗi aañ jiinnda ? » <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « E kosi ɗu kos ƴissuut weɗ tah. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗu raak kos hend na kuɓu mutarda ƴissuut, ɗu woo tangoorii ne wa kurkaat ndii, wa kaɗ nden ɗah, wa hey kaɗe ; ali in wooñanɗi ɗu. [<verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak aayaanii : "Te jiini mand an e kiim Kooh na or weɗ na aañee ɗe." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem. Aaya mand naa raakiɗ ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 9:29">Maarko 9:29</ref></char>.</char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe nikka ŋ Galile. A woosa ɓa ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey degse ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓooɓi, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>ɓa ap ɗe, a hultiɗu ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh. » Wa ɓa kerah woo keem, ɓa soossa sem.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirndiɗ lempo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Wa Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ree Kapernawum, ɓooɓa meeksohee lempoonaŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> yurhiɗta ŋ Piyeer, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohiŋ ɗu eɗohanɗi lempooniŋ Kahan Kooh e ? » <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Piyeer woosa ɓa ne : « Aha'kay ! » Wa a ree kahna, bala a woyan ɗah, Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Simong, fu liiɓ ye nga ? Buur ciŋ Adina ɓa na meekse ɓinde juuti mbaa lempo ? Kuɓuuciŋ ɓa wala jaambur ci ? » <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>A loffa ɗe ne : « Jaambur ci. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kon kuɓuuci ɓaahɗi nga. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Waaye ne ɓoo sang ɓa ɓek liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi, kaɗa cookma, fu ree ɗah, fu njaf ostukohaani, fu nook cuurndi kocan hay, fu rangis nguɓiŋ ɗe ɗah, fu hey raake hanjar yino nga ; ɓayaa, fu eɗ ɓa wa, wa nik wirndiŋ lempooniŋ ngo na wiŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓoyi uup ngaŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Waam weɗ taalubeeci reɓoh ŋ Yeesu, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Ya ɓa uup ngaŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki ? » <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>A ɓeeɗukka komaaki ƴin, a tufkiɗta ɗe ŋ leerooɓa, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>a woosa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗu ɓoƴsohɗi mandohaaɗ po ɗu mand na komaaki ɗah, ɗu aasanɗi ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki.<verse eid="MAT 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Weɗ tah, yaa nu ruhsiɗ haf ce po haa komaakndii ɗah, a yi uupan ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Te yaa nu teyɗuk njaanj findi yii saguuso ɗah, a teyɗuk ko. <verse eid="MAT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>Yaa nu bakaaɗɗukoh yino ŋ komaakci ƴin ci kos so ɓii ɗah, ini hee ngisohe nga ɗe, weɗ ne a toku atoh ɓitiɗ ŋ mbooh, a diigɗu ŋ ɗiska uup nooɗ ŋ cookma.<verse eid="MAT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Mas adinaani ! In ci na ɓaye ɓo' bakaaɗ laayiɗ ! Te ca minɗi nik raakaaɗi waaye mas ɓoyi na hee ca ɓeke ! <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>Yaahiŋ ɗa wala kotiŋ ɗa waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, nguɗaa ca, fu mbet ca usiɗ ; aas ŋ kipes ki na yaah yino wala kot yino, weɗ ngisoh fu njafu na kot ciŋ ɗa kanak ci wala yaah ciŋ ɗa kanak ci ŋ yongkaaha ƴimanɗi muk. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Hasiŋ ɗa waaɗ ɗa ɓek ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, nihsaa, fu mbeta usiɗ ; aas ŋ kipes ki na has yino weɗ ngisoh fu njafu na has ciŋ ɗa kanak ci ŋ yongkaaha yakka.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>Kinaat heef ali yino ŋ ɓi ƴissuut cii ! Ee, ñam na woyee ɗu wa, malaakaaci na niiɗee ɓa nik ŋ Eel ci na gene hot jahran Baabiŋ ngo yi nik nga. [<verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>] <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak aayaanii : "Laam Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hayiɗ ne a muciɗ ɓi muuƴe." Waaye Fiis ci uup maañ ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem. Aaya mand naa raakiɗ ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luk 19:10</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbaal hotkiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Ɗu liiɓ ye ŋ inii ? Ɓo' raak mbaal teemet (100), yino muuƴ nga ɗah, a faɗanɗi ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na yasna-nikiis ci (99) ŋ tangoora a kaɗ waaka yi muuƴ e ? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, a hot ɗe ɗah, sumi a suman nga, weɗ uupan wi a sum ŋ ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na yasna-nikiis ci muuƴaaɗiici. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Wa mand ɗaa, Baabiŋ ɗu yi nik ŋ Eel ci waaɗɗi ne ali yino ŋ ɓi ƴin cii muuƴ.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓaah fu bakaaɗ ɗah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>Ɓaah fu bakaaɗ [nga ɗa] ɗah, kaɗa nga ɗe kiik fu, fu woo na ɗe. A kerhiɗ ɗa ɗah, fu raakiɗ keeñiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>A kerhiɗɗi ɗa ɗah, huna na ɓo' yino wala kanak, fu kaɗis nga ɗe. Laam, Fiis ci woo ne : “ Seede kanak wala kaahay raak ɗah, in nu nik miniɗ tufkiɗu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Rohƴiɗi 19:15</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>A sang ɓa kerhiɗ ɗah, woyaa ɓooɓiŋ Janguuni. A sang kerhiɗ Janguuni ɗah, ambaa ɗe findi kosaaɗi na <char style="w">juuti'oh</char>.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh : In nu ɗu sangoh ŋ kehƴi ɗah, wa hey nike ini Kooh sangoh ŋ Eel ci, te in nu ɗu teyɗuk ŋ kehƴi ɗah, wa hey nike ini Kooh teyɗuk ŋ Eel ci.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hun kiim Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>Ñam woyis ɗu wa [te wa keeh] : Ɓo' kanak kerhiɗoh nga ɗu ndii, ŋ kehƴi, ne ɓa kiim Kooh ŋ in nu wa min nik ɗah, Baabiŋ ngo yi nik ŋ Eel ci hey ɓa wa haɓɗiɗe. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Laam ɗisik nu kanak mbaa kaahay coh ŋ tiikiŋ ngo ɗah, mi yii ŋ harmban ɓa. »<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗaastiɗoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Weɗ Piyeer reɓoh ŋ Yeesu, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ɓaah ho tumee so in ɗah, ŋ joy ɗe ɗaas po waas hend na ? Waas yasna-kanak e ? » <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ wooɗi ɗa waas yasna-kanak rek waaye, waas ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak waas yasna-kanak (70×7).<verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Laam, Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mand na inii : A nikee buur, a waaɗta ne dag ciŋ ɗe teeɓ ɗe ini a dengkohee ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Wi a camb, a komuusa dagi joy ɗe wirind saaku hanjar junni-ndaŋkiyaah (10.000). <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>A minɗi ɗe wirind. Ŋ ineem buuri nakohha ne dagi toonsaat findi <char style="w">ñaam</char> a yi na ɓitiice na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe na in ci a raak jen, a wirndohu kombot ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Waaye dagi ƴekka ŋ fiki kilifaaniŋ ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : “ On ndo ƴissuut, ŋ hey ɗa ca wirnde jen ! ” <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>A misikka kilifaani lool, yeem ɗaassa ɗe kombot ki, a faɗta ɗe, a cootta.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>Wi dagi pul, a cohha na ƴaar ɓaah na ɗe panguk, yi joy ɗe wirind <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">dinaar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa hanjar haalis, <char style="tl">dinaar</char> yino weɗ pangkoh bumit wirndassee ŋ neeh yino ŋ jamanoonaam.</char></note> teemet (100) dong, a ammba ɗe, a ooƴca ɗe ; a woosa ɗe ne : “ Wirind ndo koporiŋ ngo ! ” <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Ƴaari ƴekka ŋ fikiice kiimeeɗa ɗe an : “ On ndo ƴissuut rek, ŋ hey ɗa wirnde. ” <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Waaye dagi sannga tic, a taƴca ƴaari ŋ kaso, a sekeeɗa ne a wirind ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Dag ci ɓinooɓi hotta ini raak, wa misikka ɓa lool, ɓa kaɗta, ɓa naandsukka kilifaana findi wa raakoh jen. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Weɗi kilifaaniŋ ɗe nakoh ɗe ɓeeɗkiɗu, a woosa ɗe ne : “ Fu dag añaandiɗ ! Fu ɗaasnukiɗ to po ŋ ɗaassa ɗa ini fu joyee so wirind jen. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Morom fu joyeen ɗa nam misik findi fu miskohee so. ” <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Kilifaani ayrukka, a taƴca daga ŋ kaso ne a mbugalu. Daga nikka nga, a sekeeɗa ne a wirind kombot kaŋ ɗe jen. »<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Baabiŋ ngo yi ŋ Eel ci tumohan na ɓo' nu nga ɗu ɗaa ne ɗu ɗaasɗi morom ciŋ ɗu na keeñ soosiɗ ɗah. »<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Faɗ ɓitiɓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo woo ceem, a kurkohha Galile, a kaɗta ɓakaŋ kur caŋ Yudee ŋ finho kalaŋ Yurdan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Mboolo yakak ñaakiɗta ɗe nga, a wiriɗta kosaayiɗ caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>
    <char style="w">
      <char style="tl">Farisen</char>
    </char> ci hayya nga ɗe, ɓa waaɗta ɗe woyɗukoh woo uupiɗ, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Andi waasi teyɗohiɗ ne, wa neɓ ƴaar ɗah, a miniɗ faɗ ɓitiice ŋ in na nu wa min ki nik ɗah ? » <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Wa mand haa ne ɗu jangɗi ŋ Fiis ci ne Kooh yi ferohi, wi a na fere ŋ camba, a fer ɓa ƴaar na ɓitiɓ ; <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>a woosa ne : “ Weɗ tah ƴaar hey saɓsukohe na yaay na baab, a ŋoɗ ŋ ɓitiice, jaar ɓa kanak, ɓa nik faan yino.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Camba 2:24</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Mbaa, ɓa nikisɗi kanak, ɓa faan yino kotii. Kon, ini Kooh ambsoh, ɓo' kinaata saɓsoh. »<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Moo wa ye tah <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakohha ne ɓo' faɗe ɓitiice ɗah, a fiisɗaat ɗe kayti teeɓoh ne a faɗiɗ ɗe ? » <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « E ndengi ɗu ndeng keeñ weɗ tah Musaa teyɗukiɗta ɗu ineem, wa nikoheeɗi ɗaa ŋ cambohaana. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Waaye ñam na woyee ɗu ne : yaa nu saɓsukoh na ɓitiice te nikɗi ne yeem njaalo'ee njaaloo ; a ɓay ɓitiɓ wiiriis ɗah, a na njaalo'e. »<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Taalubeeci woosa ɗe ne : « Nik ne wa mand ɗaa ŋ ƴaar ɗah, e tokaaɗi ɓitiɓ ngisoh ! » <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « E ɓooɓi jen minan teyɗuk ini maa hee woye wii haa, waaye e ɓi Kooh ona dong. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Laam raakiɗ ɓi nga, ɓa na rimke rimuk na yoomkiŋ ɓa, ɓum nga a ɓo' na ɓucee ɓa, raakiɗ ɓi nga, ɓa na tokeeɗi ɓitiɓ sagu Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki. Ɓoyi min teyɗuk, teyɗukaat ini ŋ woo. »<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na komaakci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Ɓi ɓo' ɓayeeɗa ɗe ɓi komaaki ƴin ne a deg ɓa yaah ciŋ ɗe, a kiimiɗ ɓa. Waaye taalubeeciŋ ɗe ngaskeeɗa ɓooɓeem. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Faɗaat komaakci, kinaat ɓa hondoh hay nga so, ɓooɓi mand na ɓa ɓeɗ raak Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki. » <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>A degga ɓa yaah ciŋ ɗe po ƴutta, a kurkohha ndaam.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ƴaara na raak-raakaŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Weɗ ƴaar reɓoh ŋ Yeesu, a woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ŋ joy ye haɓiɗ in baahiɗ ne ŋ min raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe ? » <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah fu meeksee so ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ baah ? A Yino dong baah te a Kooh. Fu waaɗ raak kipes ki keeh-keehi ɗah, taambɗa nakoh ci. » <verse eid="MAT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « Ci nde nakoh ? » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 19:18">« Fu apanɗi ɓo' ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 19:18">fu njaaloo'anɗi ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 19:18">fu rokanɗi ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 19:18">fu woyɗanɗi ɓo' ini raakɗi ;<verse eid="MAT 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>eɗa yaay ɗu na baab ɗu cir ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 19:19">te fu waaɗ morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Pula 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Rohƴiɗi 5:16-20</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « In ceem jen mi yii taambiɗ ca, ŋ taskohu ye wiiriis ? » <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗ mit ɗah, kaɗa fu toon ini fu raak, fu eɗa ñakiɗ ci te fu hey raake alal ŋ Eel ci. Ƴut ɗah, fu hay, fu ñaakiɗ to. » <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Wa ƴaara kerah woo ceem, a cooteeɗa goyoh na goyoh, a nikee heɗ raak-raak.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, wa yooɓɗi ne heɗ raak-raak aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Ñam na woyissee ɗu ne ngeelemb taamb ŋ ngul kufic weɗ uup yooɓ heɗ raak-raak aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. » <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Wa taalubeeci kerah woo keem, wa feyya ɓa po ɓa inhisɗi ini ɓa haɓɗan, ɓa woosa ne : « Kon a ya ɓa min mucɗu ? » <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yeesu marakka ɓa, woosa ɓa ne : « Wa wooñiɗ ɓo' waaye raakɗi ini wooñ Kooh. »<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Ŋ ineem Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Moo ɓoo nak ? Ɓoo faɗiɗ in ciŋ ɓoo jen, ɓoo ñaakɗiɗ ɗa ; ɓoo raakan ye ŋ ineem ? » <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, mbehi in ci jen na hee ɓoƴsohse, wi <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> na hee ɓoofohe ŋ ɓoofoha-buuri na teeɓohe yaki a yak, ɗu ɓi na ñaakɗee so, ɗu hey name ɓoof ŋ ɓoofoha-buur ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ne ɗu adgoh cuuɓ ciŋ Israayel ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12).<verse eid="MAT 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Te yaa nu faɗ kahan, wala taambɗoh ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ, baab, yaay, kuɓu, wala yohon saguuso ɗah, ini a ñak, a heya rahse ini uup waas teemet (100) te a hey raake kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Laayiɗ ŋ ɓi adug woti, ɓeɗ mirndohan, te laayiɗ ŋ ɓi mirndoh, ɓeɗ adgan.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Heɗ nguuki na pangkoh ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mand na inii : A nikee heɗ kahan, a kurukka na ɓaaɓ-teel ne a kooɗ ɓi ɓo' ɓi na hee ɗe pangkiɗe ŋ nguukiŋ reseñiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>A woosa na ɓa po ɓa kerhiɗohha ne ɓa na hee ɗe hooɓkiɗe panguk, a wirind ɓa yaa nu nga ɗah hanjar haalis yino. Ƴutta, a tuuƴca ɓa nguuka.<verse eid="MAT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>A pulissa ŋ yoor-yoor, a hotta ɓi pangkoh wiiriis ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɗiska na toonohse ŋ kur ka, haɓɗaaɗi in. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>A woosa ɓa ne : “ Kaɗaat ɗu nama panguk ŋ nguukaŋ ngo, ŋ hey ɗu wirnde ini ɗu joy wirndu. ” <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Ɓeem kaɗta. A pulissa ŋ ɓak njooloor na ɓak tisbaar, a tumissa ɗaa.<verse eid="MAT 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>A pulissa ŋ ɓak takusaan, a raakissa ɓi ɓo' ŋ cohohaana, a woosa ɓa ne : “ Wa ye tah ɗu hooɓukka ɓoof ndii haɓɗaaɗi in ? ” <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : “ Ali ɓo' kooɗɗi ɓoo ne ɓoo panguk. ” A woosa ɓa ne : “ Kon namaat kaɗ, ɗu pangka ŋ nguukaŋ ngo. ”<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>Wa niina ree, heɗ nguuka woosa ƴaara taambkohee in caŋ ɗe ne : “ Ɓeeɗka pangkoh ci, fu wirind ɓa ; camboha ŋ ɓi mirndoh hay po ŋ ɓi koc. ” <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Ɓa kooɗsee ŋ takusaana, kaɗta yaa nu nga ɗah, eɗuusa hanjar haalis yino. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Wa kaɗeeɗa po wa reesa ŋ ɓa kocee kooɗu, ɓa liiɓpa ne ɓeɗ uupɗan wirind, waaye yaa nu nga ɗah, nammba rahas hanjar yino.<verse eid="MAT 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Wa ɓa eɗsee ca, ɓa ñaɗtukeeɗa ŋ heɗ nguuka <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>an : “ Ƴaaɓii ɓeɗ mirndoh hay, ɓa panguk wahtu yino dong, fu eɗee ɓa in hend na ini fu eɗ ɓoo te ɓoo hooɓuk yaaɓ na pangki na dohɗiŋ nohi ! ”<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Heɗ nguuka loffa yino nga ɓa ne : “ Ƴaariŋ ngo, ŋ tooñɗi ɗa. Ɓoo kerhiɗohee ne mi na hee ɗa wirnde hanjar yino haa e ? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Mbaa ɓaya ini fu raak te fu coot ; ŋ waaɗa waaɗ, ŋ eɗta ƴaari mirndoh hay in hend na ini ŋ eɗ ɗa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Andi ŋ minɗi minɗi tum ini ŋ waaɗ na raak-raakiŋ ngo ? Wala wa siis amb ɗa ŋ baahi ŋ baah ? ” » <verse eid="MAT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Ɓi mirndoh adgohan ɗaa, ɓi adug mirndoh. »<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyissiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu kaɗeeɗa Yerusalem, a ɓeeɗukka taalubeeci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) kiik ɓa, a woosa ɓa ŋ waasa ne : <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>« Ɗu hot nga, ɓoo ɓii kaɗ Yerusalem, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hey faɗse ŋ yaah ciŋ kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh ciŋ wa ; ɓa hey ɗe atte'e ne a apu. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Ɓa eɗ ɗe ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut ne ɓa njembit ɗe, ɓa laɓ ɗe leraw, ɓa daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa, ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh, a hultiɗu. »<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓuuciŋ Sebede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Weɗi yaayiŋ kuɓuuciŋ Sebede reɓoh ŋ Yeesu. A hunee na ɓa, a ƴekka ŋ fiki Yeesu ne a kiim ɗe in. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗ ye ? » A woosa ɗe ne : « Woya ne fu kaɗ po fu nik buur ɗah, a kuɓuuciŋ ngo kanak cii daran ɗa, yino lah ɗa yaah-ñaahum, yi tas lah ɗa yaah-sing. » <verse eid="MAT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Yeesu loffa ne : « Ɗu inahɗi ini ɗu na kiime. Ɗu miniɗ an ŋ kaasiŋ miskiɗi maa hee ane e ? » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ee ɓoo miniɗa. »<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Wa keeh ne ɗu hey ane ŋ kaasiŋ ngo, waaye ini kaɗ ŋ yi lahan ndo yaah-ñaahum na sing, e ñam woyan ɓa haa, e ɓooɓi Baabiŋ ngo kooɗkiɗa ɓeɗ eɗsana. »<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Wa taalubeeca ndaŋkiyaah ca ɓinooɓa kerah ineem, ɓa ayrukka ɓa kanak ca. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Waaye Yeesu ɓeeɗukka ɓa jen, woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inhiɗ ne ɓooɓi adgoh kur ci na degee deg ɓooɓiŋ ɓa yaah, ɓooɓi uupiɗ hatil uupohee doole. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Wa joyɗi nikoh ɗaa nga ɗu ; ɓo' nu waaɗ nik ɓo' yakak nga ɗu ɗah, a teyɗukaat nik surgaaniŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Te ɓo' nu waaɗ adug nga ɗu ɗah, a teyɗukaat nik <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ɓi tas nga ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Findi Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi, a hayɗi ne a raak surga, a hay ne a nik surga te a eɗoh kipes kiŋ ɗe ne a tos ɓo' laayiɗ. »<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ fuuliɗ ca kanak ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Wa ɓa aas Yeriko po ɓa puleeɗa, mboolo yakak ñaakiɗta ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Wa raakeen fuuliɗ kanak ɓoofiɗ ŋ mbeeddaana, ɓa kerahha ne a Yeesu na taambe, ɓa leehkeeɗa an : « Kilifaani, setiŋ Dawuuda, ɓoo miskaat ɗa ! » <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Mboolnda ngaskeeɗa ɓa ne ɓa ɗek. Waaye ɓa uupeeɗa leehuk ŋ ɗafka an : « Kilifaani, setiŋ Dawuuda, ɓoo miskaat ɗa ! »<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yeesu tufukka, ɓeeɗukka ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu waaɗ ne ŋ haɓɗiɗ ɗu ye ? » <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, has ciŋ ɓoo rangsukaat ! » <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Ɓa misikka Yeesu lool, a laalla has ciŋ ɓa, ŋ ɗiska ɗiska ɓa hoteeɗa. Ƴutta ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Aasaŋ Yeesu ŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe taalndiɗta ŋ waas Yerusalem. Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa heeɗa ree, teemb kur kaŋ Betfase, ŋ sero Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca, Yeesu woossa kanak nga ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ŋ kur ki ŋ fikiiɗu wii, ɗu ree rek ɗah, ɗu hey hote mbaam riɓ tokuuɗ nga na cumbriŋ ɗe. Toksaat ca, ɗu kom mbo ca ndii. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Te ɓo' meekis ɗu ɗah, woyaat ɗe ne : “ A kilifaani etoh ca. ” Ŋ ineem, a jaaran ɗu faɗ ɗu hay na ca. » <verse eid="MAT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Ineem raakka ne ina woosuuɗa woyee raak :<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>« Woyaat kur kiŋ Siyong ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">“ Buuriŋ ɗa yii hay nga ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">a ruhsiɗiɗ haf ce, a rap mbaam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">cumbur mbaam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">ɗoopaat sifoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sakriya 9:9</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Taalubeeca kanak ca kaɗta, ɓa haɓiɗta ina Yeesu nakee ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Ɓa ɓayya mbaama na cumbra, ɓa raɗta kulɓaacaŋ ɓa nga ca, Yeesu rappa. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ mboolnda raɗiɗta ɗe kulɓaacaŋ ɓa ŋ waasa ; ɓum raɗɗeeɗa ɗe na saaf ciŋ kidig ci ɓa piike. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Mboolnda hunnda kaɗeeɗa, ɓum adugka Yeesu, ɓum ñaakeeɗa nga ɗe ; ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">« <char style="tl">Hosaana</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Hosaana</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ ɗeɓgaana, wa tokseen ne : "Woti-woti, mucɗa ɓoo." Wa nikee kiim Kooh. Waaye, wa kaɗta po wa nikka woo yakɗoha Kooh.</char></note> setiŋ Dawuuda !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Ɓoyi na haye ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi, a raakaat barke !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabuur 118:26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="tl">Hosaana</char> ŋ jol jol ɗafka ! »<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Wa Yeesu aasee Yerusalem, kur ka jen yoondeeɗa yoond, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ya ɓa yii ? » <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Mboolnda loffa ne : « A Yeesu, Woosuuɗiŋ Kooh, yi puloh Nasareet ngaŋ Galile. »<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Kahan Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Wa Yeesu ree, a aassa ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a aannja toonoh ca na romoh ca nikee nga jen, a folla taaɓul caŋ wecce'oh ca, na ɓoofohaacaŋ toonoh banuut ca. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Kooh woyiɗ ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci ne : “ Kahan ndo teeksan kahan kiimoha Kooh,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esayi 56:7</ref></char></note> ” waaye ɗu tumiɗa ɗembohaaniŋ rokoh ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Yeremi 7:11</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Ɓi fuuliɗ na ɓi yiiɓoh hayya nga ɗe ŋ Kahan Kooh, a wiriɗta ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh caŋ wa hotta in ca feyohiɗ ca a haɓiɗ na leehka komaakca leehkee ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh an : « <char style="tl">Hosaana</char> setiŋ Dawuuda ! » Ɓa ayrukka, <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>ɓa woosa Yeesu ne : « Fu kerhiɗ ini ɓa na woye e ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « Ee, ŋ kerhiɗa, waaye hanaa ɗu moosɗi jangoh inii ŋ Fiis ci : “ Fu tumiɗ po komaakci ƴin ci na gooy ci ɓa ɗii ƴeek ɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Sabuur 8:3</ref></char></note> ” » <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Ƴutta, a faɗta ɓa ndaam, a pulla kur ka, a kaɗta Betani, a neehha nga.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu alkiɗ nduna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa, a dokkisseeɗa kur-taaha, a aɗukka. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>A hotta tas ndun ŋ sero waasa, a reɓpa nga waaye a hotɗi ali in nga ɗal saaf. A woosa nduna ne : « Fu heyɗi rimisse muk ! » Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, nduna suyya. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Wi taalubeeci hot ineem, ɓa feyuusa, ɓa woosa ne : « Wa min na nikoh nduni suy ŋ ɗiski ɗiski ? » <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗu kos te ɗu raakɗi liiɓ kanak nga ɗah, ɗu hey haɓɗe ini ŋ haɓiɗ nduni, ali ɗu woo sah tangoorii ne wa kurkaat ndii, wa kaɗ keena ŋ cookma ɗah, wa hey raake. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>In nu ɗu kiim Kooh na kos ɗah, ɗu hey wa rahse. »<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ya ɓa tufkiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Wa Yeesu kaɗ po a aassa ŋ Kahan Kooh, kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na yakak ca hayya nga ɗe, wa raak ɗe jangɗoheeɗa, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « In ci fu na haɓɗe, fu gaƴuk nde po fu kaannja ca haɓiɗ ? Ya ɓa tufkiɗ ɗa po fu haɓɗee ca ? » <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ hey ɗu name meekis in yino, ɗu lof fo ɗah, ŋ nam ɗu woo ini tufkiɗ to po ŋ haɓɗee in cii. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Ya ɓa tuuƴee <char style="w">Yahya</char> ne a ɓoktoh, a Kooh wala ɓi ɓo' ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɓoo woo ɗe ne Kooh a yi woos Yahya ɗah, a na hee ɓoo woye ne : “ Wa ye tah ɗu kosɗi ɗe ? ” <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Te ɓoo woo ne, e ɓi ɓo' tuuƴ ɗe ɗah, a', mboolndi cariɗ neƴƴoh. Ɓa jen ɓa amb ne Yahya nikee woosuuɗ. » <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Weɗ ɓa lofoh ɗe ne : « Ɓoo inahɗi. » Yeesu nammba ɓa woo ne : « Ŋ namanɗi ɗu woo ini tufkiɗ to po ŋ haɓɗee in cii. »<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ baabi na kuɓuuci kanak ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu liiɓ ye ŋ naandsukii ? A nikee ƴaar, a raakka komaaki ƴaar kanak, a woosa yi koc ne : “ Kuɓu, woti kaɗa fu pangka ŋ yohnaŋ reseñaŋ ngo. ” <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Kuɓka loffa baab ɓa ne : “ Ŋ heyɗi kaɗe. ” Waaye, wa degga ƴissuut, inwaaso ammba ɗe, a kaɗta. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>A kaɗissa ŋ yinoora, a woyissa ɗe ineem. Yeem loffa ɗe ne : “ Ee baab, ŋ hey kaɗe. ” Waaye, a kaɗɗi. »<verse eid="MAT 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Yeesu meekissa kilifaaca ne : « Komaakci kanak ceem, a yinde tum waaɗ-waaɗiŋ baab ɓa nga ɓa ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A yi koc. » Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> ci na toonkoh ci ɓa ɗaa adug ɗu ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Laam Yahya hayiɗ, a teeɓohha waasi yurhiɗi ; ɗu kosɗi ɗe. Waaye juuti'oh ci na toonkoh ci kosiɗ ɗe te ɗu hotiɗ ŋ ineem waaye poyi ɗu ɓoƴsohɗi pesohaaɗ ne ɗu kos ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ guuroh reseñ ci añaandiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Sikɗukaat andiin wiiriis an : A nikee heɗ kahan, a yippa yohon reseñ. A ɗinngaa po wa willa, a acca nung pooƴoha reseña nga, a haɓiɗta paraang niiɗohaa wa. Ƴutta, a hanndaa deg ŋ yaah ɓi guuroh reseñ ne wa ruund ɗah ɓa paysoh ; a ɓaaɓpa. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Wa nguɗaŋ reseña ree, a tuuƴca <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗe ŋ guuroh ca ne a rahas ɓakiŋ ɗe ŋ reseñi. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Guuroh ca ammba ñaam ca ; ɓa laɓpa yi, ɓa appa yum, ɓa tapsohha ya tas atoh. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>A tuuƴissa ɓi ñaam wiiriis, ɓi uup laay ɓa koc, waaye guuroh ca tummba ɓa ina ɓa tumee ɓen rek.<verse eid="MAT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Ŋ mirndaani, a woossa kuɓkiŋ ɗe, a woosa ŋ haf ce ne : “ Ɓa hey supke kuɓkiŋ ngo. ” <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Waaye wa guuroh ca hot kuɓka, ɓa woosa harmban ɓa ne : “ Lamohiŋ yohni a yi ! Hayaat ɓoo ap ɗe, ɓoo raak lamaahiŋ ɗe. ” <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Ɓa ɓayya ɗe, ɓa puliɗta ɗe yohna, ɓa appa ɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>Ŋ ineem, Yeesu woosa ne : « Heɗ yohniŋ reseñi hay ɗah, a tuman guuroh ceem na ? » <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓooɓi baahaaɗiiceem, a hey ɓa ape fut, a deg yohna ŋ yaah ɓi guuroh wiiriis, ɓi eɗan ɗe ini a raak nga ŋ jamanoonaŋ wa. »<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Mand haa ne ɗu moosɗi jangoh ini Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo wii : “ Atoh fi taɓahoh ci mbetee mirndohiɗ nik atoh fi amb taɓahi. Wa puloh ŋ Heɗ ɓoo, wa in feyohiɗ nga ɓoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sabuur 118:22-23</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 21:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>Weɗ tah, ñam na woyee ɗu ne : Nguuriŋ-Kooh hey teyse ŋ yaah ɗu, cuuɓ wiiriis wi eɗohan rim ciŋ wa, hey wa eɗse. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Ɓo' nu keen ŋ atoh feem ɗah, a hey weersukohe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Esayi 8:14-15</ref></char></note> te ɓo' nu wa keen ŋ ɗafuk ce ɗah, wa hey ɗe ruñuɓsohe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:44-45">Dañeel 2:44-45</ref></char></note>] »<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca marakka woo ka, ɓa inahha ne Yeesu woyee ini kaɗ nga ɓa ŋ andiin ca. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Ɓa waakeeɗa findi ɓaa hee ɗe ambohe, waaye ɓa neƴƴoheen mboolnda, laam ɓeem ambee ɗe findi Woosuuɗ.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓooɓi ɓeeɗku ŋ kilook</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yeesu kooɗissa woo ka, a woyisseeɗa na ɓa ŋ andiin an : <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>« Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mand na inii : A nikee buur, a haɓɗiɗeeɗa kuɓkiŋ ɗe ƴaari ceeke yakak ŋ kilookiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>A woossa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗe ne ɓa kaɗ ɓeeɗka hanheeci joy hay ŋ kilooki ; waaye ɓooɓa ɓeeɗkassee waaɗɗi hay. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>A tuuƴissa ɓi ñaam wiiriis, a woosa ɓa ne : “ Kaɗaat, ɗu woo ɓa ne ŋ haɓɗiɗ kañam ki po ƴutiɗ, ŋ apiɗ inoh ciŋ ngo na ɗoopaat ci ŋ yafale, in ci jen ƴutiɗ, ɓa hayaat kilooki ! ”<verse eid="MAT 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Waaye ineem yoondiɗɗi ɓooɓa ɓeeɗkasse, yaa nu nga ɗah, cootta waas ce, ɓum kaɗta ŋ yohon caŋ ɓa, ɓum ŋ toontukaŋ ɓa ; <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>ɓinooɓa ammba ñaam ca woosse, mbugalla ɓa, appa ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Weɗi buura ayrukoh, tuuƴca soldaar caŋ ɗe ne ɓa ap ɓooɓi ap ñaam ceem, ɓa doh kur ka.<verse eid="MAT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Ŋ ineem buura woosa ñaam caŋ ɗe ɓinooɓa ne : “ In ci joy ceeke'ohu ƴutiɗ waaye hanheeci ɓeeɗkasse yeyyooɗi ca. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Kaɗaat ŋ ɗisik ci ɓooɓi na cohe, ɓo' nu ɗu hot ɗah, ɗu ɓeeɗuk ɗe ŋ kañam ki. ” <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Ñaam ca kaɗta ŋ waas ca, ɓa ɓeeɗukka ɓooɓa ɓa cohee na ɓa jen, baahiɗ na baahaaɗi po kahna riiffa na hanhe.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>Buura aassa ne a marak ɓooɓi hay ŋ kañam ki, a hotta ɓo' nga ɓekkaaɗi kulɓa ceeke'oha. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>A woosa ɗe ne : “ Ƴaariŋ ngo, fu tumoh na po fu aassa ndii te fu raakɗi kulɓa ceeke'oha ? ” Ƴaara lofɗi ali in. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Weɗ a woyoh surgaaca ne ɓa tokaat kot caŋ ƴaara na yaah caŋ ɗe, ɓa njaf ɗe ŋ hara, ŋ ñuusa, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raakan. » <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Laayiɗ ɓeeɗkuuɗ waaye ɓi kooɗu laayɗi. »<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lempooniŋ Sesaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Ŋ ineem, <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca kaɗta coha ne ɓa marak findi ɓa jaɗɗohan Yeesu fiir po ɓa amb ɗe ŋ woo ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Ɓa tuuƴca nga ɗe ɓi taalube ɓaah nga ɓa na ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ langtoh caŋ Herod, ɓeem woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo inhiɗ ne fu woyoh keeh te fu na jangɗohe waasiŋ Kooh ŋ keeh. Fu nupɗi ali ɓo', laam fu na markeeɗi ŋ yaki ɓoyi yak. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Kon woya ɓoo ini fu liiɓ ŋ inii : Wa waas ne Sesaar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sesaar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: buur nu tufkiɗasseen Rom ɗah, a meeɗ ɓay tiiki Sesaar, waaye yaa nu nga ɓa raakeen tiikiŋ ɗe haf ce.</char></note>, buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, wirndasse lempo wala ? »<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Waaye Yeesu inheen baahaaɗiikaŋ ɓa ; a loffa ɓa ne : « Naafeehaaci, wa ye tah ɗu waaɗee so ɓek ? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Teeɓaat to kopori na ambohse lempo. » Ɓa eɗta ɗe <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> yino. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>A meekissa ɓa ne : « Ya ɓa raak nataalii, na tiiki nik nga ? » <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A Sesaar. » Ŋ ineem, a woosa ɓa ne : « Eɗaat Sesaar ini Sesaar raak, te ɗu eɗ Kooh ini Kooh raak. » <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Ŋ woo ceem, ɓa feyuusa jen, ɓa faɗta ɗe, ɓa cootta.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu lofiɗ <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ci ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ hulti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Mbaɗi, ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char> ca hayya nga ɗe, ɓeɗ ɓi na woye ne kaaniɗ ci hultanɗi. Ɓa meekissa ɗe <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>an : « Jangɗohohi, <char style="w">Musaa</char> woo ne ƴaar nu kaan te a raawɗi raak kuɓu ɗah, e taambɗoh ce tokan ɓitɓi a faɗ ne a raakiɗ kaaniɗi kuɓu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Rohƴiɗi 25:5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Laam nga ɓoo, wa raakeen taambɗoh yasna-kanak, saawi tokka ɓitiɓ, a kaannda raakaaɗi kuɓu, taambɗoh ce ɗaakka ɓitiice. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Yeem nammba kaan raakaaɗi kuɓu na ɗe, yi kaahayɗoh nammba tum ɗaa po yi yasna-kanakɗoh. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Wa ɓa kaan jen, ŋ mirndaani, ɓitɓi kaannda.<verse eid="MAT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ɓooɓi hulit ɗah, a nikan ɓiti ya ɓa ŋ ƴaaɓi yasna-kanak ci, laam ɓa jen, ɓa tokiɗ ɗe ? »<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inahɗi ini Fiis ci woo, ɗu inahɗi hatiliŋ Kooh, weɗ tah ɗu muuƴ. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Ɓooɓi hulit ɗah, ƴaar ci heyɗi toke ɓitiɓ, ɓitiɓ ci heyɗi tokse, ɓa mandan na malaakaaciŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Te ini kaɗ ŋ hultiŋ kaaniɗ ci, mand haa ɗu jangɗi ini Kooh woo ɗu nga wii : <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>“ Ñam Koohiŋ Ibrahiima na Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Pula 3:6</ref></char></note> ” Kooh, a Koohiŋ kaaniɗ ci haa, waaye a Koohiŋ pesiɗ ci. » <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Wa mboolnda kerah jangɗohiŋ ɗe weem, ɓa yeemuusa.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nakohi uup yak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Wa <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca yeg ne Yeesu rangiɗ nguɓ caŋ <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ca, ɓa cohha. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Yino nga ɓa, jangɗohoh yakak ŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char>, waaɗta ɗe markis ; a meekissa ɗe ne : <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>« Jangɗohohi, a winde nakoh uup yak ŋ nakoh ciŋ waasi ? »<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « “ Waaɗa Heɗ ɓoo Koohiŋ ɗa na keeñiŋ ɗa jen, na ruuhiŋ ɗa jen, na liiɓiŋ ɗa jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Rohƴiɗi 6:5</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Weɗ nakohi uup yak te weɗ koc ŋ nakoh ci. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Wi kanakɗoh te wa raakiɗ njiriñ findi wi koc, weɗ ne : “ Waaɗa morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Waasiŋ Musaa na jangɗoh ciŋ woosuuɗ ci jen gaƴuk ŋ nakoh ci kanak cii. »<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mucɗohi Gapohse ye ŋ Dawuuda ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Waam raak <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca ris ŋ ɗiska, Yeesu meekissa ɓa ne : <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>« Ɗu liiɓ ye ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> ? A setiŋ ɓa ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A setiŋ Dawuuda. »<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43-44"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Dawuuda woo ŋ Fiis ci ne : “ Heɗ ɓoo woyiɗ Heɗ to ne : ‘Ɓoofa ŋ ñaahmiŋ ngo po mbaɗna ŋ folan ɓi sang ɗa, fu tum ɓa degoha kot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:43-44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabuur 110:1</ref></char></note>’ ” Kon Dawuuda ɓeeɗkohee Mucɗohi Gapohse Heɗ ce, haa e ? Te raak Dawuuda riifiɗ na <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>, kon wa min na nikoh ? <verse eid="MAT 22:43-44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Mbaa nik ne Dawuuda ɓeeɗkohee ɗe Heɗ ce ɗah, a min na nikoh setiŋ ɗe ? »<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Jaarra ali ɓo' minɗi ɗe lof ali in, ina kooɗoh waam, ɓo' kaañisɗi ɗe meekis ne a markisuk ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Ŋ finho ineem, Yeesu woyeeɗa na mboolnda na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>an : « Jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ci lamiɗ <char style="w">Musaa</char> ne ɓa teeɓoh waasi. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Kerhiɗaat ɓa te ɗu tumee in ci ɓa na woye jen, waaye kinaat mand na ɓa ŋ tumohaaɗ. Ɓa na woye woo, ɓa na tumeeɗi. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Ɓa na toke ɗuf ɓitiɗ, ɓa raanee ca ɓooɓi te ɓa waaɗɗi ca reɓ sah na lecem ndukun.<verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>In ci ɓa na haɓɗe jen, ɓa na waake hotaat to nga. Hey ɗah, ɓa ɓaat angiɗ aayaaciŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci na tokse ŋ puk na yaah,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:8">Rohƴiɗi 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:18">11:18</ref></char></note> ɓa ɓaat simbir-simbir ciŋ kulɓaaciŋ ɓa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:37-41">Kind ci 15:37-41</ref></char></note> na naandsee ɓa nakoh ciŋ waasi. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Ɓa ɓeeɗku kañam yakak ɗah, ɓa na waaɗe ne ɓa ɓoofan ŋ ɗisik ci uup eɗu cir. Ɓa na name waaɗ nik ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ngaŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Ɓa na waaɗe ne ɓooɓi kañɗan ɓa yaah kanak ŋ ɗisik ci na toonohse ŋ kur te ɓa waaɗ ne ɓooɓi ɓeeɗkan ɓa "<char style="tl">Rabbi</char>" (weɗ jangɗohohi yakki).<verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Waaye ɗu, kinaat tum haf ɗu "<char style="tl">Rabbi</char>". Laam ɗu raak jangɗohoh yino, ɗu jen e ɗu taambɗoh. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Kinaat teek ali ɓo' baabiŋ ɗu ngaŋ kehƴi, laam Yi nik ŋ ɗafki dong a yi Baabiŋ ɗu, <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>te ɓa kinaat ɗu ɓeeɗuk njiit, ɗu raak njiit yino dong, <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>.<verse eid="MAT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Yi uup nik kilifa nga ɗu, a yi joy nik surgaaniŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Ɓo' nu meeɓ haf ce ɗah, a hey ruhsiɗasse te ɓo' nu ruhsiɗ haf ce ɗah, a hey meeɓse.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ! E ɗu naafeeha ! E ɗu na range waasi, ɗu hondoh ɓooɓi aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki ! Ɗu aasɗi, ɗu faɗanɗi ɓooɓi waaɗ aas ne ɓa aas. [<verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci, e ɗu naafeeha ! E ɗu na ñame raakuuɗiŋ ɓitiɓ ci ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan po kahan ciŋ ɓa sah. Ɗu kiimee Kooh ɗah wa minuu reeh, ɗu waakee hotaat to ; ineem weɗ tah po, a mbugaliŋ ɗu uupan misik." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ! E ɗu naafeeha ! Ɗu ɓi wil cookom na keheƴ ne ɗu waak tuuɓoh, te ɗu raakka yino dong ɗah, ɗu tum ɗe ɓo' safara po a uup ɗu wa nik waas kanak.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>Mas adgiɗ ci fuuliɗ ci ! Ɗu na woye ne : “ Ɓo' giñ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahniŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, in nikɗi nga ; waaye a giñ ŋ ursi nik nga ɗah, wa giñ tufkiɗ. ” <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>E ɗu naand ɗu fuulla ! Kon e winde uup raak njiriñ, e ursi wala Kahan Kooh wi na tahe ursi ambu findi in hooliɗ wuu Kooh ? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Ɗu na name woo ne : “ Ɓo' giñ ŋ seeƴkohaana nik ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh ɗah, wa in haa ; waaye a giñ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴka</char> degu nga ɗah, wa giñ tufkiɗ. ” <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Fuuliɗ ci ! Kon wa ye uup raak njiriñ, e seeƴki wala seeƴkohaani na tahe wa ambu findi in hooliɗ ?<verse eid="MAT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Ɓoyi na giñe ŋ seeƴkohaani na giñe nga na in ci nik ŋ ɗafuk wa jen ; <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>wa mand ɗaa, ɓoyi na giñe ŋ Kahan Kooh na giñe nga, a giñee ŋ Yi gen nga ; <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>wa nam mand ɗaa, ɓoyi na giñe ŋ Eel ci na giñe ŋ ɓoofoha-buuri nik nga na Kooh yi ɓoof nga.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ! E ɗu naafeeha ! Ɗu ɓii eɗoh sah in ci ƴin ƴin ci ɗu na guure findi naana na safɗohaaci cinooci ndaŋkiyaah nu nik yinoori, te ɗu sagankohiɗ in ci uup raak njiriñ ŋ waasi : Ca nikka yurah, na raak yirmande na amb ŋ Kooh, ineem weɗ ɗu joyee tum, te ɗu sang sagankoh ci tas.<verse eid="MAT 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Adgiɗ ci fuuliɗ ci ! Ɗu na siɗe caafu ƴin te ɗu na one ngeelemb ! <verse eid="MAT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>Mas jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ! E ɗu naafeeha ! Ɗu mand na ɓooɓi ɓohoñ finhooriŋ kaasi na palaati te ɗooƴi riifiɗ na in ci ɗu raakoh ŋ rok na yeeɓkaaɗi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/><char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci e ɗu fuul ! Kocaat ɓohoñ ɗooƴiŋ kaasi te finhoori hey hoole.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ! E ɗu naafeeha ! Ɗu mand na ruy-ruy ci penturu yaanow ; ŋ finhoori ca na nike ye moɗan waaye ŋ ɗooƴi ca riif na ƴoh ɓo' kaaniɗ na usuɓ nu usuɓ. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Ɗu mand ɗaa, ɗu na teeɓe ɓooɓi ñaamaar ɓo' yurhiɗ te ɗu riif na naafeeha na ɗal waas.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci ! E ɗu naafeeha ! Ɗu ɓi na taɓahe ruy-ruy ciŋ woosuuɗ ci, ɗu moɗsinee ruy-ruy ciŋ yurhiɗ ci, <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>ɗu woyee ne : “ Ɓoo maaseen jamanoocaŋ caac caŋ ɓoo ɗah, ɓoo heeɗi hune na ɓa ŋ aami ɓa aamee ñif maŋ woosuuɗ ca. ” <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Ŋ ndeem, ɗu na seede'ɗe haf ɗu ne e ɗu kuɓuuciŋ ɓooɓi ap woosuuɗ ci. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Reytinaat ini caac ciŋ ɗu camb ! <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Ini ɗu añaand haa iiñ jen, ɗu min na mucoh ŋ atteeniŋ yongkaahi yakki ?<verse eid="MAT 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Weɗ tah ŋ woo ɗu ne : Mi, ŋ hey ɗu woosohe ɓi woosuuɗ, ɓi heɗ haf, na ɓi jangɗohoh. Ɗu hey ape nga ɓa, ɗu daaƴ ɓum ŋ kurwaa, ɗu laɓ ɓinooɓi leraw ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagog</char> ciŋ ɗu, ɗu taambɗee ɓi na saandohe kur po kur, <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>wa hey tahe po ñif miŋ yurhiɗ ci aamu ŋ kehƴi jen keen ŋ ɗafuk ɗu, ina kooɗoh ŋ ñif maŋ Abel yurhiɗi po ŋ Sakariya kuɓkiŋ Barasi yi ɗu ap ŋ Kahan Kooh, ŋ harmban <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hooliɗa</char> na seeƴkohaana. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, in ceem jen keenan ŋ ɓooɓi woti.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>Cey Yerusalem, fu yi na ape woosuuɗ ci, fu tapee ɓooɓi fu na woosohse atoh po ɓa kaan, waas hend na weɗ ŋ waaɗ nangɗoh kuɓuuciŋ ɗa findi pambi na nangɗohe ƴiil ciŋ ɗe ŋ ooɓ ce, waaye ɗu moosɗi waaɗoh ! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Ɗiski wa nik ɗu hey faɗse na kahan ɗu, kahan ɗu nikan ɓarang cos. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Laam ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ɗu hotissanɗi so po mbaɗna ɗu na hee woye ne : “ A barke'iɗ, yi na haye ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗ ɓoo !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabuur 118:26</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yahuukiŋ Yerusalem na hayisiŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Wa Yeesu pul <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> kaɗeeɗa, taalubeeciŋ ɗe hayya nga ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Marka taɓah ciŋ Kahniŋ Kooh, findi ca moɗoh ! » <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu hotiɗ in cii jen haa e ? Ñam woo ɗu wa te wa keeh, ali atoh tasanɗi ŋ ɗafuk atoh ŋ ndii, ca jen ca hey yahrohse. »<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yeesu kaɗta ɓooffa ŋ Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca, taalubeeci reɓpa, ɗaayya na ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Woya ɓoo jamanooni in ceem na hee raakohe, na ini na hee teeɓohe hayiŋ ɗa na reehiŋ Adina. »<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Wortukaat, ali ɓo' kinaat ɗu muuƴiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Laam ɓo' laayiɗ hey haye ɓa kooɗ tiikiŋ ngo, ɓa woyee ne ɓeɗ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> te ɓa hey muuƴɗe ɓo' laayiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Ɗu hey kerhoote ɓi hiñoh yakak, ɗu hey name kerah yegɗoh ci na woye ŋ hiñoh. Waaye, wortukaat neƴƴoh ; in ceem joy joy raak, waaye wa nikanɗi ne Adina na reehe. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Cum ɗah, kur hey hiñohe na kur morom wa, buur hey hiñohe na buur morom ce, aɗ raak ŋ ɓi ɗisik, kehƴi namee yoondɗuk ŋ ɓi ɗisik, wa nikohan ɗaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Ceem jen ca nikan cambiŋ miskiɗ ci, findi ɓitɓi na hee ɓasle.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>Ɗu hey ɓayse ne ɗu mbugalu, ɗu hey apse, cuuɓ ci jen hey ɗu sange saguuso. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Laayiɗ nga ɗu hey keene ; ɓum hey wore ɓum, ɓa hey sangtiɗohe. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ hey haye ɓa tum haf ɓa woosuuɗ te ɓa woosuuɗ haa, ɓa hey muuƴɗe ɓo' laayiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Wa hey kaɗe po waaɗi ɓo' laayiɗ waaɗ morom ciŋ ɓa haawsuk sagu eɗaaɗi waas cir ; <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>waaye ɓoyi na hee ndengɗuke muñ po ŋ reehɗohaana, hey mucɗasse.<verse eid="MAT 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>
    <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wiŋ Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki, hey yegɗohse ŋ adinaani jen, wa nik seede ŋ cuuɓ ci jen, ƴut ɗah, reehiŋ Adina han hay.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>Kaɗ po ɗu hot ini araamiɗi na yahrohe tufkiɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiski Hooliɗi</char> findi woosuuɗi Dañeel woyohee wa ɗah<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dañeel 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note>, - Fu yi na jange Fiis cii, inha ! - <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>ɓooɓi wa raakan ŋ Yudee, ɓa saandohaat ŋ tangooca. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Ɓoyi wa raakan ŋ ɗafuk teeraasiŋ ɗe, a ruhsee ɗah, a kinaat aas ne a na hee ɓaye in ciŋ ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ kahan ce ; <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>ɓoyi wa raakan ŋ yohon ca, a kinaat gurid ne a ɓay kulɓaakiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Mas ɓitiɓ ci na hee nike rook ŋ jamanooneem na ɓapɗoh ci ! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Kiimaat Kooh po saandohiŋ ɗu nikuu ŋ jamanooniŋ soosi wala ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Laam ɓooɓi hey raake miskiɗ lool, miskiɗ mand ɗaa moosɗi raakoh ina Adina nikoh poyi te wa raakissanɗi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Te mbeh ceem haawsasseeɗi ɗah, ali kiñin heeɗi muce, waaye ca hey haawsasse sagu ɓooɓi Kooh tan.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>Ŋ jamanoonaam ɓo' woo ɗu ne Mucɗohi Gapohse yii ŋ ndii wala ŋ nden ɗah, kinaat ɗe kos. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Laam ɓi ɓo' hey haye, ɓa tum haf ɓa Mucɗohi Gapohse wala woosuuɗ te ɓa yino nga ca haa, ɓa haɓɗee firnde yakak na keemaan ne ɓa muuƴiɗ ɓooɓi po ɓi Kooh tan sah ne wa mineen nik ɗah. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Weɗi weem nak, ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa bala wa hayan.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>Ɓa woo ɗu ne : “ A yi ŋ ndii ŋ kehƴi hulangi ” ɗah, kinaat kaɗ. Wala : “ A yaa ɗasɗukka nden ” ɗah, kinaata kos. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Findi meleñ na pulohe ŋ pulohaaɗ-noh, wa ñiiniɗ po ŋ muyohaaɗ-noh, hayiŋ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> mandan ɗaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Ɗiski fiɗaaf nik, suur ci na cohe nga.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>Miskiɗ ciŋ mbeh ceem reehee rek ɗah, nohi ñuus, caɓni ƴim, hor ci keen te hatil ci nik ŋ eel ci yoondɗu. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Firndeeniŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey hotke ŋ eel ci, teemb ndeem, cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen hey miskiɗke te ɓa hey hote Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi, eel ciŋ Asamaan haytohee ɗe, a riif na hatil na kiyak. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Kuluɓ hey ɗiiɗɗe, a woos malaakaaciŋ ɗe, ca kaɗ ɓak po ɓak ŋ adinaani jen ne ɓa teembɗoh ɓooɓi a tan.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>Inhaat ini nduni jangɗoh : Kaɗ po naak ciŋ wa hiƴ, wa camb kifis ɗah, ɗu na jaare inah ne rehi usisɗi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Wa mand ɗaa, ɗu nam hot in ceem jen ɗah, inhaat ne wa usisɗi, weɗi ŋ nguɓu kahni. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓooɓiŋ adinaani woti kurkohanɗi nga jen te in ceem jen raakɗi. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Eel ci na kehƴi hey coote waaye woo ciŋ ngo moosanɗi kurkoh nga.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ mbehi na wahtuuni in ceem na hee raakohe, ali ɓo' inahɗi ca. E malaakaaciŋ Eel ci haa[, te a <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> haa] ; waaye a Baabi dong inaha. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hay ɗah, wa mandan findi wa mandee ŋ jamanoonaŋ Noohin. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Waam, bala masma laayɗa riifee kehƴi hayan ɗah, ɓooɓa nikee ñameeɗa, aneeɗa, ɓa kilookeeɗa, ɓa kilookseeɗa po mbeha Noohin aasoh ŋ gaala. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Ɓa inheeɗi in nga po wa masma hay, wa ɗummba ɓa jen. Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hay ɗah, wa mandan ɗaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Ƴaar kanak hey nike ŋ yohon, yinni ɓayu, yi tas faɗu. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Ɓitiɓ kanak hey hune oɗe, yinni ɓayu, yi tas faɗu. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Kon, kinaat neeh, ɗu inahɗi mbehi Heɗ ɗu hayohan. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Inhaat ne heɗ kahni inheen wahtuuni roki na hee aasohe kahan ce ɗah, a heeɗi neehe ŋ ɗooƴ weki po kahan ce kee aassa. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Weɗ tah po, ɗu, namaat kooɗuk, laam Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hayan ŋ jamanooni ɗu liiɓɗi. »<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>Yeesu ɓaatta nga ne : « Ya ɓa a yi <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char> woor te a ñaannja po, heɗ ce hee ɓaaɓe ɗah, a dengkoh ɗe pangkoh ciŋ kahni ɓinooɓi ne a eɗee ɓa kañam ŋ jamanooniŋ wa ? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Ñaameem hey neɓɗe ne heɗ ce hay, raak ɗe tume ineem findi a nakohee ɗe wa ɗah. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, heɗ ce hey ɗe tufkiɗe, a adgoh in ciŋ ɗe jen.<verse eid="MAT 24:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Waaye ñaameem baahaaɗi po a woo ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne heɗ ce hayɗi paaɗ, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>a nik nga a laɓee ɓooɓi a na pangke na ɓa, a ñame, a anee na laaroh ci ɗah, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>heɗ ce hey haye ŋ mbehi a foogɗi, ŋ wahtuuni a inahɗi. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>A hey ɗe mbugale, a ɓay ɗe ŋ naafeehaaca, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raak. »<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ cafaƴ ci ndaŋkiyaah ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ jamanooneem, Nguuriŋ-Ɗafki mandan na inii : Ɓa nikee cafaƴ ndaŋkiyaah ɓi kee taambka heɗ kilooki, yaa nu nga ɓayya laampaaniŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Cafaƴ ci yatuus ci nikee cafaƴ naandiɗ, yatuus ci tas nikka ñaañiɗ. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Yatuus ci naandiɗ ci, wi ɓa kaɗee, ɓa ɓayndohɗi diwliin wuu laampaaciŋ ɓa ; <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>waaye ñaañiɗ ci, wi ɓa kaɗe, yaa nu nga ɗah, ɓayndoheen diwliin ŋ inaa.<verse eid="MAT 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Wi wa kaɗ po heɗ kilooki hooɓiɗta hay, ɓa pani'uusa jen, ɓa neeheeɗa. <verse eid="MAT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>Ngaŋ ndengelnde weka, ɓa kerahha leehuk an : “ Heɗ kilooki hiiɗ ! Kaɗaat ɗu taambkaa ɗe ! ” <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Weɗi cafaƴ ca kurkoh, ɓa haɓɗeeɗa laampaacaŋ ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Naandiɗ ca yatuus ca woosa ɓinooɓa ne : “ Laampaaciŋ ɓoo ca ɗii ƴim, onaat ɓoo ŋ diwliin ciŋ ɗu. ” <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Ñaañiɗ ca woosa ɓa ne : “ Muk ndaa ciŋ ɓoo doyanɗi ɓoo te ca doyanɗi ɗu ; kaɗaat ɗu roma ŋ toonoh ci. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Weɗi ɓa kaɗoh roma, heɗ kilooki hayya ŋ finhooɓa. Ɓa kooɗkee po ƴutta hunnda na ɗe, ɓa aassa kahna kilooka joy haɓɗohu, buntaanaŋ kahna ranguusa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>Wa degga ƴissuut, cafaƴ ca ɓinooɓa hayya, ɓa woosa ne : “ Kilifaani, kilifaani, rangsiɗa ɓoo ! ” <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>A loffa ɓa ne : “ Ñam woo ɗu wa te wa keeh, ŋ inahɗi ɗu. ” » <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Kon kinaat neeh laam ɗu inahɗi mbehi na wahtuuni <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayohan.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Andiiniŋ ñaam ca kaahay ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>Wa nam mand na ƴaari ɓaaɓe, a ɓeeɗukka <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗe, a dengkohha ɓa taambkohiŋ raak-raakiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>A eɗta yaa nu nga ini a min ɓay ; yi koc saaku kopor yatuus, yinoori saaku kanak, yi tas saaku yino. Ƴutta, a cootta. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Yi eɗu saaku yatuus arra kaɗ, a toontukka na ca po ca rimmba saaku yatuus wiiriis. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Yi eɗu saaku kanak nammba tum ɗaa, ca rimmba saaku kanak wiiriis. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Waaye yi eɗu saaku yino kaɗta acca nung, a ɗasiɗta koporiŋ kilifaaniŋ ɗe nga.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>Wa kilifaani ɓaaɓ maañiɗ po a hayya, a woosa ɓa ne ɓa teeɓaat ɗe findi ɓa tumoh na koporiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Ya eɗsee saakuuca yatuus ca hayya na ca, a woosa ne : “ Kilifaani, fu dengkohee so saaku yatuus, ŋ toontukiɗ na ca po ŋ raakissiɗ saaku yatuus, ceɗi cii. ” <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Kilifaani woosa ɗe ne : “ Wa baahiɗ, fu ñaam baahiɗ cariɗ oolku ; fu cariɗ oolku ŋ in ci ƴin ci weɗ tah ŋ hey ɗa dengkohisse in laayiɗ. Haya ɓoo ɓaah sumi ŋ sum. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Ya eɗsee saakuuca kanak ca nammba kaɗ woosa kilifaana ne : “ Kilifaani, fu dengkohee so saaku kanak, ŋ toontukiɗ na ca po ŋ raakissiɗ saaku kanak ; ceɗi cii. ” <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Kilifaana woosa ɗe ne : “ Wa baahiɗ, fu ñaam baahiɗ cariɗ oolku ; fu cariɗ oolku ŋ in ci ƴin ci weɗ tah ŋ hey ɗa dengkohisse in laayiɗ. Haya ɓoo ɓaah sumi ŋ sum. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Yi eɗsee saakndi yinoori hayya, a woosa ne : “ Kilifaani, ŋ inheen ne fu ɓo' miskiɗ, fu na nguɗe ini fu sokɗi, fu ɓeenee ŋ ɗiski fu saawɗi ; <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>ŋ neƴƴoh neƴƴoh, ŋ ɓayya koporiŋ ɗa, ŋ accaa. Weɗi wii, ɓayaa. ” <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Kilifaani woosa ɗe ne : “ Ñaami baahaaɗiini tirɓiɗi ; fu inheen ne maa nguɗe ini ŋ sokɗi, ŋ ɓeenee ŋ ɗiski ŋ saawɗi, <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>fu mineeɗi ɓay koporiŋ ngo ŋ ɗaakoh kopor ci ne ŋ hay ɗah, ŋ raaka rimɗiɗ to in e ? <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Ɓayaat saakndi nik na ɗe, ɗu eɗa yi raak saakuuci ndaŋkiyaah ci.<verse eid="MAT 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Laam ɓoyi raak hey ɓaatse po a laayiɗ lool, waaye ɓoyi raakɗi, ini ƴissuuti a amb sah hey naafse nga ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Te ñaami raakaaɗi njirñi, mbetaat ɗe ŋ ñuusa ŋ hara, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raak. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atteeni mirndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hay ŋ yaki a yak na malaakaaci jen ɗah, a hey ɓoofe ŋ ɓoofoha-buuri nik wiŋ ɗe, wi na teeɓohe yaki a yak. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Cuuɓ ci jen cohɗohu ŋ fikiice. A paysohee ɓum na ɓum, findi niiɗoh na talsohohe mbaal ci na pe' ci. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Te a hey ɓaye mbaal ci yaah-ñaahum, a ɓay pe' ci yaah-sing.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Ŋ ineem, buuri hey woye ɓi nik ŋ ñaahmiŋ ɗe ne : “ Hayaat ɗu ɓi Baabiŋ ngo barke'iɗ, ɓayaat Nguuri a kooɗkiɗee ɗu wa adinaani feru po wi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Laam ŋ aɗkeen, ɗu onnda so ŋ ñammba. Ŋ sifaɗkeen, ɗu onnda so ŋ annda. Ŋ nikeen ɓoyi ɗu inheeɗi, waaye ɗu daliɗta so ŋ kahan caŋ ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Ŋ ɓangtasseen kulɓa, ɗu ɓekiɗta so. Ŋ kosaayeen, ɗu hayya so ɗoohɗe. Ŋ taƴseen ŋ kaso, ɗu kaɗta so marka. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Yurhiɗ ci hey ɗe lofe ne : “ Heɗ ɓoo, ɓoo hot ɗa aɗkiɗ kiɗa, ɓoo onnda ɗa fu ñammba ? Wala sifaɗkiɗ, ɓoo onnda ɗa fu annda ? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Kiɗa weɗ ɓoo hot ɗa findi ɓoyi ɓoo inahɗi, ɓoo daliɗta ɗa ? Wala ɓangtuuɗ, ɓoo ɓekiɗta ɗa kulɓa ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Kiɗa, weɗ ɓoo hot ɗa kosaayiɗ wala taƴuuɗ ŋ kaso, ɓoo kaɗta ɗa marka ? ”<verse eid="MAT 25:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Ŋ ineem, buuri hey ɓa lofe ne : “ Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ali nik ne ɗu haɓɗiɗ in ceem yino ŋ taambɗoh ciŋ ngo uup heefu sah, ɗu haɓɗiɗ to wa. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>Ƴut ɗah, a hey woye ɓi lahan ɗe ŋ yaah-sing ne : “ Usaat to, ɗu ɓi alkuuɗ ci ! Ɗu kaɗ ŋ yongkaaha genan, yongkaahi Seytaani kooɗkiɗu na malaakaaciŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:41 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">malaakaaciŋ Seytaani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: findi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci jangɗohoha, feruuɗ ci minɗi hotu jen, ca nikee malaaka wa ca na ferse. Cum nga bakaaɗta, ca njafuusa ŋ kehƴi. Seytaani, a yi kilifaaniŋ ca. Ini uup laay, ca woyissuuɗi "malaaka", ca raak tiik wiiriis ŋ gerek. Tiikeem, weɗ ɓoo na tokse "jiini". Marka teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:31">Camba 1:31</ref></char>, <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:24">Camba 3:24</ref></char>, <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 28:11-19">Esekiyeel 28:11-19</ref></char>, <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maarko 3:20-30</ref></char>, <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:17-20">Luk 10:17-20</ref></char>. Ndii, ca woyu "malaaka", tiikiŋ ca ɗeɓgaan.</char></note> ɗe hun na ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Laam ŋ aɗkeen, ɗu onɗi so kañam. Ŋ sifaɗukka, ɗu onɗi so ŋ an. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Ŋ hayiɗ nga ɗu, findi ɓoyi ɗu inahɗi, ɗu daliɗɗi so. Ŋ ɓangtuusa kulɓa, ɗu ɓekiɗɗi so. Ŋ kosaayeen, ŋ taƴuusa ŋ kaso, ɗu kaɗɗi so marka. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Ɓa hey ɗe name lof ne : “ Heɗ ɓoo, ɓoo hot ɗa aɗkiɗ, sifaɗkiɗ, hanhe, ɓangtuuɗ, kosaayiɗ wala taƴuuɗ ŋ kaso kiɗa te ɓoo taambkohɗi ɗa ? ”<verse eid="MAT 25:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Ŋ ineem a hey ɓa lofe ne : “ Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ali nik ne ɗu haɓɗiɗaaɗi in ceem yino ŋ ɓi uup heefu ɓii ɗah, ɗu nik ko ca haɓɗiɗaaɗi. ”<verse eid="MAT 25:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Te ɓii na kaɗe ŋ mbugala heyɗi reehe, waaye yurhiɗ ci na kaɗe ŋ kipes ki heyɗi reehe. »<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Kilifaaci kooɗkiɗ ap Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo woo ceem jen, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>« Ɗu inhiɗ ne tas neeh kanak feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakiŋ</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Paak</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Saafi inah feet <char style="tl">Paak</char> yino, wa nikka wiŋ <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> ci. <char style="tl">Paakiŋ</char> <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> ci puloh ŋ <char style="tl">Paakiŋ</char> Yawuut ci, weɗ ne, <char style="tl">Paakiŋ</char> Israayel ci. Ɓa cammbaa haɓiɗ ŋ jamanoonaŋ Musaa, mbeha Israayel ci puloh <char style="w">Misra</char>. Waɗ Kooh woo ɓa ne, kahan nu nga ɗah, haɓɗaat mbuuru raakaaɗi lawiir, ɓa nam ap mbaal, ɓa ɓay ñif miŋ ɗe, ɓa reefa ŋ leentooni na ɓak ci kanak ciŋ buntaani. Ŋ wekaam, saaw ciŋ ɓi Misra jen kaannda, waaye ŋ kahan ci reefsee ñif, ali ɓo' kaaneeɗi nga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12">Pula 12</ref></char>). Yeesu, e woosuuɗi <char style="w">Yahya</char> teek ɗe "Mbaaliŋ Kooh" (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Saaŋ 1:29</ref></char>), te kakaan kiŋ ɗe, wa nikee ŋ feetiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:15">Macce 27:15</ref></char> ; <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 18:28">Saaŋ 18:28</ref></char>), po a nikka kotii Mbaaliŋ <char style="tl">Paaki</char> asi. A yi kaan ne ñif miŋ ɗe min muciɗ ɓooɓi ŋ kakaan. Weɗ tah po <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> laayiɗ na woye feetiŋ kakaan kiŋ Yeesu na hultiŋ ɗe "<char style="tl">Paak</char>", findi feetiŋ Israayel ci maañiɗi.</char></note> Yawuut ci ree ; <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hey eɗohse ne a daaƴu. »<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Ŋ neeh ceem, kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca na yakak caŋ cuuɓi cohha ŋ kahan seeƴkiɗoha yakka, a teeksee Kayif. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Ɓa kerhiɗohha ŋ woo findi ɓa hee tume po ɓa amb Yeesu te ɓo' yeguu, ne ɓa apɗuk ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Waaye ɓa woyee ne wa joyɗi nik ŋ ɗooƴ feet ci, ɓa sangee ne ɗuuɗ raak ŋ ɗooƴ ɓooɓa.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓitiɓ tumiɗ laackoloñ ŋ hafiŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Waam, Yeesu kaɗta Betani ŋ kahan Simong Gaanaana, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>ɓitiɓ hayya nga ɗe na <char style="tl">buteel</char> haɓɗohuuɗ <char style="tl">albaatar</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">albaatar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa atoh moɗiɗ, yooɓiɗ pestu, wa na etohse haɓɗoha tumoha laackoloñ.</char></note> tumiɗ laackoloñ ɗoɓiɗ, a yiiffaa ŋ hafiŋ Yeesu, raak ɗe ñameeɗa.<verse eid="MAT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Taalubeeci hoteeɗa ŋ ineem, ɓa neɓuuɗi, ɓa woosa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗe yahrohe laackoloñi ɓarang ɓarang ? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Wa mineen toonohu kopor keeh-keeh, ñakiɗ ci eɗuu wa. »<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yeesu inheena, woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na yaaɓɗohe ɓitɓi ye ? A haɓɗiɗ to in ye baahan. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ ñakiɗ ci, ɓa genan gen na ɗu waaye mi, ŋ heyɗi gene nik na ɗu. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Ŋ aami a aam mbo laackoloñi, a na kooɗkiɗe acuukiŋ ngo. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɗisik nu <char style="w" lemma="Yegɗohiŋ Muci">Yegɗohiŋ Mucii</char> woyu ŋ adinaani jen ɗah, ini a haɓiɗ hey woyse nga, naandsukohaa ɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yudaa tufkiɗ ne a wor Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Weɗi Yudaa Iskaryot, yino ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), kaɗoh ŋ kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na hee so ye eɗe ne ŋ deg Yeesu ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗu ɗah ? » Ɓa eɗta ɗe hanjar haalis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30). <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Jaarra a sekɗoheeɗa findi a eɗndohohan ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ŋ feetiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Ŋ mbehi koc ŋ feetiŋ Mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-28">Pula 12:1-28</ref></char></note> ci, taalubeeci hayya woosa Yeesu ne : « Fu waaɗ ne ɓoo haɓɗiɗohan ɗa kañam kiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char> nde ? » <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>A woosa ne : « Kaɗaat Yerusalem, ŋ kahan diw, woyaat ɗe ne Jangɗohohi woo ne jamanooniŋ ɗe reɓiɗ, a waaɗ haɓiɗ feetiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char>, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ŋ kahan fu. » <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Taalubeeci tummba findi a woyoh ɓa, ɓa kooɗkiɗta kañam kaŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char>.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Wa niina ree, Yeesu ɓooffa na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) ne ɓa ñam. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Wa ɓa ñamee a woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam woo ɗu wa te wa keeh, yino nga ɗu hey yo eɗndohe. » <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Ɓa soossa sem, yaa nu nga woyeeɗa ne : « Kilifaani, mbaar a mi haa ? » <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓoyi ɓek yaahiŋ ɗe na so ŋ booli, a yi na hee so eɗndohe. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey kurke nga findi Fiis ci woyoha nga ɗe, waaye mas ɓoyi na hee ɗe eɗndohe ŋ ɓi sang ɗe, ini ngisohee ŋ ɓoyeem weɗ ne a rimkuu. » <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Jaarra, Yudaa yi eɗndohan ɗe meeksohha an : « Jangɗohohi, mbaar a mi haa ? » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « A fu woya ! »<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tufkiɗiɗ kañam naandsukohaa ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Wa ɓa ñame, Yeesu ɓayya mbuuru ; wi a corkiɗ Kooh po ƴutta a poɓtohhaa, a eɗta taalubeeci wa, a woosa ne : « Ɓayaat ɗu ñam, wii wa faaniŋ ngo. » <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Ƴutta a ɓayya kaas ; wi a corkiɗ Kooh po ƴutta, a woosa ne : « Ɓayaat ɗu an nga, ɗu jen, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>wii wa ñif miŋ ngo, ñif miŋ Ambtiɗohi, wi aamu wuu ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ne bakaaɗ ci ɗaasohu. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa : Ini kooɗoh woti, ŋ heyɗi anisse masmiŋ reseñii po mbaɗna ŋ anissan na ɗu wi asi ŋ Nguuraŋ Baabiŋ ngo. »<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ taaski Piyeer na hee ɗe taaske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Wa ɓa ƴut ŋ kañam ka po ɓa ƴeekka ƴeek ciŋ Sabuur, ci hun na feeti, ɓa pulla, ɓa kaɗeeɗa Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca. <verse eid="MAT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Weɗ Yeesu woyoh ɓa ne : « Ŋ weki woti, ɗu jen, ɗu hey yo faɗe sagu ini rahsan ndo. Laam Fiis ci woyiɗ ne : “ Ŋ hey laɓe niiɗohi, mbaal ciŋ gati pasarkoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sakriya 13:7</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Waaye ŋ hultiɗu po ƴut ɗah, ŋ hey ɗu adge Galile. »<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Piyeer kooɗta woo ka, a woosa ne : « Ali ɓooɓi jen faɗ ɗa, mi, ŋ faɗanɗi ɗa muk ! » <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ñam woo ɗa wa te wa keeh, weki woti bala siiki leehkan ɗah, fu hey yo taaske waas kaahay. » <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Ali nik ne ŋ kaanan kaan na ɗa sah, ŋ taaskanɗi ɗa. » Taalubeeci ɓinooɓi jen nammba woo ɗaa.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Yeesu hunnda na ɓa, kaɗeeɗa po reesa ɗiska na woyse Getsemane, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoofaat ndii po ŋ kaɗ kiima Kooh nden, ŋ hay. » <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>A ɓayndohha Piyeer na kuɓuuciŋ Sebede kanak ci, a kaɗta ƴissuut, a raakka yeg-yeg miskiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ce, a jaahiɗta. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗiski wa nik ndii faaniŋ ngo goy goy po mi yii heeɗa kaane, tasaat ndii ɗu irin na so. »<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Wi a woo ineem, a ɓaatta kaɗ ƴissuut, a raɗukka ŋ kehƴi a kiimeeɗa Kooh an : « Baabiŋ ngo, wa min nik ɗah, kaasiŋ miskiɗii usaat to ! Waaye wa ka nik findi ŋ waaɗoh, wa nikaat findi fu waaɗoh. » <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Wi a dokuk ŋ taalubeeci kaahay ci, a raakka ɓa neeheeɗa, a woosa Piyeer ne : « Ɗu minɗi sah irin na so ini ree wahtu ! <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Kinaat neeh, kiimaat Kooh a ndengiɗ ɗu po ɗu keenuu ŋ fiir ; waaɗ-waaɗi wii nga waaye faan ci raakɗi hatil. »<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>A kaɗissa waasi kanakɗoh a kiimissa Kooh an : « Baabiŋ ngo, nik ne kaasii minɗi coot feeh ŋ anɗaa ɗah, wa raakohaat findi fu waaɗoh. » <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Wa a dokkis nga ɓa, a raakissa ɓa neeheeɗa, raak ɓa pani'uuɗ po has ciŋ ɓa aaykohha.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>A faɗta ɓa ndeem, a usissa ƴissuut, a kiimissa waasi kaahayɗoh, a woyissa ina a woye. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Ƴutta a kaɗissa ŋ taalubeeca a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓii neeh, ɗu ɓii iɗsiɗuk ! Weɗɗi, ɗiski wa nik wahtuuni reyiɗ, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi faɗuuɗ ŋ yaah ciŋ bakaaɗoh ci. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Kurkaat ɓoo kaɗ. Markaat ! Yi joy yo eɗndoh a yi ! »<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ambuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Wi a na woye ineem, Yudaa, yino ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), reyeeɗa. A hunee na mboolo ganaaykiɗ ndang na ndooɗ. E kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na yakak caŋ cuuɓa ɓeɗ tuuƴee ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Raak Yudaa woyiɗ ɓa ne : « Ɓoyi maa hee foone inhaat ne a yi ; ambaat ɗe ! » <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Jaarra, a reɓpa ŋ Yeesu a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu tum na Jangɗohohi ? » A foonnda ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ƴaariŋ ngo, tuma ini ɓay ɗa. »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"tuma ini ɓay ɗa" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "wee tah ɗa nik ndii ?"</char></note> Weɗ ƴaaɓa reɓoh, ɓa ammba ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Ƴaar ɓaah ŋ ɓa nikee na Yeesu fuurra ndangiŋ ɗe, a ƴoɓpa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ ñaam caŋ seeƴkiɗoha yakka wa hennda ŋ nofiŋ ɗe, wa nguɗtaa. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Dokna ndangi ŋ ɗiska wa nike ; ɓooɓi na ape na ndang jen, a ndang apan ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Fu liiɓ wii ne ŋ minɗi ɓeeɗuk Baabiŋ ngo e ? Ŋ ɓeeɗuk ɗe ɗah, a hey yo woosohe win-win ɓi junni junni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ɓi junni junni" : ŋ Fiis ci ndii, gerek woo ne : "<char style="tl">lesiyong</char> malaaka ndaŋkiyaah na kanak". <char style="tl">Lesiyong</char>, ŋ ɓi Rom ɗeɓgaan weɗ soldaar junni junni.</char></note> malaaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Ŋ tuma ɗah, kon in ci Fiis ci woo raakohan na ? Fiis ci ceɗ woo ne in ci joy nikoh an. »<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Jaarra Yeesu woosa mboolnda ne : « Ɗu hayiɗ na ndooɗ na ndang findi taamboh rok ne ɗu amb mbo. Moona Kooh-nu-wiis ŋ nikee ɓoofiɗ ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> jangɗoheeɗa te ɗu ambɗi so. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Waaye in cii jen raakiɗ ne in ci Fiis ciŋ woosuuɗ ci woo raak. » Weɗ taalubeeci jen faɗoh ɗe ndeem, ɓa saandohha.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ saangnaŋ atte'oh ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Ɓooɓa ambee Yeesu ɓa ɓay ɗe kahan Kayif seeƴkiɗoha yakka, wa raak jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi na yakak ca cohiɗ nga. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Piyeer nikee ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe usiɗ ŋ finhoora po findi a reyoh kahan seeƴkiɗoha yakka, a aassa, a ɓooffa na surgaaca ŋ leero kahna ne a marak findi wa mirndohan.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na ɓooɓa ɓinooɓa ɓaah ŋ <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel">saangnaŋ yakak caŋ Israayel</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:59 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaŋ Yeesu, a seeƴkiɗohi yakki adgohee wa, wa nikee a yi na ɓi wil ɗe, na ɓi yakak ŋ kur ka, na jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi. Ɓooɓeem ɓeɗ meeɗ coh ne ɓa atte'ee ɓooɓi ɗal ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waasiŋ Musaa. Ɓa mineen ambɗuk ɓo' waaye ɓa mineeɗi ɗe apoot ne ɓa hot ne a joy joy apu ɗah, ɓa meeɗ ɗe ɓay ŋ atte'oh ci nikiɗ <char style="w">Rom</char> ŋ ndaam.</char></note> jen waakeeɗa seede leyoh ne ɓa raak ini tah ɓa min apɗuk Yeesu, <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>waaye ɓa raakɗi ini ɓa etoh, ali nik ne leyoh laayiɗ nikee seede'eeɗa woo raakaaɗi nga ɗe sah. Ŋ mirndaani kanak hayya <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>woosa ne : « Ƴaarii woyiɗ ne a miniɗ yahroh Kahniŋ Kooh, a taɓaha ŋ neeh kaahay. »<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Teemb ndeem, seeƴkiɗoha yakka kurukka, woosa Yeesu ne : « Fu heyɗi lofe ali in ŋ in ci ɓooɓi na yambee ɗa e ? » <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Yeesu ɗekka teɗ. Seeƴkiɗoha yakka woosa ɗe ne : « Mi yii meekis ɗah, ŋ tiikiŋ Koohi na pese, woya ɓoo andi a fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ! »<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fu woyiɗa ! Te ɓaat nga ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ini kooɗoh ndii ɗu hey hote Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ɓoofiɗ ŋ ñaahmiŋ doolndiŋ Kooh, ɗu hey ɗe hote ŋ ɗafuk ɓi eel, ca haytohee ɗe. »<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Weɗ seeƴkiɗoha yakka faaroh kulɓaacaŋ ɗe haf ce, ne a teeɓoh ne wa woo uupiɗ. A woosa ɓa ne : « A ɗaliɗ Kooh ! Ɓoo etohis seede ye ? Ɗu kerhootiɗ ɗali a ɗal Kooh kotii ! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>A joy ye tumu ? » Ɓa loffa ne : « A apaah apu ! » <verse eid="MAT 26:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Ɓa tuhseeɗa fikiiriŋ ɗe, ɓa laɓeeɗa ɗe kumah, ɓum laɓeeɗa ɗe paɗ <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>woyeeɗa ne : « Fu yi Mucɗohi Gapohse ! Nik ne fu woosuuɗ ɗah, woya ɓoo ɓoyi laɓ ɗa ! »<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer taaskiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Waam raak Piyeer ɓoofiɗ ŋ leero kahna, komaaki cafaƴ reɓpa nga ɗe, a ɓaahee ŋ ñaam ca, a woosa ɗe ne : « Na ɗa, fu namee nik na Yeesu ƴaariŋ Galileeci. » <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Waaye a taasukka ŋ fikiiɓa jen an : « Ŋ inahɗi ini fu waaɗ woo. »<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Wa a yurhee ŋ ɓakaŋ nguɓu kahna, ñaam ɓitiɓ wiiriis nammba ɗe hot woosa ɓooɓa nikee ndaam ne : « Ƴaarii nikee na Yeesu ƴaariŋ Nasareet ci. » <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>A nammba taaskis na giñ an : « Ŋ inahɗi ƴaarii ! »<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Wa degga ƴissuut ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ndaam reɓpa ŋ Piyeer, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Wa wooriɗ ne fu nam ɓaah ŋ ƴaaɓiŋ ɗe, woyohaaɗiŋ ɗa sah teeɓohiɗa. » <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Piyeer nikka nga, giñeeɗa ne : « Ndaa Kooh apaat to ! Ƴaarii ŋ inahɗi ɗe ! »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">A reehiɗɗi woo, siika leehukka. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Weɗ Piyeer naandsukoh woo kaŋ Yeesu an : « Bala siiki leehkan ɗah, fu hey yo taaske waas kaahay. » Piyeer pulla, fuɗeeɗa fuɗ miskiɗ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Kilifaaca cohissiɗ ne ɓa apɗuk Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa, kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na yakak caŋ cuuɓi cohha ne ɓa min apɗuk Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Ɓa tokɗukka ɗe, ɓa ɓayya ɗe, ɓa eɗta ɗe Pilaat, goornooraŋ kur ka.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yudaa harkiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Ŋ ineem, Yudaa hotta ne Yeesu yi a eɗndohee hey apse, inwaaso ammba ɗe, a kaɗta ŋ kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na yakak ca, a wikka ɓa haalsa, hanjar ca ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30) ca. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ bakaaɗiɗ, ŋ degiɗ ɓoyi tumɗi in ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗu ne a apu ! »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Waaye ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Waas ɓoo ye nga ? A fu inah. » <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Weɗ Yudaa njafoh hanjar ca ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a pulla, a ɓayya niy, a kaɗta harka.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca parahha ca, ɓa woosa ne : « Wii, wa candoom ñif aamkiɗ. Ɓoo minɗaa ɓek ŋ koporiŋ Kahniŋ Kooh. » <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Ɓa cohha ɓa kerhiɗohha ŋ woo, ɓa ɓayya kopor ka, ɓa romohha wa yohnaŋ mahoha, acoha ɓooɓa genɗi kur ka. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Weɗ tah yohna teekuusa po woti, yohniŋ ñif mi.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Taambohha ndeem, ini woosuuɗi Yeremi woyee raakka an : « Ɓa ɓayiɗ hanjar ca ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30) ca, ineem weɗ a car ŋ Israayel ci. <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Ɓa eɗohiɗ ca ne ɓa rom yohniŋ mahohi, findi Heɗ ɓoo woyohee so wa. »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓi aaya laayiɗ huniɗ, woyiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ woo kii : <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Sakriya 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:2-3">Yeremi 18:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32:6-15</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ fiki Pilaat goornoora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, wa a ɓayu ŋ fiki Pilaat goornoora, yeem meekissa ɗe ne : « A fu buuriŋ Yawuut ci e ? » Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fu woyiɗa. » <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Waaye a lofɗi ali in ŋ in ca kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na yakak ca yambee ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Pilaat woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ woo ne : fu kerahɗi in ci ɓa na woyɗee ɗa jen e ? » <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Waaye Yeesu lofɗi ɗe ŋ ali in, ineem feyya goornoora lool.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> reyeen ɗah, goornoor meeɗ ɓa meeɗ faɗsiɗ ambuuɗ yino, e mboolndi meeɗ ɗe tan. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Waam raak ɓa raakiɗ ƴaar inhuuɗ ya taƴsee ŋ kasoona, a teeksee [Yeesu] Barabaas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Mboolnda jen nikee cohiɗ ŋ ɗiskaŋ Pilaat, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu waaɗ ne ŋ faɗsiɗ ɗu ɓa, [Yeesu] Barabaas wala Yeesu yi na woyse <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> ? » <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>A inheen ne waaɗa ɓooɓa waaɗ Yeesu, weɗ tah kilifaaca degga ɗe ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Wa Pilaat ɓoof ŋ ngelohaana a atte'eeɗa, ɓitiice woosohha woo kii nga ɗe an : « Kina raakɗoh ali in na ƴaari yurhiɗeem, woti ŋ heeƴiɗ heeƴ miskiɗ nga so saguuce. » <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na yakak ca hiireeɗa mboolnda ne ɓa woyaat ne Barabaas faɗsassaat, Yeesu apu.<verse eid="MAT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Goornoor kooɗissa woo ka woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu waaɗ ne ŋ faɗsiɗ ɗu ya ɓa ŋ ƴaaɓi kanak cii ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Ɓa loffa ne : « Barabaas. »<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilaat woosa ɓa ne : « Moo ŋ tuman Yeesu yi na woyse Kiristaani na ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Ɓa jen ɓa woosa ne : « A daaƴsaat ŋ kurwaa ! »<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « A haɓiɗ ye in moɗaaɗi ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ɓa ɓaatta woo ŋ ɗafka ne : « A daaƴsaat ŋ kurwaa ! »<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Ɓa uupeeɗa nga uup ɗuuɗ, tahha po Pilaat hotta ne a miniɗɗi ɓa in, weɗ a ɓayoh masuɓ, a ɓohñukka ŋ fikiiɓa, a woosa ne : « Inii, ŋ hooliɗ nga, ŋ ɓaahɗi ŋ aami ɗu aaman ñif miŋ ƴaarii. A ɗu inah naa ! »<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe jen ne : « Hey ɗah wa ñaakiɗ ɓoo na kuɓuuciŋ ɓoo ! »<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Pilaat faɗsiɗta ɓa Barabaas, a laɓɗukka Yeesu leraw po ƴutta, a eɗohha ɗe ne a daaƴu ŋ kurwaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Soldaar ci njembtiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Weɗ soldaar caŋ goornoora ɓayoh Yeesu ŋ leero kahna, ɓa willa ɗe findi ɓa hend jen. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Ɓa wolla kulɓaacaŋ ɗe, ɓa ɓekiɗta ɗe palto ruumind coy. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Ɓa teɗiɗta ɗe mbahne-buur, ɓa teɗohhaa ñapir, ɓa deggaa ŋ hafiŋ ɗe, ɓa degiɗta ɗe ndooɗ caaɓees ŋ yaahiŋ ɗe ñaahmi, ƴutta ɓa ƴekɗeeɗa ɗe, ɓa njembteeɗa ɗe an : « Ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗa buuriŋ Yawuut ci ! » <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Ɓa tuhseeɗa ɗe, ɓa ɓayya ndooɗaŋ caaɓsa, ɓa laɓeeɗa ɗe wa ŋ haf. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Wa ɓa njembit ɗe po ƴutta, ɓa wolla paltoona ɓa ɓekɗee ɗe, ɓa ɓekɗissa ɗe kulɓaacaŋ ɗe, ɓa ɓayeeɗa ɗe ne ɓa daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu daaƴuuɗ ŋ kurwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Wa soldaar ca pulee kur ka, ɓa coh na ƴaar gen Sireen teeku Simong, ɓa junnga ɗe ne a deguk kurwaaniŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Wa ɓa ree ɗiska na woyse <char style="tl">Golgota</char>, wa tokis "Ƴoh-haf", <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>ɓa eɗta Yeesu biiñ ambsohuuɗ na in aayiɗ ne a an, Yeesu ƴoohhaa, a waaɗɗi an.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Wa ɓa daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa po ƴutta, ɓa piilohha kulɓaacaŋ ɗe ne ɓa paysoh ca, <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>ɓa ɓooffa, ɓa niiɗeeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Ɓa daaƴeen in, wa tiimmba hafiŋ ɗe ne ɓa teeɓoh ini tah ɗe apu. Inii weɗ ɓa fiisee nga : « Yii a Yeesu buuriŋ Yawuut ci. » <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Nguɗndukohoh kanak daaƴseen na ɗe, yii lahha ɗe yaah-ñaahum, yi tas lahha ɗe yaah-sing.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Ɓooɓa taambee ŋ ɗiska njembteeɗa ɗe, ɓa kuɗteeɗa haf, ɓa ɓaseeɗa ɗe <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>an : « Ngec ! Fu yi woyee ne, fu hey yahrohe Kahniŋ Kooh, fu taɓahisa ŋ neeh kaahay, mucɗa haf fu ! Nik ne a fu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, ruhsa ŋ kurwaani. »<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na jangɗohoh caŋ wa na yakak ca nameeɗa ɗe njembit an : <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>« A mucɗiɗ ɓinooɓi, a minɗi muciɗ haf ce ! Nik ne a yi buuriŋ Israayel ɗah, a ruhsaat ŋ kurwaani win-win te ɓoo hey ɗe kose ! <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>A wik haf ce Kooh, nik ne Kooh waaɗiɗ ɗe ɗah, a naafaat ɗe kotii. A woo ne a yi Kuɓkiŋ Kooh haa e ! » <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Nguɗndukohoh ca daaƴsee na ɗe nameeɗa ɗe ɓasoh ɗaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kiŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Ina kooɗoh ŋ njooloor, kehƴi jen nikka ŋ ñuus ini ree wahtu kaahay. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Wa wahtuuca kaahay ca hee reehe, Yeesu leehukka ŋ ɗafka an : « <char style="it">Elii, Elii, lema sabahtani ? </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Sabuur 22:2</ref></char></note> » Wa tokis "Koohiŋ ngo, Koohiŋ ngo, wa ye tah fu faɗta so ?"<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ ɓa nikee ŋ ndaam kerahhaa, ɓa woosa ne : « A na ɓeeɗke <char style="w">Ilyas</char> ! » <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Yino nga ɓa arra nup, ɓayya daah, a hooƴcaa ŋ masuɓ raakiɗ <char style="tl">bineegar</char>, a tokkaa ŋ lecem ndooɗ, a eɗta ɗe ne a an. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Waaye ɓinooɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Faɗa ɓoo marak andi Ilyas hey ɗe hee hirpe ! »<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yeesu leehkissa ŋ ɗafka, a nguɗta.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Teemb ndeem, ridoona ɗasɗe <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaanaŋ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:51 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: marka <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ŋ tiik ci inhassaaɗiici ; ɗisik ceem, ca nikee ɓak nga. Waaye cum ɗah, e taɓahaŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh jen na woyse Ɗiski Hooliɗi, wala taɓaha na ina wila jen.</char></note> Kahnaŋ Kooh faarukka tareet ini kooɗoh ɗafka po kehƴa, kehƴi yoondɗukka, atoh ci yakak ci ɓessa. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Ruy-ruy ci rangsukka, <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh</char> laayiɗ ɓi inah ne ɓa kaaneen, hultiɗuusa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Ɓa pulohha ruy-ruy ca. Ŋ finho hultaŋ ɗe, ɓa aassa ŋ ɗooƴ Yerusalem, ɓa teeɓukka ɓo' laayiɗ.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Soldaar ca niiɗee Yeesu na ƴaara adgohee ɓa, hotta ina raak jen, na findi kehƴi yoondɗukoh, ɓa feyuusa keeh-keeh, ɓa woosa ne : « Wa keeh ne a nikee Kuɓu Kooh. »<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Ɓitiɓ laayiɗ nikee nga, ɓa cangtiɗukka usiɗ, ɓa markeeɗa. Ɓitiɓ ceem ñaakɗohoh Yeesu Galile ne ɓa taambkoh ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Ɓii ɓaahee nga ɓa : Mari Makdala, Mari yaayiŋ Saak na Suseef, na yaayiŋ Saak na Saaŋ, kuɓuuciŋ Sebede.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓekuuɗ ŋ ruy-ruy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Wa niina ree, ƴaar teeku Suseef hayya. A nikee ɓo' raakiɗ, a genee Arimate te a ɓaahee ŋ taalubeeciŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>A kaɗta ŋ Pilaat, a meekissa ɗe fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu, Pilaat nakohha ne a eɗsaata.<verse eid="MAT 27:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Suseef ɓayyaa, a ullaa na uuf <char style="tl"><char style="w">leeŋ</char></char> hooliɗ, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>a ɓekkaa ŋ ruy-ruyi a haɓɗiɗee haf ce, ruy-ruy as acuuɗ ŋ hur atoh. Ƴutta, a pilnginnda atoh yakak, a ranngaa, a cootta. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Mari Makdala na Mari yi yinoori nikee nga ɓoofiɗ, yurhiɗkohiɗ na ruy-ruya.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Niiɗiŋ ruyiŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Ŋ mbeha taamb ŋ reehɗohaanaŋ mbeha na kooɗkohse, kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca hunnda, ɓa kaɗta ŋ Pilaat, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>ɓa woosa ɗe ne :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:63">« Kilifaani, ɓoo naandsukiɗ ne, wi ñaañohohii na pese, a woyiɗ ne : “ Ŋ kaan po wa raak neeh kaahay ɗah, ŋ hey hulte. ” <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Mbaa nakoha ruy-ruya niiɗu po neeh ci kaahay ci coot, ne taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗuu roka fiɗaafaŋ ɗe, ɓa woyuu ɓooɓi ne a hultiɗ. Kon a leyi mirndoh weem uupan moɗaaɗi wa koc. »<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilaat woosa ɓa ne : « Soldaar ɓeɗɗi, kaɗaat ɗu niiɗa ruy-ruya findi ɗu waaɗoh. » <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Ɓa kaɗta, ɓa kooɗukka findi ɓaa hee wa niiɗohe, ɓa reewwa atoh fa ŋ nguɓaŋ wa, ɓa tummba nga mandargaani teeɓoh ne wa ranguuɗ, ɓa tufkiɗta soldaar ca ŋ ɗiska.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu hultiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Wa <char style="w" lemma="mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse">mbeha na iɗsiɗkohse</char> coot, ŋ wiisaaɗiinaŋ mbehi koc, Mari Makdala na Mari yi yinoori, kaɗta marka ruy-ruya.<verse eid="MAT 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Ɗekka po kehƴi yoondɗukka keeh-keeh ; malaaka Heɗ ɓoo pulohha Eel ci, a kaɗta pilngina atoh fa rangee wa, a ɓooffa ŋ ɗafuk wa. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>A melciɗeeɗa findi meleñ, kulɓaaciŋ ɗe nikka yaanow tar. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Soldaar ca niiɗee ruy-ruya saakɗoheeɗa sagu tiit, ɓa mannda na kaaniɗ.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Malaakaana woosa ɓitiɓ ca ne : « Ɗu, kinaat tiit, ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu na marke Yeesu yi daaƴsee ŋ kurwaa. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>A nikɗi ndii, a hultiɗuuɗ findi a woyohee wa. Hayaat ɗu marak ɗiski a faansee, <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>te araat kaɗ ɗu woya taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne, a hultiɗuuɗ, a yaa adug ɗu Galile, ɗu na hee ɗe hotohe ndaam ; weɗɗeem, ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa. »<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Weɗ ɓitiɓ ca aroh kurkoh ŋ ruy-ruya, ɓa feyuusa waaye, ɓa summba keeh-keeh, ɓa nuppa ne ɓa woyaa wa taalubeeca.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Wa ɓa kaɗee, weɗ Yeesu hayoh cohe na ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu tum na ? » Ɓa reɓpa nga ɗe, ɓa ammba kot ciŋ ɗe, ɓa ƴekka ne ɓa ñaamuk ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Kinaat neƴƴoh ; kaɗaat ɗu woya ɓooɓiŋ ngo ne ɓa kaɗaat Galile, ɓa hotohan ndo ndaam. »<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Wa ɓa kaɗe, ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ ɓa niiɗee ruy-ruya kaɗta kur ka, naandsukka kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca ini raak jen. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Wa ɓeem coh na yakak ca, ɓa kerhiɗohha na ɓa ŋ woo, ɓa puliɗta kopor laayiɗ, ɓa eɗtaa ɓa niiɗee ruy-ruya. <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>Ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Woyaat ne, a taalubeeciŋ ɗe tel ɗu nga na wek, raak ɗu neehiɗ, ɓa rokka fiɗaafi, <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>te goornoor keraha ɗah, ɓoo hey woye na ɗe, ineem kanaat ɗu jaahiɗ. »<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Ɓa ɓayya kopora, ɓa tumohha findi ɓa woyohu, woo keem pasarkohha ŋ ɗooƴ Yawuut ci po woti.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tuuƴiɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗe ŋ adinaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Taalubeeca ndaŋkiyaah na yinooca (11) kaɗta Galile ŋ tangoora Yeesu woye. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Wa ɓa hot ɗe, ɓa ñaamkeeɗa ɗe, waaye raakka ɓi liiɓsiɗohee nga ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Weɗ Yeesu reɓoh nga ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Eel ci na kehƴi jen deguuɗ ŋ yaah ciŋ ngo.<verse eid="MAT 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Kaɗaat ŋ cuuɓ ciŋ adinaani jen, ɗu tum ɓooɓi taalube, ɗu ɓokit ɓa ŋ tiikiŋ Baabi na <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>ɗu jangiɗ ɓa po ɓa taambiɗ nakoh ci ŋ eɗ ɗu jen. Te ambaat ne : Ŋ hey nike na ɗu Kooh-nu-wiis po mbaɗna Adina reehan. »<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
